{"id": "0", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A woman in a pink suit gives a speech at a podium while a crowd claps in applause.", "pred": "A woman in a pink blazer speaks at a podium under a spotlight, her speech immediately followed by loud, sustained applause from an unseen audience.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A woman in a pink blazer speaks at a podium under a spotlight, her speech immediately followed by loud, sustained applause from an unseen audience.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA woman in a pink blazer speaks at a podium into a microphone in a dimly lit room, her speech followed by loud, sustained applause from an unseen audience, with a partially visible sign behind her.\nA woman with blonde hair, wearing a light pink blazer, stands at a dark wooden podium with two microphones, speaking. She gestures with her right hand. To her left, a white sign with partial black text is visible. The room is dimly lit with a spotlight on the wall behind her. Her clear speech is immediately followed by loud, rhythmic, and sustained applause from multiple unseen individuals, indicating a live audience.\nThe speaker is wearing a light pink, double-breasted blazer and has blonde, shoulder-length hair. She is standing behind a dark wooden podium with two microphones. To her left, a white sign with partial black text is visible, showing fragments like \"S NON\" and \"GO\". The background consists of a plain, warm-toned wall, illuminated by a spotlight creating a circular bright spot. The woman is actively speaking and gesturing with her right hand. As she finishes her sentence, the audio transitions to a loud, dense, and sustained applause from a large audience, which continues for several seconds.\n\nA woman in a pink blazer speaks at a podium under a spotlight, her speech immediately followed by loud, sustained applause from an unseen audience.", "time_sec": 300.82, "generation_time_seconds": 169.7186, "selection_time_seconds": 127.7723, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 38.46, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "1", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The wind whispers through the leaves as a leaf blower hums, while a black snake slithers in the grass near a tree.", "pred": "A black, cylindrical trimmer head with spinning blades cuts through thick green weeds and grass, with a person's hand holding the silver shaft visible as the loud, high-pitched buzzing of the engine is heard.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A black, cylindrical trimmer head with spinning blades cuts through thick green weeds and grass, with a person's hand holding the silver shaft visible as the loud, high-pitched buzzing of the engine is heard.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA close-up shot shows a person's hand using a grass trimmer with a black guard to cut green weeds and tall grass near a wooden post, with the loud, high-pitched buzzing of the trimmer's engine audible.\nA dark, cylindrical cutting head with visible rotating blades is actively engaged in cutting dense green vegetation. The motion of the blades is implied by the chopping of leaves and stems. The operator's hand is visible on the shaft of the tool, which is the same object producing the loud, high-pitched buzzing sound heard in the audio.\nA black, cylindrical trimmer head with spinning blades is cutting through thick green weeds and grass, with a person's hand holding the silver shaft visible as the loud, high-pitched buzzing of the engine is heard.\n\nA black, cylindrical trimmer head with spinning blades cuts through thick green weeds and grass, with a person's hand holding the silver shaft visible as the loud, high-pitched buzzing of the engine is heard.", "time_sec": 236.86, "generation_time_seconds": 151.346, "selection_time_seconds": 84.5381, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 11.76, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "2", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A woman speaks softly as water splashes and trickles and she sitting on a large rock in the middle of a lake .", "pred": "A person in a red and black vest touches a large, wet rock in the water as waves lap around it, while a woman speaks in Russian about recharging her energy at a sacred place.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A person in a red and black vest touches a large, wet rock in the water as waves lap around it, while a woman speaks in Russian about recharging her energy at a sacred place.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA person wearing a red and black vest stands on a large rock in the water, touching its wet, textured surface as water laps around it; simultaneously, a woman's voice speaks in Russian, describing the location as a sacred place where she is recharging her energy.\n{\n\"speaker\": \"woman\",\n\"language\": \"Russian\",\n\"content\": \"energetika, silneishaya, sakralnoe mesto. I ya zaryazhaus' energiyey. I ego zaryazhaus' svoey energiyey. Vmeste my.\"\n}\nA person wearing a red and black vest stands on a large, textured rock in the water, touching it with their right hand; water is lapping around the base of the rock, and a woman speaks in Russian about recharging her energy at a sacred place.\n\nA person in a red and black vest touches a large, wet rock in the water as waves lap around it, while a woman speaks in Russian about recharging her energy at a sacred place.", "time_sec": 216.022, "generation_time_seconds": 149.5044, "selection_time_seconds": 66.0723, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 31.25, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "3", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a kitchen, a man  with a glass of water in hand opens the door of a refrigerator, speaking amidst rattling and banging with a high frequency ringing.", "pred": "A man in a dark shirt opens a white cabinet, takes out a clear glass, and turns to face forward while speaking, as the resonant slam of a heavy glass object being set down is heard just after he finishes his sentence.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A man in a dark shirt opens a white cabinet, takes out a clear glass, and turns to face forward while speaking, as the resonant slam of a heavy glass object being set down is heard just after he finishes his sentence.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA man in a black shirt opens a white cupboard in a kitchen, takes out a clear glass, and turns to face forward while speaking.\nThe man, wearing a dark long-sleeved shirt, opens a white upper cabinet, reaches inside, and retrieves a transparent drinking glass from a shelf.\nA man in a dark shirt opens a white cabinet and removes a clear glass, then turns towards the camera while speaking, as the resonant slam of a heavy glass object being set down is heard just after he finishes his sentence.\n\nA man in a dark shirt opens a white cabinet, takes out a clear glass, and turns to face forward while speaking, as the resonant slam of a heavy glass object being set down is heard just after he finishes his sentence.", "time_sec": 184.485, "generation_time_seconds": 124.1159, "selection_time_seconds": 60.0411, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 18.6, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "4", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a tiled bathroom, a person lifts the toilet lid as tapping noises are heard, followed by the sound of a toilet flushing.", "pred": "\\boxed{\\text{A hand presses a toilet flush lever, causing a powerful gushing and swirling sound of water as the bowl empties and refills.}}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "\\boxed{\\text{A hand presses a toilet flush lever, causing a powerful gushing and swirling sound of water as the bowl empties and refills.}}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA toilet is flushed, its bowl swirling with water, as a person's hand presses the flush lever on the wall.\nFirst, I will identify the primary actions and objects in the video.\n Then, I will analyze the sequence of sounds.\n Finally, I will link the visual actions to the corresponding sounds to form a coherent description.\nA hand pushes a toilet flush lever, triggering a powerful gushing and swirling sound of water as the bowl empties and refills.\n\nA hand presses a toilet flush lever, causing a powerful gushing and swirling sound of water as the bowl empties and refills.\n\n\\boxed{\\text{A hand presses a toilet flush lever, causing a powerful gushing and swirling sound of water as the bowl empties and refills.}}", "time_sec": 173.329, "generation_time_seconds": 114.7881, "selection_time_seconds": 57.6641, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 14.29, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "5", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A person in white gloves pours orange liquid from a plastic bottle while a series of compressed air sprays and a motor hums in the background.", "pred": "A gloved hand sprays a fine orange mist from a silver aerosol can into an open orange plastic bottle, accompanied by a continuous hissing sound.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A gloved hand sprays a fine orange mist from a silver aerosol can into an open orange plastic bottle, accompanied by a continuous hissing sound.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA gloved hand sprays a fine orange mist from a silver aerosol can into an open orange plastic bottle, accompanied by the distinct, high-pitched hissing sound of the spray being dispensed.\nThe scene features a gloved hand holding a silver aerosol can, actively spraying a fine orange mist into an open orange plastic bottle, with the continuous, high-pitched hissing of the spray audible.\nFirst, observe the primary action in the video: a gloved hand is holding a silver aerosol can, which is pointed into the opening of an orange plastic bottle.\n Next, analyze the visual result of this action: a fine, orange mist is being released from the can and directed into the bottle, indicating the spraying of a liquid substance.\n Then, listen to the audio: a continuous, hissing sound is present, which is consistent with the sound of a pressurized aerosol can being sprayed.\n Finally, integrate the visual and audio evidence: the hissing sound is directly produced by the spraying action seen in the video.\n Therefore\n\nA gloved hand sprays a fine orange mist from a silver aerosol can into an open orange plastic bottle, accompanied by a continuous hissing sound.", "time_sec": 242.14, "generation_time_seconds": 149.778, "selection_time_seconds": 91.6793, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 28.57, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "6", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The tribal drums beat as a green frog sits in a natural environment, surrounded by the sounds of shuffling footsteps, chirping crickets, and wet dirt.", "pred": "A spotted green frog with red eyes moves on a circular path in a digital landscape, croaking and making movement sounds.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A spotted green frog with red eyes moves on a circular path in a digital landscape, croaking and making movement sounds.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA green frog with brown spots is shown in a digital landscape with trees, mountains, and a circular track.\n The frog's mouth opens as it makes various movements and sounds.\n The background is a computer-generated environment.\n The audio consists of the frog croaking and the sound of its movement.\nA spotted green frog moves in a digital landscape with trees and mountains, making croaking sounds and the sound of its movement.\nThe frog has prominent red-orange eyes and a light-colored underside, its body exhibiting a bumpy texture consistent with warts.\n It is positioned on a circular, paved surface, suggesting a designated area within the game world.\n The croaking is distinct and clear, not muffled, indicating the microphone was close to the source.\n The sound of the frog's movements, possibly hopping or crawling, is synchronized with its on-screen actions.\n The environment, while digitally rendered, includes a variety of trees and mountain shapes in the background.\n The lighting is consistent with daytime, and the entire scene is a static camera view focused on the frog.\n The audio\n\nA spotted green frog with red eyes moves on a circular path in a digital landscape, croaking and making movement sounds.", "time_sec": 241.747, "generation_time_seconds": 148.741, "selection_time_seconds": 92.6161, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 20.0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "7", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A small dog sitting in a basket with a leash on the floor, accompanied by the sound of a person snoring.", "pred": "A fawn-colored pug with a black mask lies down in darkness, its head resting on a dark surface with a red edge, as a loud, rhythmic, low-frequency snoring sound is heard.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A fawn-colored pug with a black mask lies down in darkness, its head resting on a dark surface with a red edge, as a loud, rhythmic, low-frequency snoring sound is heard.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA fawn-colored pug with a black muzzle is lying down in darkness, its head resting on a dark surface with a red edge, as a loud, rhythmic, low-frequency buzzing sound is heard.\nFirst, I analyzed the visual component: the subject is a pug dog. I identified its physical characteristics, including its fawn coat and black facial mask. I then observed its posture, noting it was lying down in what appears to be a confined, dark space with a red border visible in the upper right. Next, I analyzed the audio component independently: the sound is a continuous, rhythmic, low-frequency buzzing or humming, not speech or animal noise. I then considered the spatial details from the audio, which suggest the sound is close to the recording device, likely coming from the pug itself as a form of vocalization.\nA close-up, low-light shot shows a fawn-colored pug with a black facial mask lying down, its head tilted up and resting on a dark surface with a red edge, while a loud, guttural, rhythmic snoring sound emanates from it.\n\nA fawn-colored pug with a black mask lies down in darkness, its head resting on a dark surface with a red edge, as a loud, rhythmic, low-frequency snoring sound is heard.", "time_sec": 246.847, "generation_time_seconds": 147.1406, "selection_time_seconds": 99.3791, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 13.33, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "8", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A red and blue helicopter landing on a runway as a small plane sits nearby.and some poles are visible.", "pred": "A blue, red, and white helicopter with \"PIPER\" text is on a paved surface, its main rotor spinning rapidly and its tail boom tilted upward, producing a loud, continuous, high-pitched whine.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A blue, red, and white helicopter with \"PIPER\" text is on a paved surface, its main rotor spinning rapidly and its tail boom tilted upward, producing a loud, continuous, high-pitched whine.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA blue, red, and white helicopter with \"PIPER\" text is on a paved surface, its main rotor spinning rapidly as its tail boom is tilted upward.\nThe continuous, loud, high-pitched whine of the helicopter's rotors is audible.\nThe main rotor is in motion, creating a powerful rotational noise consistent with the sound.\nThe tail boom's upward tilt is a key mechanical detail, indicating a specific configuration or action.\nThe sound is not of a stationary engine but is directly produced by the spinning rotor blades themselves.\nThe auditory and visual cues align perfectly, confirming the helicopter is actively operating.\n\nA blue, red, and white helicopter with \"PIPER\" text is on a paved surface, its main rotor spinning rapidly and its tail boom tilted upward, producing a loud, continuous, high-pitched whine.", "time_sec": 224.253, "generation_time_seconds": 143.311, "selection_time_seconds": 80.1907, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 17.14, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "9", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The roaring helicopter flies low over a building in the windy cityscape. and one man also visible.", "pred": "A white and yellow air ambulance helicopter, bearing the registration G-SMMU and a blue circular logo, is captured in a series of frames hovering in a grassy area before a modern multi-story building, accompanied by the loud, rhythmic roar of its turbine engine and the high-pitched whoosh of its rotating main rotor blades.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A white and yellow air ambulance helicopter, bearing the registration G-SMMU and a blue circular logo, is captured in a series of frames hovering in a grassy area before a modern multi-story building, accompanied by the loud, rhythmic roar of its turbine engine and the high-pitched whoosh of its rotating main rotor blades.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA white and yellow helicopter with the registration G-SMMU and a blue circular logo on its side is shown in a series of images, hovering in a grassy area in front of a modern multi-story building with a grey and blue facade and numerous windows, while the audio consists of the loud, powerful, and rhythmic sound of its jet engines and the distinct noise of its rotor blades cutting through the air, indicating it is actively flying and generating significant air displacement.\nThe visual shows a helicopter in a grassy area, not on a landing pad, confirming it is in flight or hovering. The registration G-SMMU and the blue circular logo, likely the Air Ambulance Service, identify its purpose. The building's modern design, with its grey and blue facade and uniform windows, suggests a hospital or institutional setting, consistent with an air ambulance landing zone. The audio's powerful, rhythmic engine and high-pitched rotor noise are characteristic of a turbine-powered helicopter in operation.\nA white and yellow air ambulance helicopter, bearing the registration G-SMMU and a blue circular logo, is captured in a series of frames hovering in a grassy area before a modern multi-story building, accompanied by the loud, rhythmic roar of its turbine engine and the high-pitched whoosh of its rotating main rotor blades.\n\nA white and yellow air ambulance helicopter, bearing the registration G-SMMU and a blue circular logo, is captured in a series of frames hovering in a grassy area before a modern multi-story building, accompanied by the loud, rhythmic roar of its turbine engine and the high-pitched whoosh of its rotating main rotor blades.", "time_sec": 280.096, "generation_time_seconds": 180.2533, "selection_time_seconds": 98.6779, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 8.51, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "10", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "As the sun sets, a very long train passes by with warning bells ringing and a honking horn.", "pred": "\\boxed{\\text{A long freight train with a dark locomotive and silver tanker cars moves right to left on tracks, its wheels generating a rhythmic clatter on the rails, accompanied by the loud, echoing blast of a multi-chime locomotive horn in the open air.}}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "\\boxed{\\text{A long freight train with a dark locomotive and silver tanker cars moves right to left on tracks, its wheels generating a rhythmic clatter on the rails, accompanied by the loud, echoing blast of a multi-chime locomotive horn in the open air.}}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA long freight train with silver tanker cars and a dark locomotive moves along tracks at dusk, accompanied by a loud, echoing train horn and the rhythmic clatter of steel wheels on rails.\nThe locomotive at the front is dark-colored, and the train is pulling a long line of silver tanker cars. The train is moving on a track next to a gravel embankment and a building, with a pale sky and hills in the background. Simultaneously, a loud, multi-chime locomotive horn sounds, followed by the metallic rhythmic clatter of wheels on tracks, indicating the train is in motion.\nA long freight train with a dark locomotive and silver tanker cars moves right to left on tracks, its wheels generating a rhythmic clatter on the rails, accompanied by the loud, echoing blast of a multi-chime locomotive horn in the open air.\n\nA long freight train with a dark locomotive and silver tanker cars moves right to left on tracks, its wheels generating a rhythmic clatter on the rails, accompanied by the loud, echoing blast of a multi-chime locomotive horn in the open air.\n\n\\boxed{\\text{A long freight train with a dark locomotive and silver tanker cars moves right to left on tracks, its wheels generating a rhythmic clatter on the rails, accompanied by the loud, echoing blast of a multi-chime locomotive horn in the open air.}}", "time_sec": 279.943, "generation_time_seconds": 164.6281, "selection_time_seconds": 114.2755, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 15.38, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "11", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": " A train horn blares, and a train passes by a road with a red traffic light and a gate with a sign.", "pred": "A closed railway crossing with lowered barriers and flashing red lights visually matches the audio of an approaching train horn and its subsequent passage.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A closed railway crossing with lowered barriers and flashing red lights visually matches the audio of an approaching train horn and its subsequent passage.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe scene shows a railway crossing with lowered red-and-white barriers and flashing red lights, while the audio features the distinct sound of a train approaching and then passing, confirming the visual warning system is active.\nThe visual scene shows a closed railway crossing with lowered barriers and flashing red lights, while the audio contains a prominent train horn and the sound of a moving train, confirming a real-time train approach.\n\\boxed{A closed railway crossing with lowered barriers and flashing red lights visually matches the audio of an approaching train horn and its subsequent passage.}\n\nA closed railway crossing with lowered barriers and flashing red lights visually matches the audio of an approaching train horn and its subsequent passage.", "time_sec": 226.795, "generation_time_seconds": 131.0777, "selection_time_seconds": 94.4917, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 21.43, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "12", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The roaring engine of an orange car fills the air as firefighters , creating a dramatic scene.", "pred": "An orange car with a blue flame decal performs a burnout, generating a large cloud of white tire smoke, as two firefighters in yellow turnout gear observe it from a distance while a loud, high-revving V8 engine roars and accelerates.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "An orange car with a blue flame decal performs a burnout, generating a large cloud of white tire smoke, as two firefighters in yellow turnout gear observe it from a distance while a loud, high-revving V8 engine roars and accelerates.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nAn orange car with a blue flame decal performs a burnout, producing a large cloud of white tire smoke, while two firefighters in yellow turnout gear observe it from a distance as a loud, high-revving V8 engine roars and accelerates.\nThe scene features a stationary orange car with a blue flame decal, from which a thick cloud of white tire smoke is being produced.\n Two individuals, identifiable as firefighters due to their yellow turnout gear, are in the foreground, observing the vehicle.\n The sound is a powerful, high-pitched engine with aggressive, rapid acceleration and a deep exhaust note, consistent with a modified V8 engine performing an aggressive burnout.\nThe car is stationary, as evidenced by the smoke being generated directly beneath it rather than trailing behind, indicating a tire burnout.\n The firefighters are standing still, observing the event from a safe distance.\n The audio confirms the vehicle is idling and revving aggressively, with the sound of tires screeching against the pavement.\n\nAn orange car with a blue flame decal performs a burnout, generating a large cloud of white tire smoke, as two firefighters in yellow turnout gear observe it from a distance while a loud, high-revving V8 engine roars and accelerates.", "time_sec": 400.163, "generation_time_seconds": 258.8735, "selection_time_seconds": 140.2239, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 21.62, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "13", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A small frog sits in the leaves of a green bush at night, surrounded by the soothing sounds of frogs and crickets chirping and croaking.", "pred": "A camouflaged frog with mottled brown and tan skin rests on vibrant green, dew-covered foliage, emitting a high-pitched, rhythmic, two-part croak.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A camouflaged frog with mottled brown and tan skin rests on vibrant green, dew-covered foliage, emitting a high-pitched, rhythmic, two-part croak.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA dark, textured frog with mottled brown and tan skin is positioned on vibrant green, dew-covered foliage.\nA frog with mottled brown and tan skin is camouflaged among vibrant green, dew-covered evergreen foliage.\nA high-pitched, rhythmic, trilling croak from a frog is heard, repeating in a distinct two-part pattern with a brief pause between each call.\n\nA camouflaged frog with mottled brown and tan skin rests on vibrant green, dew-covered foliage, emitting a high-pitched, rhythmic, two-part croak.", "time_sec": 288.903, "generation_time_seconds": 175.3935, "selection_time_seconds": 111.2253, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 13.33, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "14", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The man, humming and rustling, gives a thumbs up in front of the casino entrance and there are cars are parking.", "pred": "A bald man in a black jacket speaks to the camera in front of the illuminated Trump Taj Mahal casino entrance at night, with a low-frequency engine hum audible in the background.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A bald man in a black jacket speaks to the camera in front of the illuminated Trump Taj Mahal casino entrance at night, with a low-frequency engine hum audible in the background.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA bald man in a dark jacket stands before the ornate \"Trump Taj Mahal\" casino entrance at night, speaking to the camera as a continuous low-frequency hum from machinery or traffic is audible in the background.\nThe bald man in the dark jacket is positioned on a paved street in front of a large, illuminated casino building with a prominent sign reading \"TRUMP\" above \"TAJ MAHAL\". Several vehicles, including a silver minivan, are parked along the curb to the left. The man is speaking, and a continuous, low-frequency hum, likely from nearby traffic or machinery, is audible in the background.\nA bald man in a black puffer jacket stands on a paved area in front of the grand, illuminated entrance of the Trump Taj Mahal casino at night. He is speaking directly to the camera while the low-frequency hum of a vehicle engine is audible in the background.\n\nA bald man in a black jacket speaks to the camera in front of the illuminated Trump Taj Mahal casino entrance at night, with a low-frequency engine hum audible in the background.", "time_sec": 377.781, "generation_time_seconds": 221.635, "selection_time_seconds": 154.5584, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 26.67, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "15", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a snowy parking lot, the sound of a truck engine revving mixes with honking horns as people talk, while vehicles drive.", "pred": "\\boxed{\\text{A large off-road vehicle with oversized tires maneuvers aggressively on a snow-covered surface, kicking up plumes of snow and ice, while its powerful engine produces a deep, throaty roar that overpowers a series of short, sharp, and insistent high-pitched horn honks.}}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "\\boxed{\\text{A large off-road vehicle with oversized tires maneuvers aggressively on a snow-covered surface, kicking up plumes of snow and ice, while its powerful engine produces a deep, throaty roar that overpowers a series of short, sharp, and insistent high-pitched horn honks.}}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA large off-road vehicle with oversized tires maneuvers aggressively on a snow-covered surface, kicking up plumes of snow and ice, while its powerful engine produces a deep, throaty roar that overpowers a series of short, sharp, and insistent high-pitched horn honks.\nThe vehicle's tires are spinning and sliding, indicating a loss of traction on the snow.\n The sound of the engine is constant and very loud, suggesting the vehicle is being driven at high power.\n The horn sounds are short, sharp, and high-pitched, consistent with a warning or attention-getting signal.\n The overall scene is one of aggressive off-road driving in a challenging winter environment.\nA large off-road vehicle with oversized tires maneuvers aggressively on a snow-covered surface, kicking up plumes of snow and ice, while its powerful engine produces a deep, throaty roar that overpowers a series of short, sharp, and insistent high-pitched horn honks.\n\nA large off-road vehicle with oversized tires maneuvers aggressively on a snow-covered surface, kicking up plumes of snow and ice, while its powerful engine produces a deep, throaty roar that overpowers a series of short, sharp, and insistent high-pitched horn honks.\n\n\\boxed{\\text{A large off-road vehicle with oversized tires maneuvers aggressively on a snow-covered surface, kicking up plumes of snow and ice, while its powerful engine produces a deep, throaty roar that overpowers a series of short, sharp, and insistent high-pitched horn honks.}}", "time_sec": 387.793, "generation_time_seconds": 255.9766, "selection_time_seconds": 130.3903, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 4.55, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "16", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The rhythmic hum of a sewing machine as a person stitches fabric.", "pred": "A person guides a grey and yellow strip into a silver sewing machine, which produces a continuous, rapid, metallic clattering sound.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A person guides a grey and yellow strip into a silver sewing machine, which produces a continuous, rapid, metallic clattering sound.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA person's hands guide a grey and yellow strip into a silver sewing machine, which produces a rapid, rhythmic clattering sound.\nThe machine's metallic, repetitive clatter is mechanical, not the sound of a needle puncturing fabric, suggesting a different mechanism than a standard sewing machine.\nThe visual shows a sewing machine in operation, with hands manipulating a strip of material under the presser foot, accompanied by a continuous metallic clattering sound, which is the characteristic noise of the machine's internal mechanism (such as the shuttle) in motion.\n\nA person guides a grey and yellow strip into a silver sewing machine, which produces a continuous, rapid, metallic clattering sound.", "time_sec": 227.127, "generation_time_seconds": 134.5921, "selection_time_seconds": 91.3167, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 27.27, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "17", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man discusses as footsteps crunch on dirt and gravel, and birds chirp, while a pile of food and bags, a bag of trash, and other litter lay scattered on the ground.", "pred": "A person discusses the weed-killing strength of \"Lay's\" products while several bags of lawn care items, including a red Sevin bag and a white Lusso bag, sit on a gravel surface next to a wheelbarrow.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A person discusses the weed-killing strength of \"Lay's\" products while several bags of lawn care items, including a red Sevin bag and a white Lusso bag, sit on a gravel surface next to a wheelbarrow.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nMultiple bags of lawn care products, including a red bag of Sevin insect killer and a white bag of Lusso fertilized, are on a gravel surface next to a wheelbarrow, while a person discusses the different weed-killing strengths of \"Lay's\" products.\nBased on the audio, the speaker is comparing the weed-killing strength of two products, one of which he refers to as \"Lay's,\" though the brand on the visible bag is \"Lusso.\"\nBased on the audio provided, the speaker is discussing the properties of \"Lay's\" products, specifically their weed-killing strength. He mentions that one product, which he calls \"Lay's,\" has a \"stronger weed killer\" and is for \"weeds that have already emerged.\"\n\nA person discusses the weed-killing strength of \"Lay's\" products while several bags of lawn care items, including a red Sevin bag and a white Lusso bag, sit on a gravel surface next to a wheelbarrow.", "time_sec": 241.426, "generation_time_seconds": 162.9428, "selection_time_seconds": 77.666, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 19.51, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "18", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man is scrapping and filing wood while a man talks, surrounded by wooden toys and a barking dog in the background.", "pred": "A craftsman files a wooden egg-shaped instrument, producing a high-pitched scraping sound, while surrounded by similar percussion instruments and speaking in Spanish.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A craftsman files a wooden egg-shaped instrument, producing a high-pitched scraping sound, while surrounded by similar percussion instruments and speaking in Spanish.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA craftsman in a pink tank top files a wooden object at a table, surrounded by various wooden percussion instruments, while a male voice speaks in Spanish in the background.\nA craftsman wearing a pink tank top and glasses is seated at a white table, using a metal file on a wooden percussion instrument. The table is cluttered with numerous similar wooden instruments and small metal hardware parts. In the background, a male voice speaks in Spanish.\nThe craftsman's right hand, holding a metal file, moves back and forth across the surface of a light-brown, egg-shaped wooden instrument, producing a distinct, high-pitched, abrasive scraping sound. He has dark skin and wears glasses. The instrument being worked on features a hollowed-out cavity and a smooth, rounded top.\n\nA craftsman files a wooden egg-shaped instrument, producing a high-pitched scraping sound, while surrounded by similar percussion instruments and speaking in Spanish.", "time_sec": 271.99, "generation_time_seconds": 151.2234, "selection_time_seconds": 120.0208, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 14.81, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "19", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a blurry room, a man shouts before and after a person belches loudly, while a young woman in a black kitchen smiles by a plate of food with meat and onions.", "pred": "A close-up of a plate of sliced pink meat with a fork is followed by a woman with dark hair in a dark top looking at the camera with an open mouth, as a person exclaims and a stomach rumbles.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A close-up of a plate of sliced pink meat with a fork is followed by a woman with dark hair in a dark top looking at the camera with an open mouth, as a person exclaims and a stomach rumbles.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA close-up reveals a plate of pink, thinly sliced meat, possibly ham or corned beef, with a metal fork resting on it, as a woman with dark hair and a dark top appears in the background near a window with horizontal blinds.\nA woman with dark, shoulder-length hair, wearing a dark-colored top, is shown in a medium shot, looking directly at the camera with a wide, open-mouthed expression, as if speaking or exclaiming, with a window with horizontal blinds visible behind her.\nA woman with dark hair, wearing a dark top, is shown in a medium shot.\n She is looking directly at the camera with her mouth open in a wide, expressive manner, as if reacting or speaking.\n Behind her, a window with horizontal blinds is visible.\n The sound is of a person exclaiming, followed by a stomach rumble and then the word \"Sexually.\".\n\nA close-up of a plate of sliced pink meat with a fork is followed by a woman with dark hair in a dark top looking at the camera with an open mouth, as a person exclaims and a stomach rumbles.", "time_sec": 250.933, "generation_time_seconds": 160.3373, "selection_time_seconds": 90.356, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 21.05, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "20", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the midst of sizzling steaks and ribs on the grill, accompanied by whispers and music playing through headphones.", "pred": "A close-up shot shows multiple marbled steaks and bacon grilling over open flames, accompanied by a male voice saying 'Epic sound effects' followed by the loud, rapid rattling of a toy ratchet.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A close-up shot shows multiple marbled steaks and bacon grilling over open flames, accompanied by a male voice saying 'Epic sound effects' followed by the loud, rapid rattling of a toy ratchet.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA static image shows a close-up of multiple marbled steaks and a thick cut of bacon cooking on a dark, grilling surface over open flames, with a metallic tongs-like tool resting on the bacon.\nThe scene is dominated by a close-up shot of various cuts of meat being grilled over a dark, metallic grate; intense orange and yellow flames are visibly consuming the bacon strip on the right, while the adjacent steaks exhibit prominent grill marks and a rich, browned surface.\nThe 'Epic Sound FX' logo is visible, indicating the audio is not ambient but a series of distinct sound effects. The audio begins with a male voice saying 'Epic... sound effects,' followed immediately by the loud, rapid, and high-frequency rattling of a toy ratchet.\n\nA close-up shot shows multiple marbled steaks and bacon grilling over open flames, accompanied by a male voice saying 'Epic sound effects' followed by the loud, rapid rattling of a toy ratchet.", "time_sec": 245.829, "generation_time_seconds": 154.4608, "selection_time_seconds": 90.7859, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 11.76, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "21", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The digital beep is followed by a man speaking in this screenshot of a website.", "pred": "A screen recording displays a Microsoft Word document with a blue header, the '20Fingers2Brains' logo, and text, while a male voice narrates instructions for loading data in AngularJS.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A screen recording displays a Microsoft Word document with a blue header, the '20Fingers2Brains' logo, and text, while a male voice narrates instructions for loading data in AngularJS.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video displays a computer screen running a Microsoft Word document with a blue header, the logo '20Fingers2Brains', and visible text, while a male voice narrates instructions for loading data in AngularJS.\nThe video displays a computer screen running a Microsoft Word document with a blue header, the logo '20Fingers2Brains', and visible text, while a male voice narrates instructions for loading data in AngularJS.\nThe screen recording shows a Microsoft Word document with a blue header bar, the '20Fingers2Brains' logo, and text, while a male voice speaks about loading data from a server in AngularJS.\n\nA screen recording displays a Microsoft Word document with a blue header, the '20Fingers2Brains' logo, and text, while a male voice narrates instructions for loading data in AngularJS.", "time_sec": 214.68, "generation_time_seconds": 143.3166, "selection_time_seconds": 70.8082, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "22", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A woman and another woman chat as a goat baaing is heard, while a black and white kid  is held on a white towel by a person.", "pred": "A person in a white coat holds a black and white goat kid wrapped in a white towel on a blue surface, as a man urges it and a woman notes its lack of strength before it bleats.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A person in a white coat holds a black and white goat kid wrapped in a white towel on a blue surface, as a man urges it and a woman notes its lack of strength before it bleats.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA black and white goat kid is swaddled in a white towel on a blue surface, held by a person in a white coat, while a male voice says \"come on!\" and a female voice comments on the animal's lack of strength, followed by the sound of the goat bleating.\nA person in a white coat holds a black and white goat kid swaddled in a white towel on a blue surface, as a male voice encourages it and a female voice notes its lack of strength before the goat bleats.\n\\boxed{A person in a white coat holds a black and white goat kid wrapped in a white towel on a blue surface, as a man urges it and a woman notes its lack of strength before it bleats.}\n\nA person in a white coat holds a black and white goat kid wrapped in a white towel on a blue surface, as a man urges it and a woman notes its lack of strength before it bleats.", "time_sec": 243.635, "generation_time_seconds": 171.3651, "selection_time_seconds": 71.7469, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 44.44, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "23", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the video, a woman delivers a speech at an event, standing at a podium with a microphone in front of a flag.", "pred": "A woman in a black dress speaks at a \"JACKSON DAY\" podium, gesturing as she identifies herself as a hillbilly from the hills of East Tennessee, with a large blue and red star-patterned backdrop behind her.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A woman in a black dress speaks at a \"JACKSON DAY\" podium, gesturing as she identifies herself as a hillbilly from the hills of East Tennessee, with a large blue and red star-patterned backdrop behind her.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA woman in a black dress speaks into a microphone at a \"JACKSON DAY\" podium, with a large blue and red star-patterned backdrop, identifying her as a hillbilly from the hills of East Tennessee.\nA woman with dark hair, wearing a black dress with a white collar, stands at a podium with a microphone, gesturing with her right hand as she speaks in a southern accent, revealing she is from the hills of East Tennessee while a blue and red star-patterned backdrop is visible behind her.\nA woman with dark hair, wearing a black dress with a white collar, stands at a podium with a microphone, gesturing with her right hand as she speaks in a southern accent, revealing she is from the hills of East Tennessee while a blue and red star-patterned backdrop is visible behind her.\n\nA woman in a black dress speaks at a \"JACKSON DAY\" podium, gesturing as she identifies herself as a hillbilly from the hills of East Tennessee, with a large blue and red star-patterned backdrop behind her.", "time_sec": 267.664, "generation_time_seconds": 176.1631, "selection_time_seconds": 90.782, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 12.12, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "24", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The motorbike engine purrs softly as it sits on display, showcasing its intricate details up close.", "pred": "A vintage orange Honda motorcycle with a textured black seat is shown, while the audio features the loud, rapid clatter of a manual typewriter.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A vintage orange Honda motorcycle with a textured black seat is shown, while the audio features the loud, rapid clatter of a manual typewriter.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe image shows a close-up of a vintage Honda motorcycle with an orange fuel tank and a textured black solo seat. A person's hand is visible near the engine, and another person's legs are in the background. Simultaneously, the audio features the loud, rapid, and irregular clattering of a manual typewriter, which is completely incongruous with the visual of a motorcycle.\nThe visual shows a vintage Honda motorcycle's engine and seat, while the audio presents the rapid, rhythmic clatter of a manual typewriter.\nThe motorcycle is an orange, single-cylinder Honda, featuring a retro-style, low-slung, textured seat. A human hand is positioned near the engine, suggesting maintenance or inspection. In stark contrast, the sound is a loud, rapid, mechanical clatter, consistent with the operation of a manual typewriter.\n\nA vintage orange Honda motorcycle with a textured black seat is shown, while the audio features the loud, rapid clatter of a manual typewriter.", "time_sec": 297.744, "generation_time_seconds": 174.7954, "selection_time_seconds": 121.9329, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "25", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a bustling studio, the sound of aluminum cans clanking and compressed air spraying mingles with the gentle rattling of plastic as artists work on their paintings of various subjects.", "pred": "A person sprays orange paint onto a canvas while a staple gun produces sharp, repetitive metallic clicks and a whirring sound nearby.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A person sprays orange paint onto a canvas while a staple gun produces sharp, repetitive metallic clicks and a whirring sound nearby.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe audio features the sharp, repetitive sounds of a staple gun being used in a small, echoic space.\nThe visual shows a person applying orange spray paint to a canvas with a can, surrounded by art supplies, while the audio concurrently captures the distinct, sharp, and rhythmic mechanical sound of a staple gun being operated nearby.\nAn individual wearing gloves sprays orange paint from a can onto a canvas, while a staple gun is used in the immediate vicinity, producing sharp, repetitive metallic clicks and a whirring sound.\n\nA person sprays orange paint onto a canvas while a staple gun produces sharp, repetitive metallic clicks and a whirring sound nearby.", "time_sec": 244.469, "generation_time_seconds": 142.7872, "selection_time_seconds": 98.4938, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 5.71, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "26", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The eerie sound of a beep is accompanied by retching and muffled speech, as a young child in a stroller holds a blanket .", "pred": "A baby in a towel spits up water, then three women walk on a sidewalk as a man says he doesn't want kids, followed by a censor beep and guttural monster growls.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A baby in a towel spits up water, then three women walk on a sidewalk as a man says he doesn't want kids, followed by a censor beep and guttural monster growls.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA baby in a towel spits up water, then three women walk on a city sidewalk as a male voice speaks, a censor beep sounds, and guttural monster growls follow, finishing with the male voice speaking again.\nA baby in a towel spits up water, then three women walk on a city sidewalk as a male voice speaks, a censor beep sounds, and guttural monster growls follow, finishing with the male voice speaking again.\nThe initial frame displays the 'Friday' movie title card with a 'R' rating and a skull logo, indicating a horror genre. The scene then cuts to a baby in a white towel spitting a stream of water forward, followed by a brief shot of three women in winter clothing walking on a sidewalk. Overlapping the visuals, a male voice says he doesn't want kids anymore, immediately followed by a censor beep and a series of deep, guttural monster growls before the voice speaks again.\n\nA baby in a towel spits up water, then three women walk on a sidewalk as a man says he doesn't want kids, followed by a censor beep and guttural monster growls.", "time_sec": 306.978, "generation_time_seconds": 199.1122, "selection_time_seconds": 106.6819, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 6.06, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "27", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A black crow perched in a cage with a yellow cup, chirping as it strikes the bars.", "pred": "A black bird perches on a bar inside a wire cage with a greenish tint and a yellow water cup, while a sequence of sharp, high-pitched electronic clicks and a sustained electronic tone are heard.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A black bird perches on a bar inside a wire cage with a greenish tint and a yellow water cup, while a sequence of sharp, high-pitched electronic clicks and a sustained electronic tone are heard.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA black bird perches on the bar of a wire cage, which has a yellow water cup attached, under a greenish ambient light.\nSimultaneously, a sequence of sharp, distinct, high-pitched clicks and whirring sounds are heard, followed by a sustained electronic tone.\nThe bird is inside a cage with a green tint, and sounds like bird calls, clicking sounds, and an electronic tone are heard.\nA black bird is inside a wire cage with a greenish tint, featuring a yellow water cup; simultaneously, a sequence of sharp, high-pitched electronic clicks and a sustained electronic tone are heard.\n\nA black bird perches on a bar inside a wire cage with a greenish tint and a yellow water cup, while a sequence of sharp, high-pitched electronic clicks and a sustained electronic tone are heard.", "time_sec": 288.401, "generation_time_seconds": 186.1043, "selection_time_seconds": 101.6431, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 26.67, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "28", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The woman and child speak as the little boy in a green shirt holds his hands to his ears while sitting on the couch.", "pred": "A young boy in a green polo shirt rubs his eyes with his right hand while an adult asks about school and he responds with a drawn-out \"ooooo\" sound.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A young boy in a green polo shirt rubs his eyes with his right hand while an adult asks about school and he responds with a drawn-out \"ooooo\" sound.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA young boy in a green polo shirt sits on a brown couch, rubbing his eyes with his right hand.\nAn adult female voice asks off-screen, \"Homework?\" followed by, \"Did you have fun day at school?\"\nA young child's voice replies, \"Yeah.\"\nThe adult asks, \"Yeah, how fun was your day?\"\nThe child's voice hesitates, making a prolonged \"ooooo...\" sound.\nA young boy in a green polo shirt rubs his eyes while an adult asks about homework and his day at school, to which the child responds with a drawn-out \"ooooo...\" sound.\n\\boxed{\\text{A boy in a green polo shirt rubs his eyes as an adult asks about school and he responds with a drawn-out 'ooooo' sound.}}\nThe boy's hand is positioned directly over his right eye, and his fingers are splayed across the eyelid and brow, indicating he is actively rubbing his eye.\n\nA young boy in a green polo shirt rubs his eyes with his right hand while an adult asks about school and he responds with a drawn-out \"ooooo\" sound.", "time_sec": 292.426, "generation_time_seconds": 206.3173, "selection_time_seconds": 85.6894, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 30.3, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "29", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": " A young lady in a green and red sari is speaking on a news program.", "pred": "A woman in a green and red saree sits in a studio chair, speaking into a microphone while a \"Dial Shankara\" graphic is displayed on a large screen behind her.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A woman in a green and red saree sits in a studio chair, speaking into a microphone while a \"Dial Shankara\" graphic is displayed on a large screen behind her.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA woman in a green and red saree sits in a studio chair, speaking directly to the camera.\nA woman with dark hair, wearing a green and red saree, sits in a studio chair and speaks into a microphone, with a \"Dial Shankara\" graphic visible behind her.\nA woman in a green and red sari sits in a studio chair, speaking into a microphone while a \"Dial Shankara\" graphic is displayed on a large screen behind her.\n\nA woman in a green and red saree sits in a studio chair, speaking into a microphone while a \"Dial Shankara\" graphic is displayed on a large screen behind her.", "time_sec": 210.717, "generation_time_seconds": 138.645, "selection_time_seconds": 71.1564, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 23.08, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "30", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a bustling kitchen, the sound of a machine clicking is heard as a person mixes pink cotton candy in a bowl.", "pred": "A hand gathers spun pink sugar into a large ball inside a metallic bowl as a cotton candy machine produces a loud, high-pitched whirring and rhythmic clicking, with indistinct crowd chatter in the background.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A hand gathers spun pink sugar into a large ball inside a metallic bowl as a cotton candy machine produces a loud, high-pitched whirring and rhythmic clicking, with indistinct crowd chatter in the background.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nObserving the visual, a hand manipulates a large mass of fluffy pink cotton candy inside a metallic bowl on a machine base. Simultaneously, the audio reveals a persistent, high-speed mechanical whirring and rhythmic clicking, consistent with a spinning cotton candy machine, accompanied by the low murmur of indistinct crowd chatter in the background.\nA hand twists fluffy pink cotton candy on a metal rod inside a metallic bowl as a cotton candy machine spins, producing a loud, high-pitched whirring with rhythmic clicking, while indistinct crowd chatter is heard in the background.\nBased on the visual and audio cues, the process of making cotton candy is being completed. The hand is not just pulling the candy from the spinner, but is actively gathering and shaping the spun sugar into a large, compact ball, which is the final product of the machine's spinning action.\n\nA hand gathers spun pink sugar into a large ball inside a metallic bowl as a cotton candy machine produces a loud, high-pitched whirring and rhythmic clicking, with indistinct crowd chatter in the background.", "time_sec": 326.306, "generation_time_seconds": 202.6187, "selection_time_seconds": 118.5107, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 33.33, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "31", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A woman's voice narrates as a man works diligently on a sewing machine at a wooden table.", "pred": "A person operates a green and white Singer sewing machine, guiding white fabric under the needle as the continuous mechanical whirring of the machine is accompanied by a female voice speaking in Spanish.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A person operates a green and white Singer sewing machine, guiding white fabric under the needle as the continuous mechanical whirring of the machine is accompanied by a female voice speaking in Spanish.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA person operates a green and white Singer sewing machine, guiding a piece of white fabric under the needle with their left hand, while the continuous mechanical whirring of the machine is audible and a female voice speaks in Spanish in the background.\nThe sewing machine's needle moves rapidly up and down, creating a rhythmic mechanical whirring sound that is the dominant background noise throughout the clip.\nThe visual and audio streams are consistent with a single real-world event. The machine's operation produces the sound of its motor and needle mechanism, which is the primary audio event, while the human voice is a secondary, unrelated sound source in the environment.\n\nA person operates a green and white Singer sewing machine, guiding white fabric under the needle as the continuous mechanical whirring of the machine is accompanied by a female voice speaking in Spanish.", "time_sec": 293.652, "generation_time_seconds": 188.3041, "selection_time_seconds": 104.6289, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 19.35, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "32", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a white room, a camera on a stand is ready to be installed, while men speak with light clicks, vibrations, and digital clicks.", "pred": "\\boxed{\\text{A white quadcopter drone with gold stripes and four propellers sits on a wooden floor, its camera gimbal pointed downward, with a human hand visible touching its body as a continuous high-pitched electronic beep sounds.}}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "\\boxed{\\text{A white quadcopter drone with gold stripes and four propellers sits on a wooden floor, its camera gimbal pointed downward, with a human hand visible touching its body as a continuous high-pitched electronic beep sounds.}}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA white and gold quadcopter drone with four propellers and a camera gimbal is shown, with a human hand touching its top, while the sound of a continuous electronic beep plays.\nThe drone is white with gold-colored stripes on its arms, has four silver propellers with black tips, and a camera with a gimbal is mounted underneath; a human hand with light skin and visible fingers touches the top of the drone.\nThe continuous electronic beep is a high-pitched, monotonous sound typical of an alarm or alert signal, likely originating from the drone or another nearby device.\nA white quadcopter drone with gold stripes and four propellers sits on a wooden floor, its camera gimbal pointed downward, with a human hand visible touching its body as a continuous high-pitched electronic beep sounds.\n\nA white quadcopter drone with gold stripes and four propellers sits on a wooden floor, its camera gimbal pointed downward, with a human hand visible touching its body as a continuous high-pitched electronic beep sounds.\n\n\\boxed{\\text{A white quadcopter drone with gold stripes and four propellers sits on a wooden floor, its camera gimbal pointed downward, with a human hand visible touching its body as a continuous high-pitched electronic beep sounds.}}", "time_sec": 259.917, "generation_time_seconds": 177.4344, "selection_time_seconds": 80.6842, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 9.76, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "33", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The muffled sound of an aircraft engine hums as the wing of an airplane flies through a blue sky with clouds.", "pred": "An airplane wing with extended flaps is visible from a passenger window, initially obscured by thick white clouds before emerging into a blue sky with scattered clouds, accompanied by the constant, low-frequency rumble of the aircraft cabin during flight.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "An airplane wing with extended flaps is visible from a passenger window, initially obscured by thick white clouds before emerging into a blue sky with scattered clouds, accompanied by the constant, low-frequency rumble of the aircraft cabin during flight.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe primary visual is an airplane wing with flaps extended, captured from an in-flight perspective.\nThe scene begins obscured by thick, white clouds, then transitions to reveal the wing against a blue sky with scattered, brighter clouds.\nThis suggests the aircraft is either ascending through or descending into cloud layers.\nThe accompanying sound is a constant, low-frequency, deep rumble, consistent with the ambient noise of being inside an active aircraft cabin during flight.\nThe visual shows an airplane wing with its flaps extended, initially obscured by thick white clouds before emerging into a bright blue sky with scattered clouds, indicating the aircraft is flying through or above cloud layers. The accompanying audio is a deep, continuous, low-frequency rumble, consistent with the ambient sound inside an airplane fuselage during powered flight. The combination of these two modalities—visual and audio—confirms the scene is from the perspective of a passenger inside an aircraft.\nThe visual shows an aircraft wing with its flaps extended, indicating a phase of flight such as takeoff or approach. The scene evolves from heavy cloud cover to a clear blue sky with white clouds, confirming a transition through the atmosphere. The audio is a constant, low-frequency drone without speech or music, characteristic of the ambient sound within a pressurized aircraft cabin during steady flight, likely powered by jet engines. The wing's position relative to the window and the lack of ground references confirm the perspective is from inside the aircraft.\n\nAn airplane wing with extended flaps is visible from a passenger window, initially obscured by thick white clouds before emerging into a blue sky with scattered clouds, accompanied by the constant, low-frequency rumble of the aircraft cabin during flight.", "time_sec": 281.847, "generation_time_seconds": 194.6278, "selection_time_seconds": 86.7738, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 31.58, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "34", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man revs a vehicle engine as a woman with a microphone stands in the street, surrounded by a crowd of people talking and whistling and a some people are cleaning a road.", "pred": "A large, powerful engine with a supercharger is audible, matching the high-performance vehicle likely present at this outdoor, spectator-lined event.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A large, powerful engine with a supercharger is audible, matching the high-performance vehicle likely present at this outdoor, spectator-lined event.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video shows a crowd of people on a grassy hillside, with several individuals in the foreground near a barricade; a large green tractor is visible on the left, and the audio consists of the low rumble and high-pitched whine of a powerful engine, consistent with a high-performance vehicle nearby.\nThe visual scene depicts a large crowd on a grassy embankment, with several people in the immediate foreground, including a woman in a red and black shirt and a man in a black shirt, standing behind a barricade with a large green tractor partially visible on the far left. The audio is dominated by the low, deep rumble of a large engine and the high-pitched, aggressive whine of a supercharger.\nA large, powerful engine with a supercharger is audible, matching the high-performance vehicle likely present at this outdoor, spectator-lined event.\n\nA large, powerful engine with a supercharger is audible, matching the high-performance vehicle likely present at this outdoor, spectator-lined event.", "time_sec": 227.166, "generation_time_seconds": 146.1094, "selection_time_seconds": 79.2515, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 13.33, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "35", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The red and white plane's engine roars as it takes off from the airport runway, with people watching from the nearby fence.", "pred": "A red FTA airplane is on a runway under a grey sky, with the loud, high-pitched whining sound of jet engines audible.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A red FTA airplane is on a runway under a grey sky, with the loud, high-pitched whining sound of jet engines audible.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA red FTA (Full Dream Airlines) airplane is on a runway under a grey sky, while a loud, high-pitched whining sound is heard.\nA red FTA airplane is on a runway under an overcast sky, with a loud, high-pitched mechanical whine audible in the background.\nA red FTA airplane is on a runway under a grey sky, with the loud, high-pitched whining sound of jet engines audible.\n\nA red FTA airplane is on a runway under a grey sky, with the loud, high-pitched whining sound of jet engines audible.", "time_sec": 234.898, "generation_time_seconds": 126.4281, "selection_time_seconds": 107.2418, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 13.79, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "36", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The rhythmic hum of a train engine fills the air as a black and white train travels down the tracks near a wooded area.", "pred": "A black locomotive numbered 9240 pulls a long line of silver hopper cars along a curved track, accompanied by a powerful train horn and the rhythmic clatter of wheels on rails.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A black locomotive numbered 9240 pulls a long line of silver hopper cars along a curved track, accompanied by a powerful train horn and the rhythmic clatter of wheels on rails.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA black locomotive numbered 9240 pulls a long line of silver hopper cars along a curved track, while a powerful train horn sounds and the rhythmic clatter of wheels on rails is heard.\nThe train exhibits a clear leftward curve in its path along the gravel ballast track, with the locomotive's front facing the camera's left, and the lead engine is black with the number \"9240\" in white numerals on its side, pulling numerous silver hopper cars with dark triangular markings.\nThe train's path curves to the left, with the locomotive leading and pulling a long line of silver hopper cars on a track with gravel ballast.\nThe locomotive is black with the number \"9240\" in white on its side, and its headlights are illuminated.\nA powerful train horn sounds, followed by the rhythmic clatter of wheels on the rails.\nThis indicates the train is moving along the curved track.\n\nA black locomotive numbered 9240 pulls a long line of silver hopper cars along a curved track, accompanied by a powerful train horn and the rhythmic clatter of wheels on rails.", "time_sec": 323.852, "generation_time_seconds": 209.5614, "selection_time_seconds": 113.4554, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 16.67, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "37", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A flock of pigeons coo and flap their wings while a distant rooster crows, with a white pigeon standing on top of a dirt floor.", "pred": "A flock of pigeons with varied grey, white, and iridescent plumage move about and peck at a dark, littered ground inside a wooden enclosure, accompanied by the sound of a rooster crowing and pigeons cooing.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A flock of pigeons with varied grey, white, and iridescent plumage move about and peck at a dark, littered ground inside a wooden enclosure, accompanied by the sound of a rooster crowing and pigeons cooing.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA flock of pigeons, including grey, white, and iridescent-feathered individuals, move about and peck at the littered ground of an enclosure while a rooster crows and pigeons coo in the background.\nA group of pigeons with varied plumage are seen moving on a rough, dark ground inside a man-made enclosure, with a wooden structure partially visible, all while a rooster crows and pigeons coo.\nThe ground is composed of a dark, coarse bedding material, likely straw or wood shavings, scattered with small debris, contrasting with the rough, aged wooden planks visible in the enclosure.\n\nA flock of pigeons with varied grey, white, and iridescent plumage move about and peck at a dark, littered ground inside a wooden enclosure, accompanied by the sound of a rooster crowing and pigeons cooing.", "time_sec": 254.317, "generation_time_seconds": 169.5743, "selection_time_seconds": 84.3475, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 22.22, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "38", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A horse-drawn carriage clip-clops through a lush green field with sheep grazing in the background and an engine idling nearby.", "pred": "A two-horse carriage moves from right to left on a paved path, its wooden wheels producing a rhythmic, sharp metallic clank on the hard surface, accompanied by the heavy, synchronized thud of the horses' hooves.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A two-horse carriage moves from right to left on a paved path, its wooden wheels producing a rhythmic, sharp metallic clank on the hard surface, accompanied by the heavy, synchronized thud of the horses' hooves.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA horse-drawn carriage with two dark horses moves from right to left along a paved path in a park.\nThe primary audio consists of the rhythmic, metallic clanking of the carriage's wheels on the hard surface, accompanied by the corresponding horse's hooves.\nA sustained, low-pitched synthetic musical tone begins after the carriage sound stops.\nThis tone is unnatural and distinct from the organic sounds of the carriage and horses.\nThe carriage's wheels produce a sharp, metallic clanking, and the horses' hooves create a rhythmic, heavy thud.\nA two-horse carriage moves from right to left on a paved path, its wooden wheels producing a rhythmic, sharp metallic clank on the hard surface, accompanied by the heavy, synchronized thud of the horses' hooves.\n\nA two-horse carriage moves from right to left on a paved path, its wooden wheels producing a rhythmic, sharp metallic clank on the hard surface, accompanied by the heavy, synchronized thud of the horses' hooves.", "time_sec": 252.537, "generation_time_seconds": 157.3355, "selection_time_seconds": 94.3893, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 5.56, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "39", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a garage, an old car and truck are parked as a loud bang is heard, followed by an engine idling loudly.", "pred": "A classic grey pickup truck and a dark muscle car are parked inside a cluttered garage, while an extremely loud, fast, and chaotic engine produces a high-pitched metallic rattling sound, suggesting severe engine damage.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A classic grey pickup truck and a dark muscle car are parked inside a cluttered garage, while an extremely loud, fast, and chaotic engine produces a high-pitched metallic rattling sound, suggesting severe engine damage.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA classic grey pickup truck with its front end exposed, draped in a white cover, sits beside a vintage dark muscle car inside a cluttered garage.\nAn extremely loud, fast, and chaotic engine is audible, characterized by a high-pitched, metallic rattling or knocking sound, indicative of severe engine damage or detonation, likely from the muscle car positioned in the foreground.\nThe garage interior is defined by orange-stained concrete flooring and white walls covered in posters, with a red vertical object, possibly a tool cabinet, visible behind the muscle car.\nThe intense, rattling engine noise is the dominant auditory event, so loud and metallic that it creates a physical sensation of vibration, suggesting the sound source is very close to the recording device.\nA person is partially visible in the background near a doorway, but their actions are indistinct due to the rapid movement of the vehicle and the overwhelming sound.\n\nA classic grey pickup truck and a dark muscle car are parked inside a cluttered garage, while an extremely loud, fast, and chaotic engine produces a high-pitched metallic rattling sound, suggesting severe engine damage.", "time_sec": 269.176, "generation_time_seconds": 157.8325, "selection_time_seconds": 110.9549, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 32.43, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "40", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a small room filled with toys, a young girl plays joyfully as a woman talks and a man shouts in the background, creating a lively atmosphere of laughter and excitement.", "pred": "A young child in a white shirt laughs in a room with a staircase as an adult speaks, then a loud sneeze and a sharp slap sound occur.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A young child in a white shirt laughs in a room with a staircase as an adult speaks, then a loud sneeze and a sharp slap sound occur.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA young child with dark hair, wearing a white t-shirt, is laughing hysterically in a room with carpeted floors and a wooden staircase.\n The laughter is accompanied by an adult female voice speaking.\n Suddenly, the child's laugh is interrupted by a loud, sharp sneeze from a person nearby.\nA young child in a white t-shirt laughs in a carpeted room as an adult female voice speaks, followed by a sudden, loud sneeze that interrupts the child's laughter.\nA high-pitched, sustained scream abruptly cuts through the ambient room tone, immediately followed by the sharp, percussive sound of a hand clapping or hitting a surface.\n\nA young child in a white shirt laughs in a room with a staircase as an adult speaks, then a loud sneeze and a sharp slap sound occur.", "time_sec": 266.3, "generation_time_seconds": 156.961, "selection_time_seconds": 108.4548, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 12.12, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "41", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the bustling kitchen, a man's voice narrates as he prepares a meal, cutting shrimp and  while water sprays into the sink and drains.", "pred": "Hands dehead crawfish using a two-finger technique, while a male voice narrates an alternative method of pulling the head out from inside.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "Hands dehead crawfish using a two-finger technique, while a male voice narrates an alternative method of pulling the head out from inside.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA pair of hands is deheading live crawfish by pulling out their heads, while a male voice narrates an alternative method of removing the head by inserting a finger and pulling it out.\nThe video shows a close-up of hands deheading live crawfish, while the audio features a man describing his technique of removing the head by inserting a finger and pulling it out.\nThe hands use a two-finger technique to extract the crawfish heads, while a male voice narrates and describes an alternative two-finger method of pulling the head out from inside.\n\nHands dehead crawfish using a two-finger technique, while a male voice narrates an alternative method of pulling the head out from inside.", "time_sec": 203.587, "generation_time_seconds": 132.5282, "selection_time_seconds": 70.2942, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 12.9, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "42", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man's voice crackles over the radio as water splashes and trickles, while a person in a red kayak paddles through the rain-drenched ocean.", "pred": "A first-person view from a red kayak shows choppy grey water under an overcast sky, with yellow paddles and a small black camera visible as strong wind buffets the microphone, producing loud, low-frequency distortion.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A first-person view from a red kayak shows choppy grey water under an overcast sky, with yellow paddles and a small black camera visible as strong wind buffets the microphone, producing loud, low-frequency distortion.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA first-person view from a red and black kayak shows choppy grey water under a grey sky, with yellow paddles and a small black camera visible as strong wind buffets the microphone, producing loud buffeting sounds.\nThe visual shows a first-person kayak journey on rough, grey water under an overcast sky, featuring a black and red kayak, yellow paddles, and a small black camera attached to the bow. Simultaneously, the audio consists of intense, low-frequency wind buffeting that heavily distorts the microphone, indicating the device is exposed to strong gusts.\nThe visual perspective is from the front of a kayak moving through choppy water, with a bright red hull and yellow paddles visible in the foreground, while a small black action camera is mounted on the bow. The audio is dominated by loud, low-frequency wind buffeting and distortion, indicating the microphone is exposed to strong wind, consistent with a high-speed, open-water environment. There are no discernible voices, music, or other environmental sounds in the audio, only the direct impact of wind on the microphone. The physical presence of the kayak and paddles in the shot, combined with the wind noise, confirms the video is a first\n\nA first-person view from a red kayak shows choppy grey water under an overcast sky, with yellow paddles and a small black camera visible as strong wind buffets the microphone, producing loud, low-frequency distortion.", "time_sec": 281.231, "generation_time_seconds": 174.1094, "selection_time_seconds": 106.4754, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 20.0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "43", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The aircraft engine roars as the plane soars high above the clouds, with the sun shining brightly in the sky.", "pred": "A jet engine and wing are visible over a thick cloud layer during sunrise or sunset, accompanied by the loud, deep roar of the engine.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A jet engine and wing are visible over a thick cloud layer during sunrise or sunset, accompanied by the loud, deep roar of the engine.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe scene shows a jet engine and wing over a cloud layer during a bright sunset, while the audio consists solely of loud, low-frequency engine noise.\nA jet engine's low-frequency roar dominates the audio, matching the visual of a jet engine and wing over a cloud layer during sunrise or sunset.\nA thick, consistent cloud layer fills the lower half of the frame, with the wing and a jet engine in the foreground; the bright sun on the horizon causes significant lens flare. The audio is filled exclusively with the deep, powerful roar of a large jet engine.\n\nA jet engine and wing are visible over a thick cloud layer during sunrise or sunset, accompanied by the loud, deep roar of the engine.", "time_sec": 252.595, "generation_time_seconds": 133.5707, "selection_time_seconds": 118.4006, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 7.41, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "44", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A young man with no shirt on is laying in bed, with footsteps walking on a hard surface followed by a person snoring.", "pred": "\\boxed{\\text{A shirtless man with a goatee lies on a black leather couch in a dim, purplish room, audibly snoring deeply with his head tilted back and hand on his chest.}}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "\\boxed{\\text{A shirtless man with a goatee lies on a black leather couch in a dim, purplish room, audibly snoring deeply with his head tilted back and hand on his chest.}}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA shirtless man with a goatee lies on a black leather couch in a dim, purplish room.\n He is audibly snoring loudly and deeply, with the sound of his breathing being very prominent.\n His hand is resting on his chest, and his head is tilted back.\n The audio consists solely of his deep, rhythmic snoring, with no other discernible background noises.\n The visual and auditory cues are consistent, depicting a person in a deep sleep.\nA shirtless man with a goatee lies on a black leather couch in a dim, purplish room, audibly snoring loudly and deeply with his hand resting on his chest and his head tilted back.\nThe man's head is tilted back, his mouth is open, and his chest is rising and falling rhythmically, all of which are consistent with the deep, audible snoring heard in the audio.\n\nA shirtless man with a goatee lies on a black leather couch in a dim, purplish room, audibly snoring deeply with his head tilted back and hand on his chest.\n\\boxed{\\text{A shirtless man with a goatee lies on a black leather couch in a dim, purplish room, audibly snoring deeply with his head tilted back and hand on his chest.}}", "time_sec": 240.422, "generation_time_seconds": 180.0223, "selection_time_seconds": 60.0864, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 11.76, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "45", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "As the wind blows hard and the engine hums loud, a man drives a boat on a lake with a purple background.", "pred": "A first-person view from a boat on a lake is accompanied by the deafening, sustained roar of a high-powered engine.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A first-person view from a boat on a lake is accompanied by the deafening, sustained roar of a high-powered engine.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe audio reveals the loud, powerful, and continuous roar of a large engine, characteristic of a high-performance vehicle or boat, while the visual shows a first-person perspective from a boat on a body of water with a treeline in the distance.\nThe audio is dominated by a deafening, sustained roar from a massive engine, likely that of a high-powered boat, operating at full throttle. This sound is completely consistent with the visual evidence of being on a motorized boat moving across open water, suggesting the boat is accelerating or cruising at speed.\nThe visual evidence of a boat on water is confirmed by the audio, which consists of the distinct, high-RPM roar of a powerful engine, strongly indicating a high-speed boat ride.\n\nA first-person view from a boat on a lake is accompanied by the deafening, sustained roar of a high-powered engine.", "time_sec": 254.729, "generation_time_seconds": 149.5269, "selection_time_seconds": 104.8885, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 26.09, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "46", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The intense audio of gunshots firing transitions to two men talking, then music playing, as a man sitting on a couch holds a bottle of water.", "pred": "A man holds a clear plastic water bottle while speaking on a couch, as a sharp metallic rattle is heard, followed by his voice explaining a magic trick involving the bottle.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A man holds a clear plastic water bottle while speaking on a couch, as a sharp metallic rattle is heard, followed by his voice explaining a magic trick involving the bottle.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nTwo men are sitting on a couch, with various magic product boxes displayed around them.\n One man holds a clear plastic water bottle while talking, and the other man listens and touches his head.\n The scene is overlaid with graphics, including a \"WIZARD PRODUCT REVIEW\" banner and a large graphic of a magic product box.\n The man holding the bottle is speaking, and his voice is clear and intelligible.\nA man holds a clear plastic bottle while speaking on a couch, as a sharp metallic rattle is heard, followed by his voice explaining a magic trick involving the bottle.\nThe audio and video streams are synchronized and independent: the visual shows a man on a couch holding a water bottle, and the audio captures his clear, intelligible voice explaining a magic trick with the item he is holding.\n\nA man holds a clear plastic water bottle while speaking on a couch, as a sharp metallic rattle is heard, followed by his voice explaining a magic trick involving the bottle.", "time_sec": 187.489, "generation_time_seconds": 133.3156, "selection_time_seconds": 52.9086, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 27.78, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "47", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the video, a woman is heard breathing heavily, sneezing twice, and sniffing her nose, in the dark room.", "pred": "A person breathes heavily and sneezes twice in a quiet, reverberant indoor space.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A person breathes heavily and sneezes twice in a quiet, reverberant indoor space.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe audio captures a person breathing heavily and then sneezing twice in a quiet indoor environment.\nThe audio exclusively reveals a person's physical actions: heavy, strained inhalations and exhalations are followed by two distinct, forceful sneezes, all occurring in a quiet space with a subtle background hum.\nThe audio reveals a person, their breathing labored and deep, letting out a forceful sneeze followed by a second, less intense one, all within a quiet, reverberant indoor space.\n\nA person breathes heavily and sneezes twice in a quiet, reverberant indoor space.", "time_sec": 170.011, "generation_time_seconds": 109.4509, "selection_time_seconds": 60.1895, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 19.05, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "48", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A brown dog sound on top of a rug next to a large tire whimpers and barks while breathing rapidly.", "pred": "A brindle Boxer dog with an open mouth and tongue out lies on a red patterned rug next to a black tire, while barking loudly and aggressively.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A brindle Boxer dog with an open mouth and tongue out lies on a red patterned rug next to a black tire, while barking loudly and aggressively.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA brindle boxer dog lies on a red patterned rug next to a black tire, its mouth open as it pants and barks loudly.\nThe dog's brindle coat is clearly visible, and its open mouth reveals teeth and a large pink tongue, indicating exertion, which aligns with the loud, repeated barks heard in the audio.\nA brindle Boxer dog with an open mouth and tongue out lies on a red patterned rug next to a black tire, while barking loudly and aggressively.\n\nA brindle Boxer dog with an open mouth and tongue out lies on a red patterned rug next to a black tire, while barking loudly and aggressively.", "time_sec": 226.236, "generation_time_seconds": 125.2994, "selection_time_seconds": 100.034, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 27.59, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "49", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The whimpering of several small dogs can be heard as a group of puppies play together in the grass.", "pred": "Four small brown puppies play energetically on a dirt and grass patch, their sounds a continuous mix of high-pitched squeals and yelps with occasional sharp barks and a single deep growl.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "Four small brown puppies play energetically on a dirt and grass patch, their sounds a continuous mix of high-pitched squeals and yelps with occasional sharp barks and a single deep growl.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nBased on the visual and auditory information, a pack of at least four small, brown puppies are seen energetically playing on a patch of dirt and grass in a yard. Their playful interaction is accompanied by a continuous chorus of high-pitched puppy squeals and yelps, with occasional sharp, distinct barks that vary in pitch and length.\nThe puppies, brown in color and small in stature, are actively moving and interacting with each other on an unpaved area adjacent to a wooden deck. The audio consists of a series of rapid, high-pitched vocalizations from the puppies, including whines, squeals, and yelps associated with play, interspersed with a few sharper, more forceful barks, one of which is followed by a deep, guttural growl.\nFour small brown puppies play energetically on a dirt and grass patch, their sounds a continuous mix of high-pitched squeals and yelps with occasional sharp barks and a single deep growl.\n\nFour small brown puppies play energetically on a dirt and grass patch, their sounds a continuous mix of high-pitched squeals and yelps with occasional sharp barks and a single deep growl.", "time_sec": 264.134, "generation_time_seconds": 172.6332, "selection_time_seconds": 90.425, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 23.53, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "50", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In front of a blue house with a red front door, a man stands as a toy helicopter powers down before starting up.", "pred": "A small white and purple quadcopter drone rests on a concrete path before a house with grey siding and a red door, emitting a loud, high-pitched buzzing sound.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A small white and purple quadcopter drone rests on a concrete path before a house with grey siding and a red door, emitting a loud, high-pitched buzzing sound.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA small, multi-rotor drone with a white and purple body rests on a concrete sidewalk, positioned in front of a house with grey siding, a dark red door, and brick steps, while a loud, high-pitched buzzing sound, like a small electric motor or drone, is audible.\n\\boxed{\\text{A small white and purple drone rests on a concrete path before a house with grey siding and a red door, emitting a loud, high-pitched buzzing sound.}}\nThe drone has four rotors, suggesting it is a quadcopter. The white and purple color scheme is visible on its body and propellers. Its placement on the path indicates it is stationary after landing.\nThe drone's body is constructed from a light-colored material, likely plastic or composite, with a central frame connecting four arms. Each arm terminates in a motor housing that secures a propeller, forming a symmetrical cross-shaped structure. The body features a purple underside with a visible circular component, possibly a camera lens, suggesting its function for recording or navigation.\n\nA small white and purple quadcopter drone rests on a concrete path before a house with grey siding and a red door, emitting a loud, high-pitched buzzing sound.", "time_sec": 236.242, "generation_time_seconds": 168.0481, "selection_time_seconds": 67.8532, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 23.53, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "51", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The man whistled as the small dogs on the bed looked into a mirror, followed by a yell as plastic rustled and clanked in the background.", "pred": "A large brown dog named Snow stands in a red kennel behind two small puppies, a tan one and a black-and-white one, as a man off-camera calls her \"Mama.\"", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A large brown dog named Snow stands in a red kennel behind two small puppies, a tan one and a black-and-white one, as a man off-camera calls her \"Mama.\"", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA large brown dog stands in a red kennel behind two smaller puppies, one tan and one black, as a person off-camera calls out \"Mama, Mama Snow\" and \"Mama, come over here, baby.\"\nThe scene is set in a red-walled kennel or exercise pen on a white blanket with a pattern, where a large brown dog is visible in a mirror behind two smaller puppies. One puppy is tan and the other is black with white markings, and several dog toys are scattered on the blanket. Simultaneously, a male voice calls out \"Mama, Mama Snow\" and then \"Mama, come over here, baby,\" indicating he is calling to the large dog.\nObserving the scene, a large brown dog is positioned in a red kennel behind two smaller puppies—one tan and one black/white—and various toys are on the white blanket with a yellow duck pattern. This visual is accompanied by a person off-camera calling out \"Mama, Mama Snow\" and then \"Mama, come over here, baby,\" clearly identifying the dog as 'Mama' and her name as 'Snow'.\n\\boxed{A large brown dog named Snow stands in a red kennel behind two small puppies, a tan one and a black-and-white one, as a man off-camera calls her \"Mama.\"\n\nA large brown dog named Snow stands in a red kennel behind two small puppies, a tan one and a black-and-white one, as a man off-camera calls her \"Mama.\"", "time_sec": 239.496, "generation_time_seconds": 158.2413, "selection_time_seconds": 80.638, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 11.43, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "52", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the midst of a dark forest, a man speaks with whistling and rain background noise.", "pred": "A static, rain-streaked, multi-pane window reveals a faint, distorted figure outside, while a repetitive, high-pitched electronic whistle plays.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A static, rain-streaked, multi-pane window reveals a faint, distorted figure outside, while a repetitive, high-pitched electronic whistle plays.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA view from inside a room shows a dark, rain-streaked, multi-pane window with a faint, distorted figure visible outside, while a repetitive, high-pitched electronic whistling sound is heard.\nThe scene is a static, black-and-white view through a dark, heavy-curtained window, revealing rain-slicked panes and a faint, indistinct humanoid shape outside; simultaneously, a clear, high-pitched whistle is heard, repeating at a steady, unsettling rhythm.\nThe audio and visual elements are clearly distinct and do not share an obvious physical source. The whistling sound is a singular, rhythmic, high-pitched tone, possibly electronic or from a musical instrument, with no corresponding environmental noise like wind or an animal. The visual scene is a static, atmospheric shot of a rainy interior, but the auditory event is a repetitive, non-random sequence that lacks any audible spatial characteristics (like echo or reverb) that would place it inside the same room. The sound's consistent tempo and volume suggest it is a produced effect rather than a real-world sound from the scene.\n\nA static, rain-streaked, multi-pane window reveals a faint, distorted figure outside, while a repetitive, high-pitched electronic whistle plays.", "time_sec": 252.562, "generation_time_seconds": 149.0412, "selection_time_seconds": 103.016, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "53", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a scene filled with whimsical characters, a man dressed as a cow speaks in a high tone while a goat bleats, as a woman in a white costume holds a hat.", "pred": "A person in a white rabbit costume with blue inner ears and a yellow necktie holds a yellow drink and a green object against a plain background with Japanese text, while a male voice speaks in Japanese.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A person in a white rabbit costume with blue inner ears and a yellow necktie holds a yellow drink and a green object against a plain background with Japanese text, while a male voice speaks in Japanese.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA person in a white rabbit costume with blue-tipped ears and red lipstick holds a yellow drink and a green object, while Japanese text is visible on the right side of the screen, and an off-screen male voice speaks in Japanese.\nA person in a white rabbit costume with blue-tipped ears and red lipstick holds a yellow drink and a green object, while Japanese text is visible on the right side of the screen, and an off-screen male voice speaks in Japanese.\nThe subject wears a white full-body rabbit costume featuring long ears with blue inner linings, a yellow necktie, and a blue-and-white striped scarf, holding a yellow beverage in a glass with a straw in one hand and a bright green object in the other, positioned against a plain light-colored background with vertical Japanese text on the right and a red stamp in the bottom left corner, while a male voice speaks in Japanese in the audio.\n\nA person in a white rabbit costume with blue inner ears and a yellow necktie holds a yellow drink and a green object against a plain background with Japanese text, while a male voice speaks in Japanese.", "time_sec": 254.297, "generation_time_seconds": 167.1676, "selection_time_seconds": 86.4748, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 20.0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "54", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A black train blows its horn while traveling down the tracks near a street and trees.", "pred": "A black steam locomotive numbered 1306 approaches and passes a railroad crossing, emitting a large plume of white smoke and a loud, rhythmic chugging sound.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A black steam locomotive numbered 1306 approaches and passes a railroad crossing, emitting a large plume of white smoke and a loud, rhythmic chugging sound.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA black steam locomotive with the number 1306 on its side and emitting a large plume of white smoke is seen approaching and passing a railroad crossing on a sunny day, its loud and rhythmic chugging and clattering on the tracks audible as the red and white striped crossing arm is down.\nThe locomotive, black with the number 1306, is moving from right to left on the tracks.\nThe locomotive is a black steam engine with the number 1306 visible on its side, moving from right to left along the tracks.\n\nA black steam locomotive numbered 1306 approaches and passes a railroad crossing, emitting a large plume of white smoke and a loud, rhythmic chugging sound.", "time_sec": 244.132, "generation_time_seconds": 147.5342, "selection_time_seconds": 95.9912, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 6.9, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "55", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The man in the garage is changing a tire on a car while a short spray is followed by a louder, longer spray.", "pred": "A mechanic operates a blue tire machine while a loud, sustained hiss of compressed air is heard.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A mechanic operates a blue tire machine while a loud, sustained hiss of compressed air is heard.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA mechanic uses a tire machine to mount a tire, which is then inflated with a loud hiss from a compressor.\nA worker in a garage uses a blue tire machine to mount a tire; a loud, sustained hiss of compressed air escapes nearby, characteristic of an air compressor exhausting pressure.\nThe mechanic operates a blue tire machine, and a sustained, high-pressure hissing sound of compressed air is heard.\n\nA mechanic operates a blue tire machine while a loud, sustained hiss of compressed air is heard.", "time_sec": 159.412, "generation_time_seconds": 108.2553, "selection_time_seconds": 50.704, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 9.09, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "56", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a hospital room, a baby cries while a woman speaks amidst the background noise of other conversations, as a newborn baby lays in a hospital bed.", "pred": "A newborn baby with dark skin and hair lies swaddled in a hospital bassinet, its mouth wide open in a prolonged, high-pitched cry.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A newborn baby with dark skin and hair lies swaddled in a hospital bassinet, its mouth wide open in a prolonged, high-pitched cry.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA newborn baby with dark skin and hair lies swaddled in a hospital bassinet, its mouth wide open in a prolonged, high-pitched cry.\nThe surrounding environment is clinical, featuring metallic railings and soft bedding, consistent with a delivery or nursery setting.\nThe baby's cry is not a simple sound but a series of intense, sustained wails with a sharp, strained timbre.\nThe newborn's cry is a series of high-pitched, strained wails with a sharp timbre, indicating significant distress.\nThe infant’s cry is characterized by a strained, high-pitched timbre and a series of sustained wails, not a simple sound, indicating significant distress.\n\nA newborn baby with dark skin and hair lies swaddled in a hospital bassinet, its mouth wide open in a prolonged, high-pitched cry.", "time_sec": 215.52, "generation_time_seconds": 136.8082, "selection_time_seconds": 78.2214, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 18.75, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "57", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The sound of ocean waves crashing in the distance accompanies the laughter of children playing on the beach, as a young girl  make faces in the sand, capturing moments of joy and creativity.", "pred": "A static, top-down view shows a sand sculpture with a pink mannequin head and two grey stones for testicles, while a child's voice suggests taking photos of the figure as both a boy and a girl.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A static, top-down view shows a sand sculpture with a pink mannequin head and two grey stones for testicles, while a child's voice suggests taking photos of the figure as both a boy and a girl.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe visual shows a buried figure with a pink mannequin head and stones for testicles, while the audio features a child's voice suggesting taking a picture of the figure as a boy and then as a girl, implying a gender reveal concept.\nA pink mannequin head and two grey stones protrude from a mound of brown sand, while a child suggests taking photos of the figure as both a boy and a girl.\nThe scene is a static, top-down view of a sculpture constructed from brown sand, featuring a pink-colored mannequin head as the face and two small, grey stones positioned to represent the testicles, giving the figure a masculine form.\n\nA static, top-down view shows a sand sculpture with a pink mannequin head and two grey stones for testicles, while a child's voice suggests taking photos of the figure as both a boy and a girl.", "time_sec": 263.489, "generation_time_seconds": 167.7543, "selection_time_seconds": 94.9061, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 10.0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "58", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The boat motor roars as the small boat speeds across the vast blue water, creating splashes in its wake, before the wind takes over.", "pred": "A blue and white motorboat speeds across the water, leaving a wake, as the loud, high-pitched whine of its engine is heard.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A blue and white motorboat speeds across the water, leaving a wake, as the loud, high-pitched whine of its engine is heard.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA blue and white motorboat is seen moving at high speed across the water, creating a large wake, while the loud, high-pitched whine of its powerful engine dominates the audio.\nThe boat, viewed from a distance on a calm, blue body of water under a clear sky, is a blue and white cabin cruiser powered by an engine with a high-revving, high-frequency whine that is the only prominent sound.\nThe boat observed is a blue and white motorboat, powered by a high-revving engine whose sound is audible, indicating it is in motion on the water, which is consistent with the visual of the wake it creates.\n\nA blue and white motorboat speeds across the water, leaving a wake, as the loud, high-pitched whine of its engine is heard.", "time_sec": 235.053, "generation_time_seconds": 135.9995, "selection_time_seconds": 98.6049, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 37.5, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "59", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the midst of hissing steam, a man stands by a black train with red wheels.", "pred": "A black steam locomotive, Л-5231, with a red star emblem, emits thick white steam and the loud hissing and chuffing of its engine as it moves.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A black steam locomotive, Л-5231, with a red star emblem, emits thick white steam and the loud hissing and chuffing of its engine as it moves.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA black steam locomotive with red trim, the number Л-5231 and a red star emblem, emits large plumes of white steam as it begins to move, accompanied by the intense hissing and chuffing of its steam engine.\nThe visual shows a black steam locomotive, number Л-5231, with red accents and a red star, emitting white steam as it moves. The audio consists of the distinct hissing and chuffing sounds of a steam engine operating.\nThe locomotive is black with red accents, featuring a large red star emblem on the front, the number Л-5231 on its side, and a prominent smokestack emitting thick white steam. Steam is also seen escaping from various joints and pipes along the engine's frame. The soundscape is dominated by a powerful, rhythmic hissing and chuffing, which is the characteristic sound of a steam engine releasing pressure and exhausting steam from its cylinders.\n\nA black steam locomotive, Л-5231, with a red star emblem, emits thick white steam and the loud hissing and chuffing of its engine as it moves.", "time_sec": 306.586, "generation_time_seconds": 192.028, "selection_time_seconds": 114.1932, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 30.77, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "60", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man is using a tool to fix the engine of a motorcycle while speaking with distant hums and horns of passing traffic in the background.", "pred": "A person's hands manipulate a complex, silver-colored engine or turbine component with a yellow circular ring, while a man speaks in a non-English language in the background.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A person's hands manipulate a complex, silver-colored engine or turbine component with a yellow circular ring, while a man speaks in a non-English language in the background.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA person's hands manipulate a complex, silver-colored engine or motor on a blue stand, with a bright yellow circular component visible, while a man speaks in a non-English language in the background.\nAnalysis of the visual and audio streams confirms the following: The primary subject is a person's hands actively working on a piece of machinery. The machinery is predominantly silver and metallic, featuring fins, a cylindrical section, and a prominent, attached yellow circular component. It is mounted on a blue stand, suggesting it's a stationary, possibly exhibit or demonstration, object. The person's hands are engaged in manipulating a part of this machinery. Concurrently, the audio features a male voice speaking in what sounds like a South Asian language, with the speech being continuous and seemingly explanatory, indicating the person may be narrating the process they are demonstrating.\nA person's hands are adjusting and touching a detailed, silver-colored engine or turbine component with a yellow circular ring, while a man speaks in a non-English language in the background.\n\nA person's hands manipulate a complex, silver-colored engine or turbine component with a yellow circular ring, while a man speaks in a non-English language in the background.", "time_sec": 205.101, "generation_time_seconds": 131.4318, "selection_time_seconds": 73.2632, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 20.69, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "61", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The revving idling engine hums as a crowd of people excitedly takes photos of a concept car on display at the auto show.", "pred": "A white sports car is on display indoors as a powerful engine revs and tires screech.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A white sports car is on display indoors as a powerful engine revs and tires screech.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA shiny white sports car is on display indoors, surrounded by a crowd of people, while the sounds of a powerful, roaring engine and high-speed tires screeching on pavement are heard.\nThe car's low-slung body, single-frame headlights, and prominent hood scoop identify it as a modern high-performance coupe, likely a Porsche 911, positioned on a textured floor suggestive of a showroom or exhibition space.\nThe car's white paint, aerodynamic curves, and prominent hood scoop indicate a modern sports coupe.\n\nA white sports car is on display indoors as a powerful engine revs and tires screech.", "time_sec": 232.345, "generation_time_seconds": 144.781, "selection_time_seconds": 87.0405, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 25.0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "62", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The motorcycle's engine chugged slowly before revving up, parked on the side of the street with a close-up view of its engine .", "pred": "A stationary silver motorcycle with chrome engine and exhaust is shown as its engine is rapidly revved, producing a loud, chugging mechanical sound.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A stationary silver motorcycle with chrome engine and exhaust is shown as its engine is rapidly revved, producing a loud, chugging mechanical sound.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nObserving the stationary motorcycle, its chrome engine and exhaust are prominent, and the engine sound is heard revving.\nObserving the stationary motorcycle, its chrome engine and exhaust are prominent, and the engine sound is heard revving.\nThe chrome V-twin engine and polished exhaust pipes of a stationary motorcycle are visible on a paved surface as the engine is rapidly revved, producing a loud, chugging mechanical sound that increases in pitch and volume.\n\nA stationary silver motorcycle with chrome engine and exhaust is shown as its engine is rapidly revved, producing a loud, chugging mechanical sound.", "time_sec": 195.738, "generation_time_seconds": 116.6242, "selection_time_seconds": 78.0319, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 20.0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "63", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a game room, a child's cries are heard as a person blows their nose amidst computer mouse clicks, with a video game displayed on the screen.", "pred": "A small dog plays with a squeaky toy in a colorful cartoon room with animated characters.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A small dog plays with a squeaky toy in a colorful cartoon room with animated characters.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA blue cartoon character stands in a colorful animated room, with a small white dog on the floor and other characters in the background, while a high-pitched, frantic squeaking sound is heard.\nThe scene is a vibrant, cartoon-style room with a large pink door and a tree with yellow fruit, featuring several animated characters including a prominent blue creature, when a single, high-pitched squeak from an unseen animal is heard.\nA small, light-colored dog is visible on the floor in the foreground, and the high-pitched, repetitive squeaking sound is consistent with a dog playing with a squeaky toy.\n\nA small dog plays with a squeaky toy in a colorful cartoon room with animated characters.", "time_sec": 225.539, "generation_time_seconds": 144.5934, "selection_time_seconds": 80.6173, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 7.41, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "64", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a small room, a man's voice is heard followed by the sound of a camera muffling and footsteps shuffling, while a brown cardboard box kept on a wooden table next to a chair.", "pred": "A black metal pipe stand and two unfinished wooden arms are on a workbench, while a man's voice describes building the arms for his first model.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A black metal pipe stand and two unfinished wooden arms are on a workbench, while a man's voice describes building the arms for his first model.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video shows a workbench with a metal pipe stand, two wooden arms, and a red toolbox.\n The audio features a man describing the assembly process, mentioning a \"stand\" for his \"first model\" and starting on \"the arms.\"\nA black metal pipe stand and two unfinished wooden arms lie on a workbench, while a man's voice explains he is starting to build the arms for his first model.\nThe camera focuses on a black, cylindrical metal pipe mounted on a square base with two visible silver bolts; the pipe is hollow, and a red toolbox is positioned adjacent to it on a wooden workbench.\n\nA black metal pipe stand and two unfinished wooden arms are on a workbench, while a man's voice describes building the arms for his first model.", "time_sec": 219.17, "generation_time_seconds": 137.3889, "selection_time_seconds": 81.3891, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 16.67, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "65", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the forest, a man speaks amidst a swarm of bees buzzing around a tree branch with berries in forest.", "pred": "A dense thicket of green-leafed shrubs contains a large, dark, tangled mass, while a man speaks in French and a persistent buzzing sound is heard.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A dense thicket of green-leafed shrubs contains a large, dark, tangled mass, while a man speaks in French and a persistent buzzing sound is heard.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA dense thicket of green-leafed shrubs and thin, bare branches is shown, with a large, dark, tangled mass embedded within them, while a man's voice speaks in French and a persistent buzzing sound is heard.\nA dense thicket of green-leafed shrubs contains a large, dark, tangled mass, while a man's voice speaks French and a persistent buzzing sound is audible.\nThe visual shows a dense thicket of green-leafed shrubs, possibly elderberry, with numerous thin, bare branches, and a large, dark, irregular, tangled mass embedded within the foliage, resembling a large bird nest or a colony of insects. The audio consists of a male voice speaking in French and the continuous buzzing sound, which is consistent with the activity of a large number of insects.\n\nA dense thicket of green-leafed shrubs contains a large, dark, tangled mass, while a man speaks in French and a persistent buzzing sound is heard.", "time_sec": 252.533, "generation_time_seconds": 149.9961, "selection_time_seconds": 100.6802, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 21.43, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "66", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "An adult female speaks as a blue and white bus idles at a stop, with passengers boarding and vehicle traffic passing by on the city street.", "pred": "A city bus labeled B35 LIMITED is stopped with its doors open, accompanied by a loud, high-pitched engine sound.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A city bus labeled B35 LIMITED is stopped with its doors open, accompanied by a loud, high-pitched engine sound.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\n\\boxed{}\nA city bus, labeled B35 LIMITED on its front sign, is seen at a stop with its doors open for passengers. Simultaneously, a loud, high-pitched engine sound, possibly from the bus or a motorcycle, dominates the audio.\nThe bus's digital destination sign clearly displays \"B35 LIMITED\" in orange text, indicating its route and service type.\n\nA city bus labeled B35 LIMITED is stopped with its doors open, accompanied by a loud, high-pitched engine sound.", "time_sec": 228.154, "generation_time_seconds": 151.8636, "selection_time_seconds": 75.3903, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 13.79, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "67", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The sound of water running from a flushed toilet fills the tiled bathroom as a white toilet bowl with bubbles of water inside it is shown.", "pred": "A top-down view shows a white toilet bowl with swirling, foamy water during a flush, accompanied by the sound of rushing water and gurgling.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A top-down view shows a white toilet bowl with swirling, foamy water during a flush, accompanied by the sound of rushing water and gurgling.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA white toilet is seen from above, with water swirling rapidly as it flushes, while the sound of a toilet flush is heard.\nThe toilet bowl is full of foamy, swirling water, and the camera remains static, capturing the flush from a top-down perspective.\nThe toilet bowl contains foamy, swirling water, indicating the flush is in progress, and a static, top-down camera angle provides a clear view of the action.\n\nA top-down view shows a white toilet bowl with swirling, foamy water during a flush, accompanied by the sound of rushing water and gurgling.", "time_sec": 207.11, "generation_time_seconds": 132.4573, "selection_time_seconds": 73.6107, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 38.71, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "68", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man's voice narrates as a child yells, with an aircraft flying in the distance, while a little girl stands on a swing overlooking the ocean and a young boy rides a skateboard on a boat deck.", "pred": "On a green-floored vessel with metal railings, a child stands near a body of water as a large engine rumbles and a man announces they are going to Cebu.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "On a green-floored vessel with metal railings, a child stands near a body of water as a large engine rumbles and a man announces they are going to Cebu.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA young child in a purple shirt stands on a green-floored vessel with a metal railing, overlooking a body of water where another boat is docked; the rumbling of a large engine is heard as a man says they are going to Cebu.\nThe scene is on a vessel with green non-slip flooring and a silver metal safety railing; a young child in a purple top is visible, with a body of water and another boat in the background; the prominent continuous low-frequency rumbling is consistent with a large diesel engine, and a male voice states the destination is Cebu.\nThe visual evidence from the high-angle shot on a vessel with green flooring and metal railings, combined with the prominent, continuous low-frequency rumbling of a large engine and the spoken destination of Cebu, indicates the recording was made on a moving boat.\n\nOn a green-floored vessel with metal railings, a child stands near a body of water as a large engine rumbles and a man announces they are going to Cebu.", "time_sec": 247.995, "generation_time_seconds": 155.9304, "selection_time_seconds": 90.3147, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 10.81, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "69", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A white sports car accelerates down the highway, passing a train and a truck, with the wind roaring and the sun shining through the windshield.", "pred": "A white sports car accelerates aggressively down a drag strip, its engine emitting a powerful, escalating roar before a sharp, high-pitched tire screech indicates rapid acceleration or burnout.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A white sports car accelerates aggressively down a drag strip, its engine emitting a powerful, escalating roar before a sharp, high-pitched tire screech indicates rapid acceleration or burnout.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA white car accelerates hard down a drag strip, its engine roaring loudly, followed by a sharp screech and a high-pitched whine as it speeds away from the camera.\nThe scene opens with a view from a white sports car's hood, showing it about to start on a drag strip.\n The car accelerates rapidly, and the sound is a powerful, deep roar that quickly intensifies.\n The roar is immediately followed by a very loud, high-frequency tire screech, indicating a loss of traction or a burnout.\n This is then replaced by a rising, high-pitched mechanical whine, characteristic of a high-performance engine and transmission under extreme load.\n The car sounds extremely powerful and fast as it moves away from the starting line.\nA white sports car accelerates aggressively down a drag strip, its engine emitting a powerful, escalating roar before a sharp, high-pitched tire screech indicates rapid acceleration or burnout.\n\nA white sports car accelerates aggressively down a drag strip, its engine emitting a powerful, escalating roar before a sharp, high-pitched tire screech indicates rapid acceleration or burnout.", "time_sec": 242.937, "generation_time_seconds": 148.3694, "selection_time_seconds": 94.1318, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 27.03, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "70", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A muffled helicopter engine flying over a tree-filled lake in a park.", "pred": "A red and white helicopter flies over a grassy, wooded area, its main rotor blades producing a loud, rhythmic chopping sound.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A red and white helicopter flies over a grassy, wooded area, its main rotor blades producing a loud, rhythmic chopping sound.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA red and white helicopter is flying outdoors in a grassy, wooded area, while a loud helicopter engine sound is heard.\nA red and white helicopter is visible in mid-air over a grassy, wooded area, while the distinct sound of a helicopter's main rotor blades spinning is heard.\nThe helicopter, positioned in the upper right, is red and white with black markings. It is flying over an open field with bare trees in the background, consistent with the sound of its main rotor blades.\n\nA red and white helicopter flies over a grassy, wooded area, its main rotor blades producing a loud, rhythmic chopping sound.", "time_sec": 209.617, "generation_time_seconds": 121.8516, "selection_time_seconds": 87.2591, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 16.0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "71", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A woman in a red and black jacket is speaking over a microphone on stage.", "pred": "A woman in a red cardigan and patterned trousers stands on a stage before a large yellow screen, speaking into a lapel microphone while holding a black clicker.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A woman in a red cardigan and patterned trousers stands on a stage before a large yellow screen, speaking into a lapel microphone while holding a black clicker.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA woman in a red jacket stands on a stage before a large yellow screen, speaking into a lapel microphone and holding a clicker as her voice describes a song and an annual convention.\nBased on the audio, the woman is speaking about a song titled \"Light the Fire Within\" and a convention named \"Light It Up.\"\nThe speaker is a woman in a red cardigan and patterned trousers, standing on a stage before a large, bright yellow LED wall, holding a black clicker in her right hand as she speaks into a lapel microphone.\n\nA woman in a red cardigan and patterned trousers stands on a stage before a large yellow screen, speaking into a lapel microphone while holding a black clicker.", "time_sec": 211.264, "generation_time_seconds": 137.7304, "selection_time_seconds": 72.5616, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 46.15, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "72", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the video, a young woman in a blue skirt is seen holding a paper as a speech in front of a door.", "pred": "A young woman in a blue and white patterned dress stands indoors, reading from a paper and speaking about medical abortion and the abortion pill.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A young woman in a blue and white patterned dress stands indoors, reading from a paper and speaking about medical abortion and the abortion pill.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA young woman in a patterned dress stands indoors, reading from a sheet of paper and speaking about medical abortion and the abortion pill.\nThe woman is wearing a blue and white patterned sleeveless dress, and the background consists of a white panelled door and a light blue wall with a thermostat and light switch.\nThe woman, wearing a blue, white, and green patterned sleeveless dress, stands in front of a white panelled door, holding and reading from a single sheet of white paper, while a white thermostat and light switch are visible on the adjacent light blue wall.\n\nA young woman in a blue and white patterned dress stands indoors, reading from a paper and speaking about medical abortion and the abortion pill.", "time_sec": 199.1, "generation_time_seconds": 124.7549, "selection_time_seconds": 74.055, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 29.63, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "73", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The booming engines of cars racing on the highway as a red car speeds down the road in the right lane.", "pred": "A high-performance vehicle with a supercharger launches with a rapid engine spool and acceleration on a paved drag strip.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A high-performance vehicle with a supercharger launches with a rapid engine spool and acceleration on a paved drag strip.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nTwo small white cars race down a drag strip as a large truck idles nearby, while a powerful engine revs and accelerates to a high-pitched whine.\nThe initial observation of two white cars racing is accurate, but the subsequent description of a \"large truck idling nearby\" is a hallucination. The audio provides a critical clue: a powerful engine revs and accelerates. The visual scene cannot be fully described without acknowledging this dominant sound. The initial visual of a drag race is correct, but the final description of the engine sound lacks specificity. A more accurate audio analysis is needed to complete the objective, high-density description.\nA powerful, high-revving engine with a whining supercharger spools up and accelerates rapidly, indicating a high-performance vehicle is performing a launch on a paved drag strip.\n\nA high-performance vehicle with a supercharger launches with a rapid engine spool and acceleration on a paved drag strip.", "time_sec": 240.516, "generation_time_seconds": 179.7955, "selection_time_seconds": 60.357, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "74", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A woman standing at a podium giving a speech while playing a musical instrument in a quiet environment.", "pred": "A woman in a colorful headwrap and glasses speaks at a podium, with a \"NIGERIA\" banner visible behind her.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A woman in a colorful headwrap and glasses speaks at a podium, with a \"NIGERIA\" banner visible behind her.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA woman wearing a colorful headwrap and glasses speaks into a microphone at a podium, with a banner displaying \"1914 - 2014\" and \"NIGERIA\" in the background.\nA woman in a colorful headwrap and glasses speaks at a podium, with a \"NIGERIA\" banner visible behind her.\nA woman wearing a colorful headwrap and glasses speaks at a podium.\n\nA woman in a colorful headwrap and glasses speaks at a podium, with a \"NIGERIA\" banner visible behind her.", "time_sec": 207.874, "generation_time_seconds": 120.9639, "selection_time_seconds": 86.4826, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 19.05, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "75", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the serene ambiance of a bathroom, water softly flows as a man speaks amidst the presence of a shower head, a toothbrush, an umbrella on a tripod, and a person holding a plunger.", "pred": "A hand presses a button on a dark green metal detector's control panel, causing it to emit a rapid, high-pitched electronic beep as a man speaks.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A hand presses a button on a dark green metal detector's control panel, causing it to emit a rapid, high-pitched electronic beep as a man speaks.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA hand presses a button on a dark green metal object with a digital display, which then emits a high-pitched, rapid, electronic beeping sound as a man speaks.\nA hand presses a button on a dark green, cylindrical metal object with a digital display, which then emits a rapid, high-pitched electronic beeping sound.\nThe object is a metal detector, as indicated by the control panel, the long shaft, and the \"SENSITIVITY\" setting mentioned in the audio.\n\nA hand presses a button on a dark green metal detector's control panel, causing it to emit a rapid, high-pitched electronic beep as a man speaks.", "time_sec": 235.605, "generation_time_seconds": 165.3193, "selection_time_seconds": 69.5238, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 11.43, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "76", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The soothing sound of water trickling and dripping accompanies a bustling crowd's chatter, as a man captures a mesmerizing image of fish swimming in a large aquarium.", "pred": "A black electronic device with water droplets on its surface displays a colorful aquarium scene, accompanied by a continuous low-frequency hum and the sound of a high-pressure water spray.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A black electronic device with water droplets on its surface displays a colorful aquarium scene, accompanied by a continuous low-frequency hum and the sound of a high-pressure water spray.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe scene displays a black electronic device, possibly a speaker or monitor, with water droplets on its surface and a glass screen. The audio consists of a continuous, low-frequency hum, likely from a machine, and the prominent sound of a high-pressure water spray, such as from a hose or cleaning apparatus.\nA black electronic device with water droplets on its surface is shown, accompanied by the sound of a continuous low-frequency hum and the prominent noise of a high-pressure water spray.\nThe object is a black electronic device, possibly a speaker, with water droplets on its surface, and its screen is lit, displaying a colorful underwater scene with fish and coral. The audio consists of a continuous, low-frequency mechanical hum and the distinct, high-pressure sound of a water spray.\n\nA black electronic device with water droplets on its surface displays a colorful aquarium scene, accompanied by a continuous low-frequency hum and the sound of a high-pressure water spray.", "time_sec": 230.344, "generation_time_seconds": 153.0068, "selection_time_seconds": 76.9576, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 16.67, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "77", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man in a red shirt and black tie plays a musical instrument on stage at night, while a person whistles along to the music in the background.", "pred": "A man in a red shirt gestures at a microphone on a dim stage as a loud, high-pitched melody from a reedy wind instrument plays over a low hum.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A man in a red shirt gestures at a microphone on a dim stage as a loud, high-pitched melody from a reedy wind instrument plays over a low hum.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA man with brown hair in a red shirt under a black jacket stands at a microphone on a dimly lit stage, with a person partially visible behind him.\nThe audio consists of a rapid, high-pitched, and somewhat chaotic melody from a reedy wind instrument, possibly a calliope or a music box, playing over a low-frequency hum.\nThe man has his mouth open and his right hand raised with fingers extended, as if gesturing or speaking, while the loud, high-pitched melody of a wind instrument and a low hum fill the audio.\nThe man has his mouth open and his right hand raised with fingers extended, as if gesturing or speaking, while the loud, high-pitched melody of a wind instrument and a low hum fill the audio.\n\nA man in a red shirt gestures at a microphone on a dim stage as a loud, high-pitched melody from a reedy wind instrument plays over a low hum.", "time_sec": 222.119, "generation_time_seconds": 141.166, "selection_time_seconds": 80.4967, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 36.36, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "78", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The high frequency humming followed by a smack woke up the person sleeping on the bed with a blanket and pillow and drone making sound.", "pred": "A person sleeps under a zebra-striped blanket in a wooden crib with red bedding, while the high-pitched whirring of a power tool is heard repeatedly in the background.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A person sleeps under a zebra-striped blanket in a wooden crib with red bedding, while the high-pitched whirring of a power tool is heard repeatedly in the background.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA person sleeps under a zebra-striped blanket in a crib, while the loud, high-pitched whirring of a power tool is heard repeatedly in the background.\nFrom the visual, a human figure is lying down under a black and white striped blanket inside a wooden crib with red bedding, suggesting sleep or rest. Simultaneously, the audio contains a distinct, repetitive 'whirring' sound characteristic of a high-speed power tool being actively used. The environment appears to be a furnished indoor room with curtains and a wardrobe.\nThe person under the blanket is in a wooden crib with red bedding, positioned in a room with beige curtains and a wardrobe, while the audio captures the sound of a high-speed power tool being used.\n\nA person sleeps under a zebra-striped blanket in a wooden crib with red bedding, while the high-pitched whirring of a power tool is heard repeatedly in the background.", "time_sec": 217.918, "generation_time_seconds": 141.671, "selection_time_seconds": 74.8637, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 12.9, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "79", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The actress is seen accepting the award for Best Actress on stage while a female voice speaks continuously.and background visible all frames", "pred": "A woman in a dark blue, one-shoulder dress with a black bow holds a golden award and speaks into a microphone on a stage with a backdrop displaying \"PIPPIN\" and \"DIRECTION OF A MUSICAL.\"", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A woman in a dark blue, one-shoulder dress with a black bow holds a golden award and speaks into a microphone on a stage with a backdrop displaying \"PIPPIN\" and \"DIRECTION OF A MUSICAL.\"", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe woman is wearing a dark blue, one-shoulder dress with a large black bow, holding a golden trophy and speaking into a microphone.\nThe woman's dark blue strapless gown has a large black bow on her right shoulder, and she is holding a golden award while speaking into a microphone on a stage with a marquee backdrop.\nA woman in a dark blue, one-shoulder dress with a black bow holds a golden award and speaks into a microphone on a stage with a backdrop displaying \"PIPPIN\" and \"DIRECTION OF A MUSICAL.\"\n\nA woman in a dark blue, one-shoulder dress with a black bow holds a golden award and speaks into a microphone on a stage with a backdrop displaying \"PIPPIN\" and \"DIRECTION OF A MUSICAL.\"", "time_sec": 253.19, "generation_time_seconds": 133.1004, "selection_time_seconds": 119.2738, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 17.65, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "80", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man stands next to a horse as the wind blows, a distant goat bleats, and women speak softly in the background.", "pred": "\\boxed{\\text{A person in dark clothing kneels on the grass, grooming a dark horse lying on its side while a light brown horse stands nearby and a small goat stands on the dark horse's back; an animal bleats as a female voice exclaims, \"Oh my gosh,\" followed by, \"The baby's running around on Rio.\"}}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "\\boxed{\\text{A person in dark clothing kneels on the grass, grooming a dark horse lying on its side while a light brown horse stands nearby and a small goat stands on the dark horse's back; an animal bleats as a female voice exclaims, \"Oh my gosh,\" followed by, \"The baby's running around on Rio.\"}}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA person in dark clothing kneels on the grass, grooming a dark horse lying on its side while a light brown horse stands nearby and a small goat stands on the dark horse's back; an animal bleats as a female voice exclaims, \"Oh my gosh,\" followed by, \"The baby's running around on Rio.\"\nObserving the visual scene, the dark horse is lying on its side on the grass. The person is leaning over it, with hands placed on its head and neck area. A small, light-colored goat is standing squarely on the dark horse's back. A light brown horse is standing beside them. In the background, a wire fence and a line of trees are visible. The audio contains a goat bleating, a woman's surprised exclamation \"Oh my gosh,\" and a comment about a \"baby\" (the goat) running around on a horse named \"Rio.\"\nA person in dark clothing kneels on the grass, grooming a dark horse lying on its side while a light brown horse stands nearby and a small goat stands on the dark horse's back; an animal bleats as a female voice exclaims, \"Oh my gosh,\" followed by, \"The baby's running around on Rio.\"\n\nA person in dark clothing kneels on the grass, grooming a dark horse lying on its side while a light brown horse stands nearby and a small goat stands on the dark horse's back; an animal bleats as a female voice exclaims, \"Oh my gosh,\" followed by, \"The baby's running around on Rio.\"\n\n\\boxed{\\text{A person in dark clothing kneels on the grass, grooming a dark horse lying on its side while a light brown horse stands nearby and a small goat stands on the dark horse's back; an animal bleats as a female voice exclaims, \"Oh my gosh,\" followed by, \"The baby's running around on Rio.\"}}", "time_sec": 300.468, "generation_time_seconds": 193.6324, "selection_time_seconds": 106.2439, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 16.33, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "81", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The sound of rattling accompanies a man riding a motorcycle on a trail through a wooded area.", "pred": "A helmeted rider on a white dirt bike with a star decal accelerates downhill on a narrow forest trail, the sound of its engine growing louder before the rider passes the camera and continues on a muddy path, all while a man's loud shout is followed by laughter and the sound of splashing water.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A helmeted rider on a white dirt bike with a star decal accelerates downhill on a narrow forest trail, the sound of its engine growing louder before the rider passes the camera and continues on a muddy path, all while a man's loud shout is followed by laughter and the sound of splashing water.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA motocross rider in protective gear approaches on a dirt bike, and a person can be heard laughing as the bike's engine revs.\nAfter the rider passes, the sound of the engine idling is accompanied by a man shouting a word, followed by laughter and the sound of splashing water, possibly as the rider continues on a muddy trail.\nA helmeted rider on a white dirt bike with a star decal accelerates downhill on a narrow forest trail, the sound of its engine growing louder before the rider passes the camera and continues on a muddy path, all while a man's loud shout is followed by laughter and the sound of splashing water.\n\nA helmeted rider on a white dirt bike with a star decal accelerates downhill on a narrow forest trail, the sound of its engine growing louder before the rider passes the camera and continues on a muddy path, all while a man's loud shout is followed by laughter and the sound of splashing water.", "time_sec": 257.247, "generation_time_seconds": 147.984, "selection_time_seconds": 108.6878, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 9.52, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "82", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the midst of hissing background noises, a man speaks under a night sky resembling a block of cheese, with a view of the moon and stars twinkling above.", "pred": "A static, dark, mottled surface with a small, textured, light-colored object in the upper-left corner is shown, while a male voice speaks about maintaining a constant flow of 40 psi through a 1/8 orifice.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A static, dark, mottled surface with a small, textured, light-colored object in the upper-left corner is shown, while a male voice speaks about maintaining a constant flow of 40 psi through a 1/8 orifice.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA dark, textured surface with a small, light-colored object in the upper-left corner is shown, while a male voice speaks about maintaining a constant flow of 40 psi through a one-eighth orifice.\nThe static, dark, textured background has a small, light-colored object in its upper-left corner; simultaneously, a male voice speaks about maintaining a constant flow of 40 psi through a 1/8 orifice.\nThe frame displays a static, dark, mottled surface, likely a fabric, with a small, textured, light-colored object in the upper-left corner, coinciding with a male voice discussing an air pressure system.\n\nA static, dark, mottled surface with a small, textured, light-colored object in the upper-left corner is shown, while a male voice speaks about maintaining a constant flow of 40 psi through a 1/8 orifice.", "time_sec": 194.829, "generation_time_seconds": 131.4615, "selection_time_seconds": 62.9484, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 5.26, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "83", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A young man in a hat and t-shirt sits on a couch holding a white tablet, speaking followed by a digital beep.", "pred": "A young man in a white cap and black t-shirt sits on a couch, holding up a video game case while speaking, followed by a series of electronic beeps.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A young man in a white cap and black t-shirt sits on a couch, holding up a video game case while speaking, followed by a series of electronic beeps.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA young man wearing a white baseball cap and a black \"TEAM LVFT\" t-shirt sits on a couch and speaks, holding up a small rectangular object.\nA man in a white baseball cap and black t-shirt sits on a couch, holding up a small, rectangular object while speaking.\nThe young man on the couch is holding a physical video game case with green and white packaging, which he presents to the camera.\n\nA young man in a white cap and black t-shirt sits on a couch, holding up a video game case while speaking, followed by a series of electronic beeps.", "time_sec": 222.998, "generation_time_seconds": 120.8965, "selection_time_seconds": 101.3953, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 58.06, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "84", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a dimly lit room, a young woman with glasses holding a smartphone bursts into laughter after taking a picture, accompanied by loud burps and giggles from her friends.", "pred": "A person with long dark hair and glasses is seen in a dim, wooden, enclosed space as a loud, high-pitched electronic beep sounds.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A person with long dark hair and glasses is seen in a dim, wooden, enclosed space as a loud, high-pitched electronic beep sounds.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe camera points at a person with long dark hair and glasses, who begins to burp, followed by a loud, high-pitched laugh.\nThe camera, positioned at a low angle, shows a person with long dark hair and glasses in the foreground, while a loud, high-pitched, and sustained electronic beep is heard in the background.\nThe camera is positioned at a low angle, looking up at the person and the wooden structure above them, in a dimly lit, enclosed space.\n\nA person with long dark hair and glasses is seen in a dim, wooden, enclosed space as a loud, high-pitched electronic beep sounds.", "time_sec": 196.822, "generation_time_seconds": 130.7598, "selection_time_seconds": 65.635, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 11.11, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "85", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A cheerful scene with female speech and laughter accompanied by birds chirping and rustling, as various birds interact with toys and food on tables.", "pred": "Two green and orange parrots interact on a yellow fabric surface as a person speaks and the birds chirp.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "Two green and orange parrots interact on a yellow fabric surface as a person speaks and the birds chirp.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nTwo green and orange parrots are on a yellow fabric surface; one walks away as the other pecks at a red object, while a person speaks and a high-pitched, repetitive chirping sound is heard.\nBased on the audio, the high-pitched chirping is consistent with a small pet bird, which aligns with the visual of the parrots present in the scene.\nThe video shows two small parrots with green wings and orange heads on a textured yellow fabric surface, which appears to be a pet enclosure or playpen; the parrots interact with each other and with small objects, including a red item, while a human voice and the birds' chirping sounds are audible.\n\nTwo green and orange parrots interact on a yellow fabric surface as a person speaks and the birds chirp.", "time_sec": 233.149, "generation_time_seconds": 139.21, "selection_time_seconds": 92.9821, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 14.81, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "86", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A white sports car speeds down the road at sunset, sirens blaring, as a man urgently speaks.", "pred": "A police car with flashing blue lights and a wailing siren is shown at night, followed by a first-person view of a white sports car racing on a highway during the day, accompanied by a radio dispatch stating, \"10-44 in progress, call all units, code 3.\"", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A police car with flashing blue lights and a wailing siren is shown at night, followed by a first-person view of a white sports car racing on a highway during the day, accompanied by a radio dispatch stating, \"10-44 in progress, call all units, code 3.\"", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA police car with flashing blue lights is driving at night, its siren wailing, before the view shifts to a first-person perspective of a white sports car racing down a multi-lane highway during the day; in the background, a radio transmission is heard saying, \"10-44 in progress, call all units, code 3.\".\nThe initial scene shows a blue and white police vehicle at night, its emergency lights flashing blue, with a corresponding loud, electronic siren wailing. The scene then abruptly cuts to a daytime, first-person view from inside a race car, while a male voice on a radio continues a dispatch message.\nThe scene opens with a close-up of a blue and white police car, its roof-mounted emergency lights flashing a distinct blue hue, while a loud, electronic siren is audible. The visual perspective then immediately changes to a first-person view from a white sports car racing down a multi-lane highway in daylight, as a radio transmission from a dispatcher with a slightly distorted, synthesized voice reports, \"10-44 in progress, call all units, code 3.\"\n\nA police car with flashing blue lights and a wailing siren is shown at night, followed by a first-person view of a white sports car racing on a highway during the day, accompanied by a radio dispatch stating, \"10-44 in progress, call all units, code 3.\"", "time_sec": 272.366, "generation_time_seconds": 171.1276, "selection_time_seconds": 100.5464, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 14.63, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "87", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The chaotic night scene is filled with the deafening wail of an emergency siren and the roaring engine of a large truck as vehicles speed down the street.", "pred": "A high-intensity, fluctuating electronic siren with a distinct rising and falling pitch, characteristic of an emergency vehicle like a fire truck, is heard from the right side of the frame, suggesting its movement relative to the stationary recording point and the presence of a significant vehicle nearby.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A high-intensity, fluctuating electronic siren with a distinct rising and falling pitch, characteristic of an emergency vehicle like a fire truck, is heard from the right side of the frame, suggesting its movement relative to the stationary recording point and the presence of a significant vehicle nearby.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA nighttime roadside scene features a bright streetlamp illuminating the road, the rear of a white trailer with a logo, and distant red taillights; simultaneously, a loud, high-pitched electronic siren wails continuously, rising and falling in pitch.\n\\boxed{}\nA high-intensity, fluctuating electronic siren with a distinct rising and falling pitch, characteristic of an emergency vehicle like a fire truck, is heard from the right side of the frame, suggesting its movement relative to the stationary recording point and the presence of a significant vehicle nearby.\n\nA high-intensity, fluctuating electronic siren with a distinct rising and falling pitch, characteristic of an emergency vehicle like a fire truck, is heard from the right side of the frame, suggesting its movement relative to the stationary recording point and the presence of a significant vehicle nearby.", "time_sec": 222.427, "generation_time_seconds": 143.7076, "selection_time_seconds": 78.2527, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 13.04, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "88", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "On stage at an event, a man and a woman engage in conversation, a bell rings, and a cat meows, and a crowd applause.", "pred": "A man in a dark jacket stands at a lectern on a stage before a seated audience, a large screen behind him showing a close-up of animal legs, while a presenter introduces a \"Professor\" and the audience applauds.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A man in a dark jacket stands at a lectern on a stage before a seated audience, a large screen behind him showing a close-up of animal legs, while a presenter introduces a \"Professor\" and the audience applauds.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA man in a dark jacket approaches a lectern on a stage before a seated audience, where a large screen behind him displays a close-up of animal legs, and the audio captures a presenter introducing a \"Professor\" amidst audience applause.\nA man in a dark jacket stands at a lectern before a seated audience, a large screen behind him showing a close-up of animal legs, while a presenter introduces a \"Professor\" and the audience applauds.\nThe stage features two teams, labeled \"#TeamCats\" and \"#TeamDogs\", with a central lectern, and a large screen above them displaying a video of animal legs that appears to be part of the presentation.\n\nA man in a dark jacket stands at a lectern on a stage before a seated audience, a large screen behind him showing a close-up of animal legs, while a presenter introduces a \"Professor\" and the audience applauds.", "time_sec": 212.511, "generation_time_seconds": 141.1055, "selection_time_seconds": 70.647, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 11.76, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "89", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a lush green field next to a white fence, a man speaks as a woman screams, accompanied by the distant clip clops of horses.", "pred": "A person on a brown and white horse jumps a white fence in a grassy field as a man says, \"There they go,\" a child cheers, and a woman remarks, \"I think I let him out of the ring.\"", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A person on a brown and white horse jumps a white fence in a grassy field as a man says, \"There they go,\" a child cheers, and a woman remarks, \"I think I let him out of the ring.\"", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA person on a brown and white horse jumps over a white fence in a grassy, fenced-in field while a male voice says, \"There they go,\" followed by a child's excited \"Woo,\" and a woman's voice saying, \"I think I let him out of the ring.\"\nA person on a brown and white horse jumps over a white fence in a grassy, fenced-in field while a male voice says, \"There they go,\" followed by a child's excited \"Woo,\" and a woman's voice saying, \"I think I let him out of the ring.\"\nA person on a brown and white horse jumps over a white fence in a grassy, fenced-in field while a male voice says, \"There they go,\" followed by a child's excited \"Woo,\" and a woman's voice saying, \"I think I let him out of the ring.\"\n\nA person on a brown and white horse jumps a white fence in a grassy field as a man says, \"There they go,\" a child cheers, and a woman remarks, \"I think I let him out of the ring.\"", "time_sec": 256.029, "generation_time_seconds": 163.467, "selection_time_seconds": 91.8592, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 25.64, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "90", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A red and yellow train, accompanied by a truck, travels down the tracks as the train horn blows and the signal beeps in the background.", "pred": "A red and black BNSF locomotive leads a freight train moving from left to right, passing a white trailer under a clear sky while its horn sounds.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A red and black BNSF locomotive leads a freight train moving from left to right, passing a white trailer under a clear sky while its horn sounds.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nObservation: The video shows a train composed of several locomotives, predominantly colored red and black with yellow and orange accents.\nObservation: The leading locomotive clearly displays the \"BNSF\" logo on its side.\nObservation: The locomotives have visible steps, handrails, and ladders, indicating access for crew.\nObservation: The train is moving from left to right across the frame.\nObservation: The sky is a clear, light blue, suggesting a bright, sunny day.\nObservation: To the far left, a white trailer or container is partially visible.\nObservation: A yellow, diamond-shaped\nA red and black BNSF locomotive leads a freight train moving from left to right, passing a white trailer under a clear sky while its horn sounds.\nThe image displays a multi-unit freight train in motion. The composition is a side profile, with the train occupying the majority of the frame and moving horizontally. The leading locomotive is red with black and yellow-orange striping, featuring the \"BNSF\" logo in bold yellow letters. The train consists of at least three visible units. The environment is bright, indicated by the clear sky and strong sunlight, which casts distinct shadows beneath the train. A white trailer is partially visible on the far left, and a yellow, diamond-shaped railroad crossing sign is on the right.\n\nA red and black BNSF locomotive leads a freight train moving from left to right, passing a white trailer under a clear sky while its horn sounds.", "time_sec": 291.617, "generation_time_seconds": 193.5066, "selection_time_seconds": 97.4391, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 17.65, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "91", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the darkness of the night, a man's voice squeals and rustles as a lion hides in tall grass and bushes.", "pred": "A red fox with a bushy tail moves through dense, dry brush and green foliage, its head turning as it is called by a person who says \"Go get it\" and \"Bring it.\"", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A red fox with a bushy tail moves through dense, dry brush and green foliage, its head turning as it is called by a person who says \"Go get it\" and \"Bring it.\"", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA reddish-brown animal with a long, bushy tail is partially concealed among dense, dry branches and green undergrowth, its head and hindquarters visible as it moves slightly within the thicket.\nThe animal is identifiable as a fox by its distinct reddish-brown fur, pointed snout, and especially its long, bushy tail.\n It is actively moving through a dense thicket with a mix of dry, tangled branches and green leafy undergrowth.\n The fox's head is turned slightly towards the camera, allowing for a clear view of its face and prominent ears.\n The animal appears alert and is looking down and forward, seemingly focused on something out of frame.\n It is positioned low to the ground, partially obscured by the surrounding vegetation.\n This scene is not a static image but a continuous video sequence where the fox makes small,\nA red fox with a bushy tail moves through dense, dry brush and green foliage, its head turning as it is called by a person who says \"Go get it\" and \"Bring it.\"\n\nA red fox with a bushy tail moves through dense, dry brush and green foliage, its head turning as it is called by a person who says \"Go get it\" and \"Bring it.\"", "time_sec": 234.414, "generation_time_seconds": 141.5015, "selection_time_seconds": 91.5515, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "92", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the audio, two men are chatting and laughing, while in the visual, a person is holding a controller and playing a free video game available on operating system software.", "pred": "A person's hands sort trading cards on a \"Yu-Gi-Oh! World Championship Qualifier Regional 2015\" playmat as a man lists card names and others laugh.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A person's hands sort trading cards on a \"Yu-Gi-Oh! World Championship Qualifier Regional 2015\" playmat as a man lists card names and others laugh.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe scene shows a person's hands manipulating trading cards on a Yu-Gi-Oh! World Championship Qualifier Regional 2015 playmat.\nA person's hands are shown sorting and placing trading cards on a \"Yu-Gi-Oh! World Championship Qualifier Regional 2015\" playmat while a man speaks and others laugh in the background.\nThe static shot focuses on a person's hands actively handling a stack of trading cards, placing them onto a colorful playmat.\n The playmat features anime-style characters and text identifying it as official merchandise for the \"Yu-Gi-Oh! TRADING CARD GAME WORLD CHAMPIONSHIP QUALIFIER REGIONAL 2015\" in Mexico City, confirmed by the visible text.\n Simultaneously, the audio captures a casual conversation between two men, where one lists card names like \"Maxx 'C',\" \"Stinko,\" and \"fusion,\" with other people laughing, suggesting a relaxed social atmosphere typical of a card game tournament\n\nA person's hands sort trading cards on a \"Yu-Gi-Oh! World Championship Qualifier Regional 2015\" playmat as a man lists card names and others laugh.", "time_sec": 262.307, "generation_time_seconds": 153.2756, "selection_time_seconds": 108.293, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "93", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The sound of children screaming mixes with a man's laughter, followed by a whisper and a young boy's voice, as a child  hugs a young girl at the bottom of the stairs of a house, with a woman standing nearby.", "pred": "A young girl runs from a couch where a man sits, past a staircase, and is grabbed by a woman in a gray top near the stairs, as a child's high-pitched scream abruptly cuts off and a male voice says, \"Got it.\".", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A young girl runs from a couch where a man sits, past a staircase, and is grabbed by a woman in a gray top near the stairs, as a child's high-pitched scream abruptly cuts off and a male voice says, \"Got it.\".", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA young girl in a striped top runs past a man on a leopard-print couch and is then playfully grabbed by a woman in a gray shirt near a staircase, as a child's high-pitched laughter and a male voice saying \"got it\" are heard.\nA young girl runs from a couch with a man towards a staircase where a woman grabs her, while a child screams and a male voice says, \"got it.\"\nA young girl runs from a couch where a man sits, past a staircase, and is grabbed by a woman in a gray top near the stairs, as a child's high-pitched scream abruptly cuts off and a male voice says, \"Got it.\".\n\nA young girl runs from a couch where a man sits, past a staircase, and is grabbed by a woman in a gray top near the stairs, as a child's high-pitched scream abruptly cuts off and a male voice says, \"Got it.\".", "time_sec": 226.761, "generation_time_seconds": 149.8596, "selection_time_seconds": 76.3479, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 21.28, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "94", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The sound of rustling followed by a brief speech accompanies the visual of a white toilet bowl with water inside in a bathroom setting.", "pred": "\\boxed{\\text{A close-up shows the inside of a white toilet bowl as a person says, \"now I'll make it flush\" just before a large rush of water creates a loud, gurgling sound.}}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "\\boxed{\\text{A close-up shows the inside of a white toilet bowl as a person says, \"now I'll make it flush\" just before a large rush of water creates a loud, gurgling sound.}}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video shows a white toilet bowl, while the audio captures a person speaking just before a powerful, gurgling flush sound begins.\nThe audio confirms the visual action by describing the event as a 'flush' immediately before the loud, gurgling sound of water rushing into the bowl is heard.\nA close-up shows the inside of a white toilet bowl as a person says, \"now I'll make it flush\" just before a large rush of water creates a loud, gurgling sound.\n\nA close-up shows the inside of a white toilet bowl as a person says, \"now I'll make it flush\" just before a large rush of water creates a loud, gurgling sound.\n\n\\boxed{\\text{A close-up shows the inside of a white toilet bowl as a person says, \"now I'll make it flush\" just before a large rush of water creates a loud, gurgling sound.}}", "time_sec": 204.877, "generation_time_seconds": 123.1804, "selection_time_seconds": 81.2313, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 34.29, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "95", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a kitchen with a small white dog on the floor, amidst a blue sky of hope and love, white noise is followed by muffled speech and rustling.", "pred": "A small white dog runs across a tiled kitchen floor toward an open cabinet door, with a person's legs and a chair visible in the background.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A small white dog runs across a tiled kitchen floor toward an open cabinet door, with a person's legs and a chair visible in the background.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA small white dog runs in a kitchen toward a partially open cabinet door, while a person's foot and a chair are visible nearby.\nA small white dog runs across a tiled floor in a kitchen toward an open cabinet door, while a person's lower body and a chair are visible in the background.\nA small white dog runs across a tiled floor in a kitchen toward an open cabinet door, while a person's lower body and a chair are visible in the background.\n\nA small white dog runs across a tiled kitchen floor toward an open cabinet door, with a person's legs and a chair visible in the background.", "time_sec": 197.64, "generation_time_seconds": 130.7913, "selection_time_seconds": 66.514, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 30.3, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "96", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The sound of footsteps approaching a sliding door, followed by a man speaking, then the door creaking shut, in a small kitchen with white cabinets and a refrigerator.and towels also.", "pred": "A person opens a white door with a creaking sound, revealing a laundry closet with a white top-loading washing machine and dryer, then closes the door.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A person opens a white door with a creaking sound, revealing a laundry closet with a white top-loading washing machine and dryer, then closes the door.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA white washing machine and dryer are visible in a laundry closet as a person opens the cabinet door with a creaking sound and then closes it.\nA white top-loading washing machine and dryer are inside a laundry closet as a person opens the white cabinet door, which creates a loud creaking sound, and then closes it.\nA person opens a white door with a creaking sound, revealing a laundry closet with a white top-loading washing machine and dryer, then closes the door.\n\nA person opens a white door with a creaking sound, revealing a laundry closet with a white top-loading washing machine and dryer, then closes the door.", "time_sec": 185.363, "generation_time_seconds": 123.3522, "selection_time_seconds": 61.7535, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 29.41, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "97", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a green field, a small dog chases a duck while a film projector runs, capturing the playful symphony of quacks, whimpers, and chirps.", "pred": "A brown and black dog chases a brown and white duck across a grassy yard, while a goat bleats and a dog barks.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A brown and black dog chases a brown and white duck across a grassy yard, while a goat bleats and a dog barks.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA dog chases a duck across a grassy yard, while a goat can be heard bleating and a dog barks.\nThe dog, brown and black with floppy ears, runs on green grass, its paws kicking up blades, while the duck, brown and white with a green head, waddles and flaps away; simultaneously, a goat emits a distinct \"baa\" followed by a dog's sharp bark.\nThe dog's brown and black fur and floppy ears suggest a specific breed, possibly a spaniel, and its movement across the grass indicates a playful or predatory chase. The duck's brown and white feathers with a green head are characteristic of a male mallard, and its waddling and flapping suggest it is attempting to escape the dog's pursuit. The goat's \"baa\" and the dog's bark are distinct sounds, indicating the presence of multiple animals and a dynamic interaction. The grassy yard provides a natural setting for this chase, with the dog's paws kicking up blades of grass as it runs.\n\nA brown and black dog chases a brown and white duck across a grassy yard, while a goat bleats and a dog barks.", "time_sec": 305.754, "generation_time_seconds": 163.6714, "selection_time_seconds": 140.7558, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 20.69, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "98", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The muffled sound of a vehicle engine revving and running idle as cloth rustles, with a modern car dashboard displaying the speedometer and tachometer.", "pred": "A car's dashboard displays a speed of 0 km/h, a quarter fuel level, and illuminated warning lights, including a red engine light and a high-temperature indicator, while the central console shows a gear stick and a stereo system with the time 20:00, all accompanied by the ambient sound of an idling engine.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A car's dashboard displays a speed of 0 km/h, a quarter fuel level, and illuminated warning lights, including a red engine light and a high-temperature indicator, while the central console shows a gear stick and a stereo system with the time 20:00, all accompanied by the ambient sound of an idling engine.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe dashboard display shows a speed of 0 km/h and a fuel level at approximately 1/4 full, with a red engine warning light illuminated.\nThe central digital screen indicates a high engine temperature, while the surrounding analog gauges display zero speed and a quarter fuel level, all under the ambient glow of dashboard warning lights.\nThe scene shifts from the illuminated dashboard with its red warning lights to a central console featuring a black gear stick and a stereo system displaying the time 20:00 and the word \"STEREO\" in red digital text, with the ambient sound of an engine idling.\n\nA car's dashboard displays a speed of 0 km/h, a quarter fuel level, and illuminated warning lights, including a red engine light and a high-temperature indicator, while the central console shows a gear stick and a stereo system with the time 20:00, all accompanied by the ambient sound of an idling engine.", "time_sec": 224.282, "generation_time_seconds": 140.4237, "selection_time_seconds": 82.9886, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 12.5, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "99", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The sound of clicking and clacking fills the room as a person types on an old typewriter, their hands focused on the black keys, with a bell ringing and a clack as the carriage returns, set on a table with a sheet of paper.", "pred": "A hand operates a black vintage typewriter, producing sharp mechanical clacks and a rhythmic typing sound as the carriage moves.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A hand operates a black vintage typewriter, producing sharp mechanical clacks and a rhythmic typing sound as the carriage moves.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA black vintage typewriter with silver keys is being operated, producing sharp mechanical clacks and a rhythmic typing sound as paper is fed through it.\nThe scene is dominated by a close-up of a black vintage typewriter, its silver keys clearly visible. A hand operates the machine, causing the internal metal typebars to strike the paper with sharp, percussive mechanical clacks, creating a rhythmic typing sound.\nA hand is actively pressing keys on the typewriter, which is actively engaging its internal mechanism. This action produces a rapid, rhythmic series of sharp metallic clacks and a continuous whirring sound from the carriage return and paper feed.\n\nA hand operates a black vintage typewriter, producing sharp mechanical clacks and a rhythmic typing sound as the carriage moves.", "time_sec": 269.758, "generation_time_seconds": 166.7042, "selection_time_seconds": 101.9058, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 21.62, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "100", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The sound of a train engine running with bells chime, a lawn mower, and a steam engine running with a steam whistle blowing, as a crowd of people stand near a small train on the tracks.", "pred": "A small green and yellow steam train moves along a track, emitting a whistle and the clatter of its wheels, while a person in a white shirt stands on its back.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A small green and yellow steam train moves along a track, emitting a whistle and the clatter of its wheels, while a person in a white shirt stands on its back.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nBased on the visual and auditory information, a small green and yellow steam train is moving along a track, and its movement is accompanied by the sound of a train whistle and the rumbling of its wheels.\nThe small green and yellow train is moving from right to left on a track, with a person in a white shirt standing on its back. Simultaneously, the audio captures the distinct sound of a train whistle followed by the rhythmic clatter of its wheels on the rails.\nThe train is a miniature or model-sized locomotive with a green boiler and a yellow front buffer beam, moving along a brown metal track embedded in a grassy area.\n\nA small green and yellow steam train moves along a track, emitting a whistle and the clatter of its wheels, while a person in a white shirt stands on its back.", "time_sec": 216.291, "generation_time_seconds": 146.1584, "selection_time_seconds": 68.8566, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 20.0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "101", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The video game world bursts with a gunfiring, a large screen background.", "pred": "A pixelated soldier on a gray platform fires a weapon at red robotic enemies, causing blue impacts and explosions, while loud, guttural monster growls and heavy thudding sounds are heard.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A pixelated soldier on a gray platform fires a weapon at red robotic enemies, causing blue impacts and explosions, while loud, guttural monster growls and heavy thudding sounds are heard.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA pixelated armored soldier on the left fires a weapon at several red, humanoid enemies on a platform, causing blue impacts and explosions.\n Simultaneously, loud, guttural monster growls and bestial roars are heard, accompanied by the sound of heavy, rhythmic thudding, like a large creature's footsteps or impacts.\nA pixelated soldier on a gray platform fires a weapon at red robotic enemies, causing blue impacts and explosions, while loud, guttural monster growls and heavy thudding sounds are heard.\nThe visual scene is a 2D pixel-art video game with a side-scrolling shooter perspective.\n The player-controlled character, a soldier in gray armor, is located on a dark gray platform on the left side of the screen.\n This character fires a weapon that emits blue glowing projectiles towards several red robotic enemies on the right.\n Upon impact, the enemies explode into blue particle effects, and a red circular reticle is visible on the right side of the screen.\n The audio consists of two primary non-diegetic sound layers: a continuous, low-frequency rhythmic thudding that sounds like a heavy mechanical pulse, and layered, aggressive monster\n\nA pixelated soldier on a gray platform fires a weapon at red robotic enemies, causing blue impacts and explosions, while loud, guttural monster growls and heavy thudding sounds are heard.", "time_sec": 262.106, "generation_time_seconds": 175.597, "selection_time_seconds": 86.1905, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "102", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The sound of plastic clacking is followed by the roar of motorcycle engines as a couple of men ride red motorcycles down a sidewalk next to a brick building.", "pred": "Two young men on sport motorcycles, one black and one red with number '3', are in a driveway; the red motorcycle then starts and accelerates away, producing a loud engine roar and the sound of an exhaust.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "Two young men on sport motorcycles, one black and one red with number '3', are in a driveway; the red motorcycle then starts and accelerates away, producing a loud engine roar and the sound of an exhaust.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nTwo young men on sport motorcycles, one black and one red, are positioned in a residential driveway before the red motorcycle starts and accelerates away, accompanied by a loud engine roar and the sound of an exhaust.\nThe initial visual of two individuals on high-performance motorcycles (one black, one red with number '3') in a paved driveway, followed by the sudden onset of a very loud, powerful engine sound, directly corresponds to the action of one of the motorcycles (the red one) being started and accelerating rapidly away from the camera.\nThe two individuals on sport motorcycles, one black and one red with number '3', are in a driveway; the red motorcycle then starts and accelerates away, producing a loud engine roar and the sound of an exhaust.\n\nTwo young men on sport motorcycles, one black and one red with number '3', are in a driveway; the red motorcycle then starts and accelerates away, producing a loud engine roar and the sound of an exhaust.", "time_sec": 282.173, "generation_time_seconds": 159.8053, "selection_time_seconds": 121.7935, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 30.0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "103", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a city under dark clouds, a man speaks as rain falls with distant thunder, while a flock of birds sit on a wire and some leaves.", "pred": "A tornado descends from a storm cloud over a city skyline, accompanied by the sound of a large splash and a male voice speaking in Spanish.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A tornado descends from a storm cloud over a city skyline, accompanied by the sound of a large splash and a male voice speaking in Spanish.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe audio contains the sound of a sudden, massive splash, consistent with a large object or body of water impacting a surface violently.\n The visual shows a tornado forming over a city skyline under a dark, stormy sky.\n The two sensory inputs appear to be from different, unrelated events, as there is no visual evidence of a large body of water being disturbed or an object falling from the sky.\n The final answer must describe both the observed visual and the heard audio as separate, factual elements.\nA tornado forms over a city skyline under a dark, stormy sky, while the sound of a large splash is heard.\nThe visual displays a massive, dark, rotating column of air, a tornado, descending from a storm cloud over an urban landscape with building silhouettes. The audio features the distinct sound of a large splash and a male voice speaking in Spanish, with no audible wind or thunder, indicating the sounds were likely recorded separately from the visual event.\n\nA tornado descends from a storm cloud over a city skyline, accompanied by the sound of a large splash and a male voice speaking in Spanish.", "time_sec": 237.601, "generation_time_seconds": 157.6967, "selection_time_seconds": 79.4691, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 6.25, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "104", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A birds chirping sound the wire fence at various animals, accompanied by the soothing sounds .", "pred": "A large brown camel and a small, shaggy, light-colored dog face each other across a wire fence, while a male voice speaks, a dog barks, and a high-pitched electronic tone sounds.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A large brown camel and a small, shaggy, light-colored dog face each other across a wire fence, while a male voice speaks, a dog barks, and a high-pitched electronic tone sounds.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe audio contains a male voice speaking in English, followed by the sound of a dog barking, while the visual shows a camel and a small, light-colored dog separated by a wire fence in an outdoor setting.\nA camel and a small, light-colored, shaggy dog stand on opposite sides of a wire mesh fence, with the camel facing the dog and the dog facing the camel; a male voice speaks, then a dog barks, and finally a high-pitched electronic tone sounds.\nThe camel is a large, brown, four-legged mammal, and the dog is a small, light-colored, shaggy-furred mammal, both standing on grass within an outdoor enclosure bordered by a wire fence. The interaction is visually passive, with the camel lowering its head towards the dog and the dog facing the camel. The audio contains a male voice speaking, followed by a dog's bark, and concludes with a sustained, high-pitched electronic tone.\n\nA large brown camel and a small, shaggy, light-colored dog face each other across a wire fence, while a male voice speaks, a dog barks, and a high-pitched electronic tone sounds.", "time_sec": 233.315, "generation_time_seconds": 154.1167, "selection_time_seconds": 78.741, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 18.75, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "105", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a dark room at night, a man stands alone holding a cell phone in front of a crescent moon, while speaking with the humming of an engine and some rustling.", "pred": "A shaky, dark interior view from within a truck is accompanied by the loud, continuous rumble of its engine and a man's voice stating he is on his truck.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A shaky, dark interior view from within a truck is accompanied by the loud, continuous rumble of its engine and a man's voice stating he is on his truck.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe visual shows a dark, shaky, handheld perspective, possibly inside a vehicle at night, while the audio features a man speaking over the loud, continuous rumble of a large engine.\nThe audio reveals a man stating, \"I didn't put them,\" while the prominent and continuous background noise is the deep, rumbling sound of a large engine, suggesting the recording was made from within a truck with its engine running.\nThe video is dark and shaky, indicating handheld filming inside a confined, poorly lit space, possibly at night. The audio is dominated by a loud, deep, continuous rumble consistent with a large diesel engine idling or running. Over this engine noise, a man speaks, first mentioning placing something \"back on my truck\" and then inviting others to \"come on the inside of my truck,\" confirming the setting as the interior of a large truck.\n\nA shaky, dark interior view from within a truck is accompanied by the loud, continuous rumble of its engine and a man's voice stating he is on his truck.", "time_sec": 249.969, "generation_time_seconds": 140.721, "selection_time_seconds": 108.9274, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 11.11, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "106", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A car drives down a wet road at night in the rain, its headlights illuminating the dark street with water and trees as rain falls and thunder roars in the distance.", "pred": "A vehicle with bright headlights approaches a wet, reflective path at night, creating long, shimmering reflections on the surface, while the continuous, low-frequency rumble of an engine or large moving vehicle dominates the audio.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A vehicle with bright headlights approaches a wet, reflective path at night, creating long, shimmering reflections on the surface, while the continuous, low-frequency rumble of an engine or large moving vehicle dominates the audio.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA vehicle with bright headlights approaches a wet, reflective path or road at night, its lights creating long, shimmering reflections on the surface, while the continuous, low-frequency rumble of an engine or large moving vehicle dominates the audio.\nA vehicle with bright headlights approaches a wet, reflective path at night, creating long, shimmering reflections on the surface, while the continuous, low-frequency rumble of an engine or large moving vehicle dominates the audio.\nThe visual scene depicts a wet path or road at night, indicated by the bright, elongated reflections of the vehicle's headlights on a dark, glossy surface. A wooden fence is visible on the right side of the path. The vehicle is moving towards the camera. Simultaneously, the audio is dominated by a loud, low-frequency, continuous rumble that strongly suggests the powerful engine of a large vehicle, such as a truck or bus, is in operation nearby.\n\nA vehicle with bright headlights approaches a wet, reflective path at night, creating long, shimmering reflections on the surface, while the continuous, low-frequency rumble of an engine or large moving vehicle dominates the audio.", "time_sec": 282.928, "generation_time_seconds": 174.443, "selection_time_seconds": 107.8113, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 14.63, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "107", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A young girl talks, followed by another young girl laughing, and a young man yelling as a train crosses a wooden bridge over a river with a crowd of people talking in the background.", "pred": "A vehicle splashes through water on a dirt path, creating a large artificial wave that hits the camera, as people on a nearby wooden platform shout and laugh.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A vehicle splashes through water on a dirt path, creating a large artificial wave that hits the camera, as people on a nearby wooden platform shout and laugh.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\n\\boxed{A vehicle moves on a dirt path through a wooded area, splashing water from a large artificial wave onto the camera, as people on a nearby wooden platform shout and laugh.}\nBased on the audio, the large volume of water being displaced is likely a man-made waterfall or wave feature, not a natural river, due to the controlled splash and the lack of natural river sounds.\nObserving the visual, the vehicle is clearly on a dirt path, with trees and foliage in the background. The water being splashed is large and white, suggesting a significant impact, and the scene is set in a constructed wooden environment, not a wild natural one. The audio confirms this with the prominent sound of rushing water, but also features human voices at the beginning—shouting greetings (\"Oh hey!\", \"Hey what's up!\")—which suggests a recreational setting where people are interacting near a water feature. Combining these, the water is likely not from a natural river but from an artificial wave, as indicated by the scale of\n\nA vehicle splashes through water on a dirt path, creating a large artificial wave that hits the camera, as people on a nearby wooden platform shout and laugh.", "time_sec": 286.727, "generation_time_seconds": 193.0883, "selection_time_seconds": 92.8639, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 10.53, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "108", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "As the wind blows, a young man wearing glasses and a black jacket with a hood walks in the park, whistling a tune.", "pred": "A man in a black winter coat with a fur-lined hood sits in a park with bare trees, while a high-pitched melodic whistle is heard.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A man in a black winter coat with a fur-lined hood sits in a park with bare trees, while a high-pitched melodic whistle is heard.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe audio contains a clear, high-pitched, melodic whistle, and the visual scene shows a person in a park-like setting, but the two sensory inputs are unrelated.\nA person wearing glasses and a black winter coat with a fur-lined hood is sitting outdoors in a park with bare trees, while a distinct high-pitched melodic whistle is heard from an unseen source.\nThe subject is a man with short dark hair and glasses, wearing a black puffer jacket with a prominent, light-colored fur-trimmed hood, positioned in the foreground. The background consists of bare trees and dry, brownish ground, suggesting a dormant season. The light is bright and direct, indicating a sunny day.\n\nA man in a black winter coat with a fur-lined hood sits in a park with bare trees, while a high-pitched melodic whistle is heard.", "time_sec": 261.77, "generation_time_seconds": 154.7268, "selection_time_seconds": 106.7488, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 29.63, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "109", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A yellow helicopter lands on the pitch of a stadium, its engine humming loudly  vibrations and wind.", "pred": "A stationary yellow ADAC helicopter with spinning rotor blades sits on a grass field, producing a loud, rhythmic chopping sound.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A stationary yellow ADAC helicopter with spinning rotor blades sits on a grass field, producing a loud, rhythmic chopping sound.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe physical details from the audio confirm the visual by identifying the sound source of the helicopter's main rotor blades and engine.\nA stationary yellow helicopter with 'ADAC' markings on its side is on a green grass field, with stadium seating in the background, while the dominant sound is the loud, rhythmic chopping noise of its main rotor blades spinning.\nThe visual of a helicopter with spinning rotor blades is directly corroborated by the audio, which consists of the distinct, powerful, low-frequency chopping sound of a large helicopter's main rotor blades in motion.\n\nA stationary yellow ADAC helicopter with spinning rotor blades sits on a grass field, producing a loud, rhythmic chopping sound.", "time_sec": 220.549, "generation_time_seconds": 130.3351, "selection_time_seconds": 89.7, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 15.38, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "110", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The ticking of a clock  through a metal sculpture  with gears and wires.", "pred": "A complex, dark metal sculpture of interlocking gears and figures is shown, accompanied by the rhythmic ticking of a clock mechanism.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A complex, dark metal sculpture of interlocking gears and figures is shown, accompanied by the rhythmic ticking of a clock mechanism.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA close-up view reveals a complex, dark metal sculpture resembling a clockwork mechanism, composed of interlocking gears, springs, and figures within a rectangular frame, resting on a wooden base.\nThe sculpture's intricate design, featuring multiple interconnected gears, springs, and what appear to be small human-like figures, suggests a complex kinetic or automaton mechanism housed within a dark metal frame.\nThe sculpture is constructed from dark, possibly wrought iron, metal, featuring numerous interlocking gears, springs, and small, articulated figures within a rectangular frame.\n\nA complex, dark metal sculpture of interlocking gears and figures is shown, accompanied by the rhythmic ticking of a clock mechanism.", "time_sec": 223.873, "generation_time_seconds": 138.9387, "selection_time_seconds": 84.3798, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 52.63, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "111", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A young man in a black shirt operates a sewing machine, the hum of the machine followed by a metal click.", "pred": "A man operates a sewing machine, which produces a rhythmic, mechanical whirring and clicking sound.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A man operates a sewing machine, which produces a rhythmic, mechanical whirring and clicking sound.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA man operates a sewing machine, which produces a rhythmic, mechanical whirring and clicking sound.\nA man sits at a white table, operating a sewing machine on a piece of black fabric, while the machine emits a rhythmic, mechanical whirring and clicking sound.\nA man operates a sewing machine, which produces a rhythmic, mechanical whirring and clicking sound.\n\nA man operates a sewing machine, which produces a rhythmic, mechanical whirring and clicking sound.", "time_sec": 176.005, "generation_time_seconds": 102.073, "selection_time_seconds": 73.5953, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 36.36, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "112", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man talks while typing on a keyboard, showcasing a website with text and images alongside another website with text.", "pred": "The screen displays a split view of Python code for a 'GUESSING GAME' in a text editor and on a chalkboard graphic, while a voice narrates the code aloud.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "The screen displays a split view of Python code for a 'GUESSING GAME' in a text editor and on a chalkboard graphic, while a voice narrates the code aloud.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA computer screen displays Python code for a 'GUESSING GAME' in a text editor on the left, with matching code and a chalkboard-style title on the right, while a male voice narrates the code aloud.\nA computer screen shows Python code for a 'GUESSING GAME' in a text editor on the left and on a chalkboard graphic on the right, while a male voice types and narrates the code aloud.\nThe screen is split into two sections: the left shows a text editor with Python code, and the right shows a chalkboard-style presentation of the same code and title, while a voice narrates the code.\n\nThe screen displays a split view of Python code for a 'GUESSING GAME' in a text editor and on a chalkboard graphic, while a voice narrates the code aloud.", "time_sec": 201.405, "generation_time_seconds": 133.314, "selection_time_seconds": 67.5651, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 7.14, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "113", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A  helicopter flies with loud chopping noises over a city with tall buildings.", "pred": "A red and white helicopter with spinning rotors maneuvers between two tall buildings, accompanied by the loud, continuous roar of its engine and rotor blades.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A red and white helicopter with spinning rotors maneuvers between two tall buildings, accompanied by the loud, continuous roar of its engine and rotor blades.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA red and white helicopter hovers and maneuvers between two tall, modern buildings in a dense urban environment.\nThe helicopter's rotors are in rapid motion, producing a loud, continuous, and powerful roaring sound that fills the air.\nA red and white helicopter with spinning rotors is seen maneuvering between two tall, multi-story buildings, while the loud, continuous roar of its engine and rotor blades dominates the soundscape.\n\nA red and white helicopter with spinning rotors maneuvers between two tall buildings, accompanied by the loud, continuous roar of its engine and rotor blades.", "time_sec": 196.581, "generation_time_seconds": 129.0734, "selection_time_seconds": 66.9936, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 29.63, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "114", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a lively backyard setting, a person claps as two black and white dogs playfully bark and  while birds chirp in the background.", "pred": "A black and tan dog and a gray dog run across a grassy yard as a single, sharp bark is heard, with a light brown dog and a small white dog also present.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A black and tan dog and a gray dog run across a grassy yard as a single, sharp bark is heard, with a light brown dog and a small white dog also present.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA single, sharp bark from a dog is heard at the instant a black and tan dog and a gray dog run across a grassy yard, with a light brown dog and a small white dog visible nearby.\nThe video shows four dogs in a grassy backyard: a light brown dog on the left, a black and tan dog running centrally, a gray dog behind it, and a small white dog on the lower left. At the 00:00:04 mark, an abrupt, loud bark from a dog is heard, coinciding with the central dogs' movement.\nA black and tan dog, a gray dog, a light brown dog, and a small white dog are in a grassy backyard. A single, sharp bark is heard at the same time the black and tan dog and the gray dog are running.\n\nA black and tan dog and a gray dog run across a grassy yard as a single, sharp bark is heard, with a light brown dog and a small white dog also present.", "time_sec": 268.417, "generation_time_seconds": 157.0294, "selection_time_seconds": 110.6289, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 17.14, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "115", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The steam engine train hisses and chugs as a man and a young boy sit on the front, surrounded by onlookers.", "pred": "A miniature black and gold steam locomotive moves along narrow-gauge tracks, emitting white steam and producing a rhythmic chugging sound, as a man operates it from the rear.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A miniature black and gold steam locomotive moves along narrow-gauge tracks, emitting white steam and producing a rhythmic chugging sound, as a man operates it from the rear.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA miniature black and gold steam locomotive, emitting white steam from its front, moves along a set of tracks past a brick building, while a man in a dark shirt operates it from the back, accompanied by the rhythmic chugging of the engine and a low-frequency mechanical rumble.\nThe locomotive is a detailed model with a brass boiler, black smokebox, and the number '6' on its side, moving along narrow-gauge tracks.\nThe train's wheels are in motion on the rails, creating a continuous rhythmic chugging sound.\n\nA miniature black and gold steam locomotive moves along narrow-gauge tracks, emitting white steam and producing a rhythmic chugging sound, as a man operates it from the rear.", "time_sec": 258.162, "generation_time_seconds": 159.0373, "selection_time_seconds": 98.0754, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 12.5, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "116", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The church bells ring out over the old gothic cathedral as a crowd murmurs in the distance, accompanied by the sound of rain and wind blowing into the microphone.", "pred": "A high-angle view of a large stone Gothic cathedral with multiple spires and arched windows is accompanied by the complex, sustained melody of a full peal of large bells.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A high-angle view of a large stone Gothic cathedral with multiple spires and arched windows is accompanied by the complex, sustained melody of a full peal of large bells.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe visual shows the stone facade of a large Gothic-style cathedral with arched windows and towers, while the audio features the simultaneous ringing of multiple large bells.\nA high-angle view reveals a large stone Gothic cathedral with multiple spires, arched windows, and a green-tiled roof; simultaneously, a complex, sustained melody from a full peal of large, resonant bells, characteristic of a carillon, is heard.\nThe visual evidence presents a substantial stone ecclesiastical structure with Gothic architectural elements, including prominent spires and tracery. The accompanying audio is not speech or ambient noise but a structured, polyphonic chime from multiple large bells, which is a characteristic sound of a clock tower or carillon, most commonly found on such cathedrals. Therefore, the scene depicts a large cathedral with its bells being rung.\n\nA high-angle view of a large stone Gothic cathedral with multiple spires and arched windows is accompanied by the complex, sustained melody of a full peal of large bells.", "time_sec": 239.568, "generation_time_seconds": 162.5775, "selection_time_seconds": 74.8793, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 22.22, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "117", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The race car speeds up as the engine roars, reflected in the accelerating speedometer on the dashboard.", "pred": "The speedometer needle is at 100 mph, the odometer reads 201582, and a loud engine revs.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "The speedometer needle is at 100 mph, the odometer reads 201582, and a loud engine revs.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA car's speedometer displays a speed of 100 mph, with the odometer reading 201582, as the engine revs loudly.\nThe car's speedometer needle is shown pointing at 100 mph, with the digital odometer clearly displaying the number 201582, while the audio captures the sound of a high-performance engine revving at high RPMs.\nThe speedometer is at 100 mph, with an odometer reading of 201582, as a loud engine revs.\n\nThe speedometer needle is at 100 mph, the odometer reads 201582, and a loud engine revs.", "time_sec": 253.96, "generation_time_seconds": 168.0528, "selection_time_seconds": 85.5636, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 20.0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "118", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The sound of plastic crumpling fills the room as a man's hand reaches for papers on a desk, surrounded by cards , while an adult male speaks.", "pred": "A hand manipulates a small, black, rectangular comic book or trading card in a crinkling plastic wrapper on a light-colored surface, as a male speaker identifies the item and its seal.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A hand manipulates a small, black, rectangular comic book or trading card in a crinkling plastic wrapper on a light-colored surface, as a male speaker identifies the item and its seal.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA hand manipulates a small, black, rectangular comic book-like object on a light-colored surface, producing loud, crinkling sounds as its protective cellophane wrapper is handled, while a male speaker identifies the item and its seal.\nA hand holding a small, black, rectangular comic book or trading card is seen on a light-colored surface, its protective plastic wrapper being crinkled as a male speaker identifies the object and its seal.\nThe objects are black and rectangular with a glossy texture, consistent with a trading card or a small art book in protective cellophane.\n\nA hand manipulates a small, black, rectangular comic book or trading card in a crinkling plastic wrapper on a light-colored surface, as a male speaker identifies the item and its seal.", "time_sec": 210.041, "generation_time_seconds": 135.2374, "selection_time_seconds": 74.1217, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 17.14, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "119", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The man's voice is heard over the idle bus engine, while the camera pans from the open door of the bus to the metal steps of an escalator going up and down.", "pred": "A powered wheelchair ramp with a yellow safety rail and textured metal platform is shown on a public transit vehicle, as a male speaker describes its capacity and a vehicle engine idles in the background.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A powered wheelchair ramp with a yellow safety rail and textured metal platform is shown on a public transit vehicle, as a male speaker describes its capacity and a vehicle engine idles in the background.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video demonstrates a wheelchair lift on a public transit vehicle, showing its metal construction and platform, while the speaker describes its capacity and features like grab rails, and the sound of the vehicle's engine idling is present.\nThe public transit vehicle's wheelchair lift platform is shown in use, featuring a metal mesh surface and yellow safety rail, as a male speaker describes its capacity for three or four wheelchairs and notes its 2001 model year, all while the vehicle's engine idles in the background.\nThe vehicle is equipped with a powered ramp system, featuring a yellow safety handrail and a textured metallic platform.\n\nA powered wheelchair ramp with a yellow safety rail and textured metal platform is shown on a public transit vehicle, as a male speaker describes its capacity and a vehicle engine idles in the background.", "time_sec": 274.265, "generation_time_seconds": 147.3345, "selection_time_seconds": 125.8427, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 9.76, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "120", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the video, a woman  is speaking in front of a green screen, with people communicating in the background.", "pred": "A woman with long brown hair and a reddish top is positioned against a solid green screen, her face marked with a blue wireframe for motion capture, while a voice audibly counts from zero to nine.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A woman with long brown hair and a reddish top is positioned against a solid green screen, her face marked with a blue wireframe for motion capture, while a voice audibly counts from zero to nine.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA woman with long brown hair and a reddish top is positioned against a solid green screen, her face marked with a blue wireframe for motion capture, while a voice audibly counts from zero to nine.\nA woman with long, light brown hair, wearing a reddish-brown top and a silver necklace, is positioned against a solid green screen; her face is covered in a dense blue wireframe for facial motion capture; a female voice audibly counts from zero to nine.\nThe woman has long, light brown hair, is wearing a reddish-brown top and a silver necklace, and is positioned against a solid green screen. Her face is covered with a dense blue wireframe for motion capture. A female voice counts from zero to nine.\n\nA woman with long brown hair and a reddish top is positioned against a solid green screen, her face marked with a blue wireframe for motion capture, while a voice audibly counts from zero to nine.", "time_sec": 263.315, "generation_time_seconds": 171.0852, "selection_time_seconds": 91.8254, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 18.18, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "121", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The audio-visual caption captures the essence of a lively event with music, male speech, and distant sizzling, featuring a collage of pictures of men wearing hats and sunglasses, celebrating in a crowd.", "pred": "A man with long, curly hair, wearing a black hat and sunglasses, points his finger forward while speaking, accompanied by the sound of an electric guitar.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A man with long, curly hair, wearing a black hat and sunglasses, points his finger forward while speaking, accompanied by the sound of an electric guitar.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA man with long curly hair, wearing a black hat and sunglasses, points directly at the camera while speaking the words \"Hey, this is Big Kenny, Sound the System, Alborosie, you gotta check it out.\"\nA man with long, curly hair and a black hat is shown in a close-up, pointing his finger forward, accompanied by the sound of an electric guitar.\nThe man is wearing a black hat and sunglasses, with long, curly hair visible under the hat and around his ears.\n\nA man with long, curly hair, wearing a black hat and sunglasses, points his finger forward while speaking, accompanied by the sound of an electric guitar.", "time_sec": 211.046, "generation_time_seconds": 131.1077, "selection_time_seconds": 78.9404, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 10.81, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "122", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The sound of a horn blares as wind gusts through the trees, accompanying the rumble of a motor vehicle engine, while a yellow bus drives down a street lined with trees and parked vehicles.", "pred": "A yellow and orange bus with its headlight on drives from left to right on a wet road, its loud, high-pitched horn and engine sounds dominating the audio as it passes the camera.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A yellow and orange bus with its headlight on drives from left to right on a wet road, its loud, high-pitched horn and engine sounds dominating the audio as it passes the camera.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\n{\n\"reasoning\": \"The video shows a yellow and orange bus driving on a wet road and passing the camera. In the background, other buses and motorcycles are visible. A loud, high-pitched, and repetitive horn is heard, along with the sounds of the bus engine and tires on the wet surface.\"\n}\nThe bus's front headlight is illuminated, suggesting the horn and engine sounds are from the same vehicle. The wet road surface reflects the overcast sky, and the vehicle's approach creates a slight Doppler effect on the horn's pitch.\nThe vehicle moves from left to right, its horn producing a sharp, reedy, and slightly wavering tone that remains the dominant sound throughout its passage.\n\nA yellow and orange bus with its headlight on drives from left to right on a wet road, its loud, high-pitched horn and engine sounds dominating the audio as it passes the camera.", "time_sec": 225.671, "generation_time_seconds": 135.2825, "selection_time_seconds": 89.9056, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 24.39, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "123", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The blaring siren of an emergency vehicle echoes through the street as a man's voice cuts through the parade of cars, trucks, and motorcycles passing by a crowd of onlookers.", "pred": "A white van and a red tracked vehicle with a crane arm move down a street past a crowd, accompanied by a loud, wailing siren.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A white van and a red tracked vehicle with a crane arm move down a street past a crowd, accompanied by a loud, wailing siren.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA parade features a white van and a red, tracked vehicle moving down a street lined with spectators, accompanied by the sound of a loud, wailing siren.\nThe scene depicts a street event with a crowd gathered along the sidewalk, observing a procession that includes a white van and a red off-road vehicle with a large crane arm.\nThe procession is dominated by a white van and a red, tracked vehicle equipped with a large crane arm, which is moving down the street past a crowd of spectators.\n\nA white van and a red tracked vehicle with a crane arm move down a street past a crowd, accompanied by a loud, wailing siren.", "time_sec": 204.428, "generation_time_seconds": 132.6775, "selection_time_seconds": 70.6001, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 25.0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "124", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The short loud vibration resonated through the room, illuminating the diamond accents on the antique earrings and white gold ring displayed against the blue backgrounds.", "pred": "A cylindrical metallic automotive bulb with a cluster of spherical clear bulbs is shown, accompanied by a continuous low-frequency mechanical hum.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A cylindrical metallic automotive bulb with a cluster of spherical clear bulbs is shown, accompanied by a continuous low-frequency mechanical hum.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA cylindrical metallic object with multiple small, clear, spherical bulbs arranged around its head is shown.\n A continuous, low-frequency mechanical hum is audible.\nA cylindrical metallic automotive bulb with a cluster of spherical clear bulbs is shown, accompanied by a continuous low-frequency mechanical hum.\nThe object is a multi-bulb automotive light fixture, likely a brake or turn signal lamp, characterized by its metallic, cylindrical base and the concentric arrangement of numerous small, clear, spherical bulbs around its perimeter.\n\nA cylindrical metallic automotive bulb with a cluster of spherical clear bulbs is shown, accompanied by a continuous low-frequency mechanical hum.", "time_sec": 215.762, "generation_time_seconds": 132.038, "selection_time_seconds": 83.42, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "125", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The cooing of pigeons echoes through a room filled with a bunch of  animals in a cage.", "pred": "A dense flock of pigeons with varied black-and-white and brown-and-white plumage huddles on a wire mesh floor in a dim enclosure, emitting a continuous chorus of overlapping coos.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A dense flock of pigeons with varied black-and-white and brown-and-white plumage huddles on a wire mesh floor in a dim enclosure, emitting a continuous chorus of overlapping coos.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA dense flock of pigeons with varied feathers, including black-and-white and brown-and-white, huddles closely together in a dimly lit, confined space, their bodies shifting slightly amidst a constant, low-pitched, cooing chorus that fills the enclosed environment with overlapping avian vocalizations.\nThe birds are perched on a wire mesh structure, their bodies layered in a dense group, with movement localized to subtle shifts of heads and wings, while the sound is a continuous, low-frequency cooing with overlapping calls and no indication of distress or flight.\nThe pigeons' feathers display distinct patterns: one bird exhibits a solid black head with a white neck, while others show mottled brown-and-white plumage on their backs and wings, all under dim, shadowy lighting.\nTheir bodies are packed tightly, with overlapping contours and no visible open space between individuals, suggesting a high-density resting or roosting arrangement.\nThe structural elements beneath them consist of a repeating V-shaped metal wire mesh, likely part of an aviary or coop floor, with a rough, uneven surface visible at the edges.\nThe sound remains a steady, non-rhythmic chorus of overlapping coos, with no\n\nA dense flock of pigeons with varied black-and-white and brown-and-white plumage huddles on a wire mesh floor in a dim enclosure, emitting a continuous chorus of overlapping coos.", "time_sec": 247.841, "generation_time_seconds": 165.3284, "selection_time_seconds": 82.1981, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 7.69, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "126", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a small bedroom with a bed and closet, a young girl in a pink dress stands while clattering and banging occur, as a strong breeze blows through the wind.", "pred": "A child in pink pajamas runs across a bedroom, and a loud crash occurs as something falls or breaks.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A child in pink pajamas runs across a bedroom, and a loud crash occurs as something falls or breaks.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA child in pink pajamas runs across a bedroom, and a loud crash occurs as something falls or breaks.\nA child in pink pajamas runs across a bedroom, and a loud crash occurs as something falls or breaks.\nA child in pink pajamas runs across a bedroom.\n\nA child in pink pajamas runs across a bedroom, and a loud crash occurs as something falls or breaks.", "time_sec": 168.772, "generation_time_seconds": 109.5284, "selection_time_seconds": 58.7311, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 14.29, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "127", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A loud, long explosion echoes through the night sky,  while the air force symbol and abstract backgrounds add a sense of power.", "pred": "A bright, glitchy, blue-white digital text with the words 'HIGH DEFINITION' appears on a black background, followed by the loud, deep rumble of an explosion.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A bright, glitchy, blue-white digital text with the words 'HIGH DEFINITION' appears on a black background, followed by the loud, deep rumble of an explosion.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA bright, glitchy, blue-white digital text with the words 'HIGH DEFINITION' materializes on a black background, accompanied by the loud, deep rumble of an explosion.\nA bright, glitchy, blue-white digital text with the words 'HIGH DEFINITION' appears on a black background.\nThis is followed by the loud, deep rumble of an explosion.\nThe text is rendered in a distorted, glitchy, or fragmented digital style, appearing bright blue-white against a stark black background, then vanishes in a single frame.\n\nA bright, glitchy, blue-white digital text with the words 'HIGH DEFINITION' appears on a black background, followed by the loud, deep rumble of an explosion.", "time_sec": 206.488, "generation_time_seconds": 145.2651, "selection_time_seconds": 60.722, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 13.33, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "128", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The church bells ring as a man stands on a balcony in front of a building with clock.", "pred": "A man in a green shirt strikes a large, dark bell with a mallet on a columned balcony, producing a loud, resonant, metallic clang.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A man in a green shirt strikes a large, dark bell with a mallet on a columned balcony, producing a loud, resonant, metallic clang.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA man in a green shirt stands on a balcony with ornate black iron railings, actively striking a large, dark, metallic bell with a mallet, causing it to resonate loudly within an open-air structure supported by large, light-colored classical columns under a clear blue sky.\nThe visual details of the large bell, the man's action, and the bell tower setting are confirmed by the loud, resonant, and sustained sound of a large bell being struck.\nThe man uses a mallet to strike the large bell, and the resulting sound is a deep, harmonious, metallic clang that suggests the bell is made of bronze or a similar alloy and is of a significant size, consistent with a church or clock tower bell.\nThe sound has a very long decay, indicating the bell is large and resonant, and is likely housed in a bell tower or belfry with open sides, allowing the full sound to project.\nThe combination of the man's physical action, the bell's size, and the acoustic properties of the sound point to a traditional bell-ringing activity in a public or religious space\n\nA man in a green shirt strikes a large, dark bell with a mallet on a columned balcony, producing a loud, resonant, metallic clang.", "time_sec": 285.31, "generation_time_seconds": 170.0825, "selection_time_seconds": 114.9321, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 16.67, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "129", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A racing vehicle speeds down a dirt road lined with a crowd of people, as a horn honks and wind blows into the microphone.", "pred": "A dark-colored rally car with green wheels speeds down a dusty, unpaved road, kicking up a large plume of dust, as the loud roar of its engine and screeching tires dominate the soundscape.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A dark-colored rally car with green wheels speeds down a dusty, unpaved road, kicking up a large plume of dust, as the loud roar of its engine and screeching tires dominate the soundscape.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA dark-colored rally car with green wheels speeds down a dusty, unpaved road, kicking up clouds of dust, as the loud roar of its engine and screeching tires dominate the soundscape.\nA dark-colored rally car with green wheels speeds down a dusty, unpaved road, kicking up clouds of dust, as the loud roar of its engine and screeching tires dominate the soundscape.\nThe vehicle is a dark-colored hatchback rally car, identifiable by its body shape and the green wheels, kicking up a large plume of dust as it travels on a rough, unpaved road.\n\nA dark-colored rally car with green wheels speeds down a dusty, unpaved road, kicking up a large plume of dust, as the loud roar of its engine and screeching tires dominate the soundscape.", "time_sec": 256.635, "generation_time_seconds": 145.298, "selection_time_seconds": 110.3292, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 15.79, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "130", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "As the man talks with a slide whistle sound, typing on a keyboard and mouse clicking, woodwind music plays in the background, a ship sails through the game with pirate ships in sight.", "pred": "A pixelated green dragon stands on a ship's mast, with a 'ISNOW' text box and a game menu visible, accompanied by keyboard typing and a male voice saying 'snowflake' and 'attack, use adjective'.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A pixelated green dragon stands on a ship's mast, with a 'ISNOW' text box and a game menu visible, accompanied by keyboard typing and a male voice saying 'snowflake' and 'attack, use adjective'.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA green pixelated dragon stands on a ship's wooden mast against a grey sky, while a text box displays the name 'ISNOW' and a character sprite appears on a lower platform, all accompanied by prominent keyboard typing sounds and a male voice saying 'snowflake' and 'attack, use adjective'.\nThe scene shows a pixelated 2D video game with a green dragon on a ship, a text box with 'ISNOW', and a male voice uttering 'snowflake' and 'attack, use adjective' over distinct keyboard typing sounds.\nA pixelated green dragon stands on a ship's mast, with a 'ISNOW' text box and a game menu visible, accompanied by keyboard typing and a male voice saying 'snowflake' and 'attack, use adjective'.\n\nA pixelated green dragon stands on a ship's mast, with a 'ISNOW' text box and a game menu visible, accompanied by keyboard typing and a male voice saying 'snowflake' and 'attack, use adjective'.", "time_sec": 266.192, "generation_time_seconds": 173.3161, "selection_time_seconds": 91.5932, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 19.51, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "131", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The baby cries as a woman speaks, while a little girl in a pink dress sits on a red chair with a small child.", "pred": "A young child in a yellow shirt crawls on a carpet, then a young girl in a pink dress sits on a purple ottoman holding a floral pillow, all while a baby cries loudly and a woman speaks reassuringly.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A young child in a yellow shirt crawls on a carpet, then a young girl in a pink dress sits on a purple ottoman holding a floral pillow, all while a baby cries loudly and a woman speaks reassuringly.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA young child in a yellow top crawls on a carpeted floor next to a wooden chair, then a young girl in a pink dress sits on a purple ottoman holding a floral-patterned pillow.\n\\boxed{}\nA high-pitched, distressed infant cry is heard, overlapping with a female voice speaking in a concerned tone.\nA young child in a yellow shirt crawls on a carpet, then a young girl in a pink dress sits on a purple ottoman holding a floral pillow, all while a baby cries loudly and a woman speaks reassuringly.\n\nA young child in a yellow shirt crawls on a carpet, then a young girl in a pink dress sits on a purple ottoman holding a floral pillow, all while a baby cries loudly and a woman speaks reassuringly.", "time_sec": 190.091, "generation_time_seconds": 127.3264, "selection_time_seconds": 62.4601, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 50.0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "132", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "As a woman speaks affectionately, a pig oinks  on the bed.", "pred": "A small pig with a curly tail is under a dark blanket in a dim room as a person asks, \"What are you doing under there?\" and says, \"Night night.\"", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A small pig with a curly tail is under a dark blanket in a dim room as a person asks, \"What are you doing under there?\" and says, \"Night night.\"", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA small, light-colored pig with a curly tail is lying on its side under a dark blanket in a dimly lit room.\n A person's voice asks, \"What are you doing under there?\" followed by \"Night night.\"\n  The pig pants heavily as the camera moves away.\nThe scene opens with a low-angle, shaky shot of a small pig sleeping under a dark blanket, its curly tail and snout visible.\n The camera then pulls back to reveal more of the room, showing a white dresser and a dark filing cabinet.\n As the camera moves, a person off-screen speaks, first asking, \"What are you doing under there?\", then saying, \"Night night.\"\nA small, light-colored pig with a curly tail is visible beneath a dark blanket in a dimly lit room, while a person's voice asks, \"What are you doing under there?\" followed by \"Night night.\"\n\nA small pig with a curly tail is under a dark blanket in a dim room as a person asks, \"What are you doing under there?\" and says, \"Night night.\"", "time_sec": 226.277, "generation_time_seconds": 153.0837, "selection_time_seconds": 72.7071, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 8.7, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "133", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A black sports car speeds down a curvy road with the sound of humming and revving engine, accompanied by squealing tires.", "pred": "A black sports car drifts around a paved curve, its tires producing sustained, high-pitched squeals on the asphalt.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A black sports car drifts around a paved curve, its tires producing sustained, high-pitched squeals on the asphalt.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA black sports car is seen drifting aggressively around a paved bend on a sunlit, tree-lined road.\nThe engine's high-pitched roar and the continuous, high-pitched squeal of tires on pavement are clearly audible.\n The car's movement is fast and sideways, consistent with drifting.\n The tires' screech is sustained and intense, indicating a prolonged loss of traction.\n The engine noise fluctuates quickly, corresponding with the car's aggressive maneuvering through the turn.\nA black sports car drifts around a curve, its tires producing sustained, high-pitched squeals on the asphalt.\n\nA black sports car drifts around a paved curve, its tires producing sustained, high-pitched squeals on the asphalt.", "time_sec": 193.887, "generation_time_seconds": 118.0033, "selection_time_seconds": 75.6141, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 28.57, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "134", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A child and a man engage in conversation as bird sounds fill the air, including a bird in a cage on the roof of a building and a broken cage on the roof of a building.", "pred": "Pigeons perch on a white wire mesh loft under a bright sun, while a child speaks in Spanish and the rhythmic clatter of a rolling suitcase echoes in the background.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "Pigeons perch on a white wire mesh loft under a bright sun, while a child speaks in Spanish and the rhythmic clatter of a rolling suitcase echoes in the background.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nObserving the visual details first, the scene is outdoors on a sunny day, featuring multiple pigeons on a large, white wire mesh structure, likely a pigeon loft or dovecote, attached to a building with a brick chimney. One pigeon is captured mid-flight, suggesting active movement.\nNow, analyzing the audio, the sound of a child speaking in Spanish (\"Pero bueno, después lo sacas. Ahí vamos.\") is present, along with the distinct, rhythmic clatter of wheels moving on a hard surface, characteristic of a suitcase being pulled.\nThe visual scene is static, showing only pigeons and the structure, with\nThe visual scene shows several pigeons on a white wire mesh pigeon loft under a bright sun, while the audio contains a child's speech in Spanish and the prominent rolling sound of wheels on pavement.\nThe audio contains a child's voice speaking in Spanish, saying \"Pero bueno, después lo sacas. Ahí vamos.\", which translates to \"But okay, take it out later. Let's go.\" Immediately following this speech, a continuous and rhythmic rattling and clattering sound, highly characteristic of a rolling suitcase or cart with wheels on a hard, paved surface, becomes clearly audible and persists in the background.\n\nPigeons perch on a white wire mesh loft under a bright sun, while a child speaks in Spanish and the rhythmic clatter of a rolling suitcase echoes in the background.", "time_sec": 265.462, "generation_time_seconds": 178.7023, "selection_time_seconds": 85.7936, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 5.71, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "135", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The man's voice narrates as he cuts wood with a knife on a wooden table, followed by the sound of paper shuffling.", "pred": "A person's hands use a large knife to cut a small piece of wood, accompanied by the sound of sawing and a male voice speaking.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A person's hands use a large knife to cut a small piece of wood, accompanied by the sound of sawing and a male voice speaking.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA person's hands use a large knife to cut a small piece of wood, accompanied by the sound of sawing and a male voice speaking.\nA pair of hands guides a knife to slice a slender wooden strip, the blade making a crisp, clean cut while a male voice narrates the action, all occurring in a quiet, indoor space.\nA person's hands are using a large, dark-bladed knife to cut a small, light-colored piece of wood on a wooden surface, and the sound of a person speaking is audible.\n\nA person's hands use a large knife to cut a small piece of wood, accompanied by the sound of sawing and a male voice speaking.", "time_sec": 203.735, "generation_time_seconds": 121.9518, "selection_time_seconds": 81.1869, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 28.57, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "136", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the intense video game scene, clicks, gunshots, and breathing are heard as a woman navigates through a cave.", "pred": "A first-person view shows a player aiming a wooden gun at a character trapped in a purple crystal within a stone dungeon, accompanied by the sounds of reloading and gunfire.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A first-person view shows a player aiming a wooden gun at a character trapped in a purple crystal within a stone dungeon, accompanied by the sounds of reloading and gunfire.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe player aims a weapon at a character in a purple crystal within a stone dungeon, followed by sounds of reloading and gunfire.\nThe player's first-person perspective shows a stone-walled dungeon environment with a heads-up display indicating health and ammunition.\nThe player holds a wooden gun with a metallic barrel, aiming it at a character trapped inside a purple, glowing crystal, with a heads-up display showing health, ammunition, and a knife.\n\nA first-person view shows a player aiming a wooden gun at a character trapped in a purple crystal within a stone dungeon, accompanied by the sounds of reloading and gunfire.", "time_sec": 196.848, "generation_time_seconds": 129.8589, "selection_time_seconds": 66.6383, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "137", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man stands on a train track , as steam billows out followed by knocking sounds.", "pred": "A man in light-colored work clothes uses a long tool on a white concrete railway barrier next to a black steam locomotive, accompanied by the loud, continuous hiss of escaping steam.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A man in light-colored work clothes uses a long tool on a white concrete railway barrier next to a black steam locomotive, accompanied by the loud, continuous hiss of escaping steam.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA man in light-colored work clothes stands beside a black steam locomotive, using a long tool on a white concrete railway barrier as the distinct hiss of escaping steam from a train fills the air.\nA man in light-colored work clothes is operating a long-handled tool on a white concrete railway barrier adjacent to a black steam locomotive, and the prominent sound is the powerful, sustained hiss of high-pressure steam being released from the train.\nThe operator uses the tool to work on a white concrete barrier, and the continuous, high-pitched hissing indicates steam being vented from the locomotive's system under pressure.\n\nA man in light-colored work clothes uses a long tool on a white concrete railway barrier next to a black steam locomotive, accompanied by the loud, continuous hiss of escaping steam.", "time_sec": 201.134, "generation_time_seconds": 135.3007, "selection_time_seconds": 64.7406, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 12.9, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "138", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "As a man talks, footsteps on dirt are heard amidst buzzing insects and chirping birds, while a beekeeper inspects a frame of bees inside a wooden beehive.", "pred": "Hands lift a wooden beehive frame, revealing honeycomb and insects, while a person speaks in Polish and a zipper is manipulated.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "Hands lift a wooden beehive frame, revealing honeycomb and insects, while a person speaks in Polish and a zipper is manipulated.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA person's hands manipulate wooden frames within a beehive, then lift one out, while faint, muffled speech in Polish and the sound of a zipper are heard.\nA person's hands are visible manipulating wooden slats within a wooden box, which is a beehive, then the hands lift a frame out of it, all while the sound of a zipper being operated is heard.\nThe hands lift a frame, revealing honeycomb and insects, as a person speaks in Polish and a zipper is manipulated.\n\nHands lift a wooden beehive frame, revealing honeycomb and insects, while a person speaks in Polish and a zipper is manipulated.", "time_sec": 206.074, "generation_time_seconds": 129.2755, "selection_time_seconds": 75.4052, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 26.67, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "139", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "Birds quack amidst passing traffic as they stand on the ground near a small garden with a bird bath and potted plants, while a black bird perches on a fence nearby.", "pred": "A black chicken and two Muscovy ducks are in a garden, while the audio features the deep, guttural grunting of a pig.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A black chicken and two Muscovy ducks are in a garden, while the audio features the deep, guttural grunting of a pig.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe visual shows a black chicken and two dark-feathered Muscovy ducks on a concrete path in a garden. The audio contains a series of low, guttural, breathy, and rhythmic grunting sounds that are characteristic of pigs, not the chickens or ducks seen in the video.\nThe video displays a black chicken and two dark-feathered Muscovy ducks in a garden setting, while the accompanying audio consists of deep, guttural grunting and snorting sounds characteristic of a pig.\nThe scene is an outdoor garden or backyard with plants, a low brick wall, and a concrete path. A black chicken is visible in the initial frame. The two ducks have dark greenish-black plumage, white spots, and prominent red caruncles on their faces, identifying them as Muscovy ducks. The audio does not contain any sounds from these animals; instead, it features non-vocal, low-frequency grunts and snorts that are physically distinct from chicken clucks or duck quacks.\n\nA black chicken and two Muscovy ducks are in a garden, while the audio features the deep, guttural grunting of a pig.", "time_sec": 287.078, "generation_time_seconds": 172.3759, "selection_time_seconds": 112.9359, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 12.5, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "140", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the serene setting of nature, a man speaks amidst the chirping of birds and the squeaking of a frog, as a green frog and a snake coexist in the dirt with rocks and plants nearby.", "pred": "A hand digs into dark soil with a turquoise-handled tool, uncovering a yellow-and-black frog that immediately croaks.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A hand digs into dark soil with a turquoise-handled tool, uncovering a yellow-and-black frog that immediately croaks.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA person's hand uses a turquoise-handled trowel to dig up dark soil, revealing a yellow and black patterned frog that immediately croaks loudly.\nA hand wields a turquoise-handled tool to dig into dark, clumpy soil, uncovering a yellow-and-black frog which responds with a sharp croak.\nBased on the visual and auditory evidence, the frog's croak is a direct reaction to being unearthed, indicating a startle or distress vocalization.\n\nA hand digs into dark soil with a turquoise-handled tool, uncovering a yellow-and-black frog that immediately croaks.", "time_sec": 197.895, "generation_time_seconds": 119.6275, "selection_time_seconds": 77.8997, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 6.67, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "141", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "Two men discuss while an insect buzzes by, wind blows, and birds chirp in the distance, as a person holding a pen  draws a map of the area.", "pred": "A hand with a blue pen points to a topographic map with contour lines and grid coordinates while two men discuss a feature that 'curves'.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A hand with a blue pen points to a topographic map with contour lines and grid coordinates while two men discuss a feature that 'curves'.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA hand uses a blue pen to point at a topographic map with contour lines and grid coordinates, while two men discuss a feature, suggesting a channel, using terms like \"leads\" and \"curves\" without mentioning the map or their surroundings.\nA hand holding a blue-tipped pen points to a topographic map with contour lines and grid coordinates, while two male voices discuss a feature described as a 'channel' that 'curves'.\nA hand with a blue pen points to a topographic map with contour lines, grid coordinates, and plotted points while two men discuss a feature that 'curves'.\n\nA hand with a blue pen points to a topographic map with contour lines and grid coordinates while two men discuss a feature that 'curves'.", "time_sec": 203.712, "generation_time_seconds": 139.9908, "selection_time_seconds": 63.3092, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 32.26, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "142", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man's voice narrates as a motorcycle accelerates down a narrow road with a blue car following behind.", "pred": "From a first-person view, gloved hands grip motorcycle handlebars as the vehicle accelerates on a sunlit, tree-lined road, the engine roaring as a male voice comments on its performance.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "From a first-person view, gloved hands grip motorcycle handlebars as the vehicle accelerates on a sunlit, tree-lined road, the engine roaring as a male voice comments on its performance.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe scene is a first-person perspective of riding a motorcycle on a sunlit, tree-lined road, with a blue car ahead, while the loud engine of the motorcycle dominates the audio, accompanied by a male voice discussing its performance.\nThe rider's gloved hands grip black handlebars with silver mirrors reflecting the road, a digital instrument panel is visible, and a blue car travels ahead on the asphalt road under a bright sky, all while the powerful engine sound of the motorcycle is accompanied by a male voice speaking.\nThe motorcycle's black handlebars and silver side mirrors reflect the sunlit road, with a blue car visible ahead on the asphalt, while the rider's gloved hands grip the controls and a male voice speaks over the loud engine noise.\n\nFrom a first-person view, gloved hands grip motorcycle handlebars as the vehicle accelerates on a sunlit, tree-lined road, the engine roaring as a male voice comments on its performance.", "time_sec": 235.932, "generation_time_seconds": 161.8395, "selection_time_seconds": 72.9545, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 25.0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "143", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A person on a boat catches a bass with a hook in its mouth, as water splashes, a duck quacks, and the person laughs.", "pred": "A fish is reeled in from dark green water toward a red and white kayak, accompanied by duck quacks and water splashing.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A fish is reeled in from dark green water toward a red and white kayak, accompanied by duck quacks and water splashing.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA fish is being reeled in from dark green water towards a red and white kayak, while a duck quacks loudly nearby.\nThe audio confirms the presence of a duck, but the visual scene contains no duck; the focus is on a fish being reeled in from dark green water toward a red and white kayak.\nA fish is being reeled in from dark green water toward a red and white kayak, while a duck quacks loudly nearby. The sounds of water lapping and a splash are also audible.\n\nA fish is reeled in from dark green water toward a red and white kayak, accompanied by duck quacks and water splashing.", "time_sec": 219.625, "generation_time_seconds": 131.2295, "selection_time_seconds": 87.3199, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 21.43, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "144", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A crowd of people cheers and applause to the dancers for dance performs on stage.", "pred": "A large, dense crowd in an auditorium is clapping and cheering with excitement.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A large, dense crowd in an auditorium is clapping and cheering with excitement.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA group of people are on a stage with a curtain behind them, while a crowd in the foreground is seen clapping.\n\\boxed{A large, dense crowd in an auditorium is clapping and cheering with excitement.}\nThe stage is set with a heavy, pleated curtain serving as a backdrop behind the performers.\n\nA large, dense crowd in an auditorium is clapping and cheering with excitement.", "time_sec": 222.644, "generation_time_seconds": 136.3174, "selection_time_seconds": 85.5808, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 13.33, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "145", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the bathroom, a man with a beard is shaving on his face,while there is a sink  and water splashing sounds in the background.", "pred": "A person applies white shaving cream to their face, then the scene cuts to a dark countertop with a white bowl and a silver tool, ending with a loud crack.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A person applies white shaving cream to their face, then the scene cuts to a dark countertop with a white bowl and a silver tool, ending with a loud crack.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA person applies white shaving cream to their face (0:00-0:02), then the scene changes to a dark surface with a white bowl and a silver tool (0:03-0:09), concluding with a loud, sharp crack (0:09).\nA person applies white shaving cream to their face before the scene cuts to a dark countertop with a white bowl and a silver tool, followed by a sudden, loud crack.\nThe scene opens with a tight shot of a person's face, their cheek and jaw covered in thick, white shaving cream, while they use their right hand to spread it. The camera then abruptly cuts to a wider, dimly lit shot of a dark-colored countertop, upon which rests a white ceramic bowl and a silver-colored metallic object with a handle. This arrangement suggests a grooming station. The sequence ends abruptly with a single, sharp, high-pitched cracking sound, resembling snapping wood, which is not consistent with the prior visual context of shaving.\n\nA person applies white shaving cream to their face, then the scene cuts to a dark countertop with a white bowl and a silver tool, ending with a loud crack.", "time_sec": 197.385, "generation_time_seconds": 141.7334, "selection_time_seconds": 54.8485, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 6.9, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "146", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The hissing spray of a pressure washer cleans the roof as liquid patters on the surface, while a man works diligently atop the metal roof with a squeegee.", "pred": "A person in shorts and light footwear sprays a white, wavy-tiled roof with a pressure washer, producing a loud, high-frequency hissing sound.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A person in shorts and light footwear sprays a white, wavy-tiled roof with a pressure washer, producing a loud, high-frequency hissing sound.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA person stands on a white tiled roof under a partly cloudy blue sky, spraying it with a pressure washer, which produces a loud, high-pressure hissing sound.\nA person sprays a white, wavy-tiled roof with a high-pressure device, creating a loud, sustained, high-frequency hissing sound.\nThe individual, clad in shorts and light-colored footwear, is actively operating a pressure washer, directing its nozzle at the roof tiles, as confirmed by the intense, high-pressure hissing noise audible in the recording.\n\nA person in shorts and light footwear sprays a white, wavy-tiled roof with a pressure washer, producing a loud, high-frequency hissing sound.", "time_sec": 212.937, "generation_time_seconds": 135.567, "selection_time_seconds": 76.8796, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 25.81, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "147", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The helicopter flies low over a field, its engine running idle as the wind blows heavily into the microphone.", "pred": "A large military helicopter idles on a grassy field, its rotors creating a deafening whine and a powerful downdraft.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A large military helicopter idles on a grassy field, its rotors creating a deafening whine and a powerful downdraft.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA military helicopter is on a grassy field, its main and tail rotors spinning at high speed, creating a loud, powerful rushing and whooshing sound.\nA large, dark-colored military helicopter with twin rotors and a tail rotor is stationary on a dry, grassy field under a hazy sky, while its engines and rotors produce a deafening, high-pitched whine and a powerful, low-frequency rumble from the downdraft.\n\\boxed{\\text{A large military helicopter idles on a grassy field, its rotors creating a deafening whine and a powerful downdraft.}}\nThe aircraft is a large, multi-engine helicopter, possibly an Mi-17, characterized by its twin main rotors and a visible tail rotor. Its engine sound is a deep, powerful, and continuous roar, indicating significant power output. The prominent, high-frequency rushing and whooshing sound is the noise of the massive rotors slicing through the air at high speed.\n\nA large military helicopter idles on a grassy field, its rotors creating a deafening whine and a powerful downdraft.", "time_sec": 252.524, "generation_time_seconds": 183.0006, "selection_time_seconds": 69.0721, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 22.22, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "148", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man speaks on a pier next to a body of water as waves splash in the background.", "pred": "A person stands on a wooden pier as waves lap against its pilings, with a body of water stretching to the horizon under a cloudy sky.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A person stands on a wooden pier as waves lap against its pilings, with a body of water stretching to the horizon under a cloudy sky.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe audio confirms the presence of a dock through the sound of waves lapping against its wooden pilings, while the visual shows a body of water under a cloudy sky with a partial view of a pier structure on the left.\nThe audio confirms the visual scene by clearly stating \"standing on the edge of the dock\" and providing the ambient sound of water lapping against a wooden structure.\nThe audio explicitly identifies the location as the \"edge of the dock\" while simultaneously capturing the sound of water lapping against wooden pilings, and the video visually confirms this by showing a body of water next to a wooden pier structure.\n\nA person stands on a wooden pier as waves lap against its pilings, with a body of water stretching to the horizon under a cloudy sky.", "time_sec": 208.367, "generation_time_seconds": 132.3474, "selection_time_seconds": 75.4362, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 32.0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "149", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "As the man's voice blends with the sound of ocean waves trickling and splashing, the bow of a sailboat navigates through the open sea with the wind and waves.", "pred": "A sailboat's white bow and rigging are visible as it moves through sunlit, choppy water toward a distant mountainous shore, while the audio is dominated by the loud, low-frequency rumble of strong wind buffeting the microphone.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A sailboat's white bow and rigging are visible as it moves through sunlit, choppy water toward a distant mountainous shore, while the audio is dominated by the loud, low-frequency rumble of strong wind buffeting the microphone.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nObserving the visual details: the scene is from the deck of a moving sailboat, identifiable by the white hull, mast, rigging, and taut sail, with choppy, sunlit water and a distant mountainous coastline under a partly cloudy sky.\nA white sailboat with a taut sail and visible rigging cuts through choppy, sunlit water, its bow pointed toward a distant, mountainous coastline under a partly cloudy sky, while the sound of strong wind buffeting the microphone is audible.\nThe video captures a first-person perspective from the bow of a sailboat cutting through sun-drenched, choppy water, with the vessel's white hull, mast, and taut sail clearly visible, while the audio is dominated by the loud, low-frequency rumble and buffeting of strong wind directly hitting the recording device.\n\nA sailboat's white bow and rigging are visible as it moves through sunlit, choppy water toward a distant mountainous shore, while the audio is dominated by the loud, low-frequency rumble of strong wind buffeting the microphone.", "time_sec": 241.472, "generation_time_seconds": 154.8695, "selection_time_seconds": 85.9747, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 10.81, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "150", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a bathroom with a white urinal and a black drain, a man's voice is muffled by the camera as water gurgles in the drain, followed by the sound of a toilet flushing.", "pred": "A hand presses a white flush button on a green wall, triggering a powerful, gurgling toilet flush.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A hand presses a white flush button on a green wall, triggering a powerful, gurgling toilet flush.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA hand presses a white, rectangular flush button mounted on a lime-green wall, which activates a powerful flush of a white, squat-style toilet with a circular drain set into a tiled floor.\nThe flush is activated by a hand pressing a white, rectangular button mounted on a lime-green wall, which then triggers a loud, cascading rush of water as the toilet's drain is rapidly filled.\n\\boxed{}\nThe initial visual shows a human hand pressing a white, rectangular flush actuator on a lime-green wall, confirming a manual flush mechanism. The subsequent audio confirms the activation of a powerful water-based system, consistent with a toilet flush, characterized by turbulent, high-velocity water sounds. This auditory event, featuring strong gurgling and rushing noises, directly corresponds to the visual cue of the flush actuator being engaged, establishing a clear cause-and-effect relationship between the user's action and the mechanical response.\n\nA hand presses a white flush button on a green wall, triggering a powerful, gurgling toilet flush.", "time_sec": 206.075, "generation_time_seconds": 135.4116, "selection_time_seconds": 70.0169, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 14.29, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "151", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a bustling city, a man in a suit and tie walks down a train as a woman gazes out the window, while a group of people chat amidst the sound of a crying infant and a muffled bus engine.", "pred": "A person in a dark blue hooded sweatshirt with a silver zipper is visible while a baby cries and people talk in the background.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A person in a dark blue hooded sweatshirt with a silver zipper is visible while a baby cries and people talk in the background.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA person in a dark blue hooded sweatshirt with a silver zipper is visible.\nThe sound of a baby crying is audible, mixed with indistinct human speech.\nA person in a dark blue hooded sweatshirt with a silver zipper is visible while a baby cries and people talk in the background.\nA person with dark, curly hair is bent over, wearing a dark blue hooded sweatshirt with a silver zipper.\nThe audio consists of a baby's crying and muffled human speech.\n\nA person in a dark blue hooded sweatshirt with a silver zipper is visible while a baby cries and people talk in the background.", "time_sec": 212.041, "generation_time_seconds": 125.7199, "selection_time_seconds": 85.598, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 5.71, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "152", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The sound of metal clacking sharply as water drains down a pipe is accompanied by the visual of a white urinal with a red hole in the drain.", "pred": "A red drain stopper is pulled from a sink, causing a gurgling, continuous draining sound as water evacuates the basin.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A red drain stopper is pulled from a sink, causing a gurgling, continuous draining sound as water evacuates the basin.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA sink drain plug is being pulled, causing the water to gurgle and drain away.\nA red drain stopper is pulled from a sink, causing a gurgling, continuous draining sound as water evacuates the basin.\nA red drain stopper is pulled from a sink, causing a gurgling, continuous draining sound as water evacuates the basin.\n\nA red drain stopper is pulled from a sink, causing a gurgling, continuous draining sound as water evacuates the basin.", "time_sec": 188.102, "generation_time_seconds": 117.052, "selection_time_seconds": 70.8058, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 27.59, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "153", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The engine vibrates as a man speaks while looking under the hood at the exposed engine of a car.", "pred": "The engine compartment of a car is shown as the engine roars to life, then fails to start, producing a series of sharp cranking sounds.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "The engine compartment of a car is shown as the engine roars to life, then fails to start, producing a series of sharp cranking sounds.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe audio begins with the loud, sustained roar of a high-revving internal combustion engine, which then cuts out abruptly and is followed by a series of sharp, percussive cranking sounds, after which a male voice can be heard speaking.\nThe engine is clearly shown running.\n The visual scene is the engine compartment of a car.\n The audio corresponds to the sound of the engine starting, struggling to turn over, and then stopping.\n This creates a clear, objective narrative of the engine failing to start successfully.\nThe audio features an engine's powerful roar followed by a failed start, which directly corresponds to the live action of the engine being started and then failing to turn over in the visual display.\n\nThe engine compartment of a car is shown as the engine roars to life, then fails to start, producing a series of sharp cranking sounds.", "time_sec": 206.662, "generation_time_seconds": 138.8806, "selection_time_seconds": 67.0173, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 25.0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "154", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The audio whooshes as a woman speaks, followed by digital beeps and men talking, while a person stands on a boat in the ocean next to a logo for a technology company.", "pred": "\\boxed{A man in a white t-shirt holds two walkie-talkies while a synthesized voice announces \"BB TALKIN' INTERCOM CONNECTED\" followed by a man saying, \"Let's talk BB Talkin'\".}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "\\boxed{A man in a white t-shirt holds two walkie-talkies while a synthesized voice announces \"BB TALKIN' INTERCOM CONNECTED\" followed by a man saying, \"Let's talk BB Talkin'\".}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe audio begins with a dramatic sound effect followed by a synthesized female voice announcing \"BB TALKIN' INTERCOM CONNECTED\", which is immediately followed by a male voice stating \"Let's talk BB Talkin'\", and then a second male voice responding with \"That's what I want\".\nA man in a white t-shirt stands behind a counter displaying walkie-talkies and headsets as a synthesized voice announces \"BB TALKIN' INTERCOM CONNECTED\" followed by a man saying, \"Let's talk BB Talkin'\".\nThe man has a silver and black walkie-talkie with a long antenna in his left hand, and a white and blue walkie-talkie with a short antenna in his right hand.\n\nA man in a white t-shirt holds two walkie-talkies while a synthesized voice announces \"BB TALKIN' INTERCOM CONNECTED\" followed by a man saying, \"Let's talk BB Talkin'\".\n\\boxed{A man in a white t-shirt holds two walkie-talkies while a synthesized voice announces \"BB TALKIN' INTERCOM CONNECTED\" followed by a man saying, \"Let's talk BB Talkin'\".}", "time_sec": 297.825, "generation_time_seconds": 191.6932, "selection_time_seconds": 105.562, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 5.26, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "155", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man with a tattoo on his arm stirs a pan of sizzling green peppers and onions on the stove, creating a symphony of banging and cracking sounds.", "pred": "A tattooed arm stirs chopped green vegetables in a black cast-iron skillet on a white electric stove, as a male voice instructs to season them with black pepper.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A tattooed arm stirs chopped green vegetables in a black cast-iron skillet on a white electric stove, as a male voice instructs to season them with black pepper.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA tattooed arm stirs chopped green vegetables in a black cast-iron skillet on a stovetop, while a speaker instructs to season the vegetables with black pepper.\nA tattooed arm uses a wooden spoon to stir chopped green vegetables in a black cast-iron skillet placed on a white electric stove, as a male voice instructs that the vegetables need to be seasoned with black pepper.\nThe arm, covered in extensive black ink tattoos, holds a light-brown wooden spoon and performs a circular stirring motion within a black cast-iron skillet. The skillet, positioned on a white electric stovetop with black coil burners, contains a mixture of finely chopped, vibrant green vegetables. A male voice provides culinary instruction, stating that the vegetables must be seasoned, and he mentions using black pepper.\n\nA tattooed arm stirs chopped green vegetables in a black cast-iron skillet on a white electric stove, as a male voice instructs to season them with black pepper.", "time_sec": 255.089, "generation_time_seconds": 140.0787, "selection_time_seconds": 114.2016, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 22.86, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "156", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man's voice echoes as race cars speed and the engine humming sound through turns on the track.", "pred": "A blue and black sprint car with the number 72 races on a dirt track, kicking up dust as its high-revving engine roars.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A blue and black sprint car with the number 72 races on a dirt track, kicking up dust as its high-revving engine roars.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA blue and black race car with the number 72 is driving on a dirt track, kicking up dust, while a loud engine sound is heard.\nThe scene is a dirt track race. A single, open-cockpit race car, predominantly blue with black accents and a large number '72' on its side, is shown in motion. The car is kicking up a significant amount of brown dirt or dust as it travels along the track. The sound is a high-revving, powerful engine, characteristic of a race car accelerating aggressively on the track. The combination of the vehicle's appearance, the dirt track, and the engine noise suggests a live motorsport event.\nObserving the dirt track environment, the open-cockpit design of the vehicle, and the specific dust trail, the vehicle is confirmed as a sprint car. The auditory analysis reveals multiple layers: a high-frequency engine whine and a low-frequency rumble. The sound's increasing pitch and volume directly correlate with the vehicle's movement from left to right across the frame. The combination of the vehicle's aggressive motion and the engine's characteristics confirms it is actively racing on the dirt track.\n\nA blue and black sprint car with the number 72 races on a dirt track, kicking up dust as its high-revving engine roars.", "time_sec": 299.644, "generation_time_seconds": 195.7227, "selection_time_seconds": 103.5614, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 14.81, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "157", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man laughing while making a cloud of smoke on a table, as a man on a surfboard in a pool of water bottle with a table and chairs on the floor talks.", "pred": "A person in a grey t-shirt and white gloves kneels on a dark blue floor, pouring a liquid from a white bottle which produces a large volume of white smoke.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A person in a grey t-shirt and white gloves kneels on a dark blue floor, pouring a liquid from a white bottle which produces a large volume of white smoke.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA person in a grey t-shirt and dark pants kneels on a dark floor, pouring a liquid from a white container onto the ground, which immediately produces a large volume of white smoke.\nA person wearing a grey t-shirt and white gloves kneels on a dark blue floor, pouring a liquid from a white bottle which produces a large volume of white smoke.\nA large cloud of white smoke rapidly expands from where a person in a grey t-shirt poured a liquid from a white bottle, filling the floor space and partially obscuring the view.\n\nA person in a grey t-shirt and white gloves kneels on a dark blue floor, pouring a liquid from a white bottle which produces a large volume of white smoke.", "time_sec": 179.113, "generation_time_seconds": 123.7294, "selection_time_seconds": 55.2213, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 17.65, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "158", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a white tiled room, a small motor buzzes as a man speaks while a metal door closes, resembling a microwave oven.", "pred": "A black and silver microwave oven with an illuminated control panel is shown; a man speaks, a door closes, and the appliance emits a continuous humming sound.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A black and silver microwave oven with an illuminated control panel is shown; a man speaks, a door closes, and the appliance emits a continuous humming sound.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA black and silver microwave oven displays an illuminated control panel with blue lights; a man's voice is heard speaking, followed by the sound of a door closing as the appliance begins to operate.\nThe appliance has a black and silver exterior with a control panel featuring illuminated buttons; a man speaks, and the appliance emits a continuous humming sound, indicating it is operational.\nThe audio begins with a man speaking, followed by a mechanical click as a door closes, and then the appliance emits a continuous humming sound, indicating it is operational.\n\nA black and silver microwave oven with an illuminated control panel is shown; a man speaks, a door closes, and the appliance emits a continuous humming sound.", "time_sec": 220.148, "generation_time_seconds": 135.4231, "selection_time_seconds": 84.3641, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 38.71, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "159", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a building, a man stands in front of a large TV as a crowd of people laughs, applause, and claps in response to his speech.", "pred": "A man in a dark suit speaks into a microphone on a stage, prompting loud, sustained laughter and applause from a seated audience.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A man in a dark suit speaks into a microphone on a stage, prompting loud, sustained laughter and applause from a seated audience.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA man in a suit speaks in front of a studio audience whose laughter and applause follow his remarks.\nA man in a dark suit and tie, identified as a host by his microphone, stands on a brightly lit stage and speaks, prompting loud, collective laughter and sustained applause from a diverse, seated audience in the foreground.\nThe host in the dark suit addresses the audience, and the crowd's audible, sustained laughter and applause indicate a comedic or light-hearted moment on stage.\n\nA man in a dark suit speaks into a microphone on a stage, prompting loud, sustained laughter and applause from a seated audience.", "time_sec": 181.582, "generation_time_seconds": 120.9135, "selection_time_seconds": 60.3335, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 13.79, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "160", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The little girl is peacefully sleeping on the couch , while the sound of snoring fills the room.", "pred": "A young child with closed eyes rests on a dark surface, accompanied by the sound of a person snoring with deep inhales and exhales.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A young child with closed eyes rests on a dark surface, accompanied by the sound of a person snoring with deep inhales and exhales.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe audio features a person snoring with audible inhales and exhales, while the visual shows a young child with closed eyes and a neutral expression, appearing to be asleep or resting on a dark surface.\nA young child with closed eyes rests on a dark surface, accompanied by the sound of a person snoring with deep inhales and exhales.\nThe child has fair skin, blonde hair, and is wearing a dark, vertically-zipped hoodie. The snoring is a steady, rhythmic sound with a low pitch, matching the cadence of deep sleep.\n\nA young child with closed eyes rests on a dark surface, accompanied by the sound of a person snoring with deep inhales and exhales.", "time_sec": 224.539, "generation_time_seconds": 128.584, "selection_time_seconds": 95.5972, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 17.39, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "161", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The  woman stood in front of the black and white mural, surrounded by paintings of skulls, skeletons, and a fox, as they heard the sound of spraying and hissing with light vibrations..", "pred": "A woman sprays white paint onto a large black canvas featuring a stylized figure with a skull, accompanied by the rhythmic hiss of the spray can.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A woman sprays white paint onto a large black canvas featuring a stylized figure with a skull, accompanied by the rhythmic hiss of the spray can.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA woman sprays white paint onto a large black canvas featuring a stylized figure with a skull, while the sharp, rhythmic hiss of a spray can being used is heard.\nA woman in a dark top and pants applies white paint to a large, vertically-oriented canvas with a spray can, where a prominent skull is partially visible beneath a large black shape, all accompanied by the distinct, rhythmic hissing sound of aerosol spray.\nThe canvas displays a large, stylized figure with a skull; the figure's head is white, its upper torso is orange, and its lower body is black with a white skull; the woman is holding a spray can and moving it across the canvas.\n\nA woman sprays white paint onto a large black canvas featuring a stylized figure with a skull, accompanied by the rhythmic hiss of the spray can.", "time_sec": 222.854, "generation_time_seconds": 134.3848, "selection_time_seconds": 88.1966, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 17.14, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "162", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The rhythmic tick-tock of a large clock with visible gears accompanies a man hanging a black and white clock on the wall in his house.", "pred": "\\boxed{\\text{A stationary ornate wall clock with exposed gears and a swinging pendulum is accompanied by a continuous, rhythmic ticking sound.}}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "\\boxed{\\text{A stationary ornate wall clock with exposed gears and a swinging pendulum is accompanied by a continuous, rhythmic ticking sound.}}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video displays a stationary, ornate wall clock with exposed clockwork, Roman numerals, and a visible pendulum. The audio presents a continuous, rhythmic ticking sound, characteristic of a mechanical clock's operation. The clock is not currently in motion, despite the ticking sound.\nA stationary, ornate black wall clock with exposed gears and Roman numerals is on a beige wall, accompanied by a continuous, rhythmic ticking sound.\nThe clock's face is in a fixed position, indicating no forward movement. A pendulum swings below it, its motion consistent with a clock's timekeeping mechanism. The sound is a regular, metronomic ticking, not a chaotic or irregular noise.\n\nA stationary ornate wall clock with exposed gears and a swinging pendulum is accompanied by a continuous, rhythmic ticking sound.\n\\boxed{\\text{A stationary ornate wall clock with exposed gears and a swinging pendulum is accompanied by a continuous, rhythmic ticking sound.}}", "time_sec": 239.966, "generation_time_seconds": 154.4662, "selection_time_seconds": 84.8965, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 27.59, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "163", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the video, a man in a cap looks at the camera and makes a funny face and  speaking ,whistling sound.", "pred": "\\boxed{\\text{A man in a black cap and white shirt speaks to the camera, followed by a series of high-pitched, rhythmic, mechanical squeaking sounds.}}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "\\boxed{\\text{A man in a black cap and white shirt speaks to the camera, followed by a series of high-pitched, rhythmic, mechanical squeaking sounds.}}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA man wearing a black baseball cap and a white t-shirt speaks to the camera in an indoor setting with white ceiling beams, followed by a sequence of high-pitched, rapid, and rhythmic squeaking sounds.\nThe man's mouth is open mid-speech, and his head is slightly tilted, suggesting he is directly addressing the camera. The squeaking sounds are distinct and mechanical, indicating a moving object like a hinge, pulley, or a musical instrument rather than a living animal.\nA man in a black cap and white shirt speaks to the camera, followed by a series of high-pitched, rhythmic, mechanical squeaking sounds.\n\nA man in a black cap and white shirt speaks to the camera, followed by a series of high-pitched, rhythmic, mechanical squeaking sounds.\n\n\\boxed{\\text{A man in a black cap and white shirt speaks to the camera, followed by a series of high-pitched, rhythmic, mechanical squeaking sounds.}}", "time_sec": 230.206, "generation_time_seconds": 144.8442, "selection_time_seconds": 85.086, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 23.08, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "164", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "As the man talks, a swarm of insects buzz around him.", "pred": "A man in a green shirt crouches on gravel, placing an orange fish into a white net beside a blue pole.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A man in a green shirt crouches on gravel, placing an orange fish into a white net beside a blue pole.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nAfter the initial title card, the video shows a man in a bright green shirt and blue jeans crouching on a gravel surface, using his hands to place a small, live fish into a white, circular net, with a blue pole lying nearby.\nThe visual shows a man in a green shirt crouching on a dirt ground, placing an orange fish into a white net, with a blue pole beside him.\nThe man's posture and hand positioning indicate he is carefully transferring the fish from his hand into the net.\n\nA man in a green shirt crouches on gravel, placing an orange fish into a white net beside a blue pole.", "time_sec": 203.417, "generation_time_seconds": 119.0132, "selection_time_seconds": 84.0792, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 9.52, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "165", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The sound of knocking followed by a machine sawing accompanies a man using a saw to cut a wooden board on a work bench.", "pred": "A person guides a wooden plank into a table saw, which emits a loud, high-pitched whirring as it cuts through the material.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A person guides a wooden plank into a table saw, which emits a loud, high-pitched whirring as it cuts through the material.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA person in a cluttered workshop slides a wooden plank into a table saw, which then emits a loud, high-pitched whirring as it cuts through the material.\nA person positions a rectangular wooden plank on the metallic surface of a table saw, their hand pressing down on the wood near the spinning blade guard; as the person moves the plank forward, the table saw begins to emit a sustained, high-frequency whirring sound.\nThe person's hand remains on the wood, guiding it steadily forward into the blade, while the continuous, abrasive whir of the blade cutting the wood persists.\n\nA person guides a wooden plank into a table saw, which emits a loud, high-pitched whirring as it cuts through the material.", "time_sec": 212.423, "generation_time_seconds": 128.3886, "selection_time_seconds": 82.9, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 14.81, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "166", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the kitchen, a woman fries food while talking, standing next to a white refrigerator.", "pred": "A woman stands in a kitchen, and the sound of food sizzling in a pan can be heard.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A woman stands in a kitchen, and the sound of food sizzling in a pan can be heard.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA woman stands in a kitchen, and the sound of food sizzling in a pan can be heard.\nA woman stands in a kitchen, and the sound of food sizzling in a pan can be heard.\nA woman stands in a kitchen, and the sound of food sizzling in a pan can be heard.\n\nA woman stands in a kitchen, and the sound of food sizzling in a pan can be heard.", "time_sec": 173.569, "generation_time_seconds": 107.1648, "selection_time_seconds": 66.0737, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 31.58, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "167", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man speaks as a stream of water trickles in the background, while a young man rides a boat with a camera on board.", "pred": "A man in a white t-shirt and camouflage shorts sits on the rear of a white boat, touching a black outboard motor, with dense green foliage in the background.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A man in a white t-shirt and camouflage shorts sits on the rear of a white boat, touching a black outboard motor, with dense green foliage in the background.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA man sits on a boat's rear, touching a black outboard motor while a voice describes it as a Briggs & Stratton 5 horsepower four-stroke engine.\nThe man, wearing a white t-shirt and camouflage shorts, sits on the white boat's gunwale and reaches his right hand towards the black outboard motor, with dense green foliage in the background.\nA man with light-colored hair, wearing a white graphic t-shirt and camouflage shorts, sits on the rear gunwale of a white boat, touching a black outboard motor, with a dense background of green palm and broadleaf trees.\n\nA man in a white t-shirt and camouflage shorts sits on the rear of a white boat, touching a black outboard motor, with dense green foliage in the background.", "time_sec": 230.933, "generation_time_seconds": 149.6373, "selection_time_seconds": 80.7291, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 20.69, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "168", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The sound of rushing water fills the room, as a  wooden shelf surrounded by books and a clock on the wall.", "pred": "\\boxed{\\text{A hand turns a metal faucet on a wooden entertainment center, producing a steady stream of running water that is accompanied by a continuous, low-pitched electronic buzz.}}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "\\boxed{\\text{A hand turns a metal faucet on a wooden entertainment center, producing a steady stream of running water that is accompanied by a continuous, low-pitched electronic buzz.}}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe audio consists of a single, sustained, low-pitched electronic buzz or hum, beginning abruptly and continuing without variation until the end of the recording. There are no other discernible sounds in the audio stream.\nBased on the provided video frames, there is an indoor scene featuring a staircase with a dark wooden banister, a wall-mounted picture, a white door, and a wooden entertainment center with a television. A hand enters the frame and turns a metal faucet handle, which causes a continuous sound of running water. The audio consists of a low, sustained electronic buzz.\nA hand turns a metal faucet on a wooden entertainment center, producing a steady stream of running water that is accompanied by a continuous, low-pitched electronic buzz.\n\nA hand turns a metal faucet on a wooden entertainment center, producing a steady stream of running water that is accompanied by a continuous, low-pitched electronic buzz.\n\n\\boxed{\\text{A hand turns a metal faucet on a wooden entertainment center, producing a steady stream of running water that is accompanied by a continuous, low-pitched electronic buzz.}}", "time_sec": 210.597, "generation_time_seconds": 140.7614, "selection_time_seconds": 69.5142, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 13.79, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "169", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The car engine idles before revving loudly, as a young woman with blue hair stands next to a man with a dog on his head.", "pred": "The video shows a close-up of a car engine's components, including a black intake manifold and a yellow oil cap, while the audio features the powerful revving of a high-performance engine.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "The video shows a close-up of a car engine's components, including a black intake manifold and a yellow oil cap, while the audio features the powerful revving of a high-performance engine.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video displays a close-up of a complex mechanical assembly, identified as a car engine due to the presence of components like an air intake manifold, hoses, wires, and a yellow oil cap.\n Simultaneously, the distinct sound of a high-performance engine is heard, culminating in a powerful rev that suggests a high-RPM, likely sports car, engine being tested.\nThe video provides a close-up view of a car's engine compartment, showing the black intake manifold, various hoses, wires, and a yellow oil cap, while the audio features a powerful, high-revving engine sound that strongly suggests a sports car or performance vehicle being tested.\nThe visual details, such as the black plastic intake manifold, the yellow oil filler cap, and the surrounding network of hoses and wires, are characteristic of a modern internal combustion engine bay, not a power tool or an industrial machine.\n\nThe video shows a close-up of a car engine's components, including a black intake manifold and a yellow oil cap, while the audio features the powerful revving of a high-performance engine.", "time_sec": 230.264, "generation_time_seconds": 150.8787, "selection_time_seconds": 78.9579, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 17.14, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "170", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": " A man speaks over an intercom as a muffled helicopter engine roars, followed by gunshots firing in a video game displayed on a laptop screen.", "pred": "Inside a cockpit, a tactical holographic display shows a map with blue and orange icons for friendly and enemy units, while a pilot receives real-time voice commands and combat updates over a headset, all amidst the sounds of battle.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "Inside a cockpit, a tactical holographic display shows a map with blue and orange icons for friendly and enemy units, while a pilot receives real-time voice commands and combat updates over a headset, all amidst the sounds of battle.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nObserving the cockpit, a holographic map displays tactical data with multiple blue and orange icons indicating friendly and hostile units, while the pilot's headset transmits a series of urgent, real-time voice commands and status reports over the sounds of an ongoing combat environment, including weapon fire and explosions.\nThe cockpit's instrument panel displays a tactical map with blue and orange friendly and hostile markers, while a headset transmits urgent voice commands and combat sounds including explosions and radio chatter.\nInside a cockpit, a tactical holographic display shows a map with blue and orange icons for friendly and enemy units, while a pilot receives real-time voice commands and combat updates over a headset, all amidst the sounds of battle.\n\nInside a cockpit, a tactical holographic display shows a map with blue and orange icons for friendly and enemy units, while a pilot receives real-time voice commands and combat updates over a headset, all amidst the sounds of battle.", "time_sec": 249.624, "generation_time_seconds": 164.0713, "selection_time_seconds": 84.3098, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 4.76, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "171", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man wearing a blue glove washes dishes in a kitchen sink with running water as he talks to an elderly woman, accompanied by the sound of plastic clacks and water running down a drain.", "pred": "A person wearing blue gloves holds a dark cylinder under a running faucet over a sink, releasing a stream of liquid as two people converse.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A person wearing blue gloves holds a dark cylinder under a running faucet over a sink, releasing a stream of liquid as two people converse.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA person wearing a blue glove holds a dark cylinder under a faucet over a sink, then turns on the tap, causing a stream of liquid to flow from the cylinder while a man and a woman speak in the background.\nA person wearing blue nitrile gloves holds a dark cylinder under a running faucet over a stainless steel sink, releasing a stream of liquid as two people converse.\nThe person is holding a dark cylinder under the faucet, and the sound of rushing water suggests the cylinder is being flushed or filled.\n\nA person wearing blue gloves holds a dark cylinder under a running faucet over a sink, releasing a stream of liquid as two people converse.", "time_sec": 206.131, "generation_time_seconds": 126.8626, "selection_time_seconds": 78.5677, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 20.0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "172", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The microwave oven hums loudly as an adult male and a child chat, while a sudden beep interrupts the conversation, with a TV playing in the background.", "pred": "A microwave oven with its interior light on illuminates a colorful object on the turntable, as a person's hand is visible on the glass door, while the sound of a loud, rhythmic cranking is heard, followed by a child saying \"Hi\" and a man speaking.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A microwave oven with its interior light on illuminates a colorful object on the turntable, as a person's hand is visible on the glass door, while the sound of a loud, rhythmic cranking is heard, followed by a child saying \"Hi\" and a man speaking.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA microwave oven is shown with its interior light on, illuminating a colorful object on the turntable, while a person's hand is visible on the glass door; simultaneously, a loud, rhythmic cranking sound is heard, followed by a child saying \"Hi\" and a man speaking.\nA microwave oven with its light on illuminates a colorful object on the turntable, as a person's hand is visible on the glass door, while the sound of a loud, rhythmic cranking is heard, followed by a child saying \"Hi\" and a man speaking.\nThe object on the turntable appears to be a colorful, possibly plastic or ceramic item with a green base and a red object on top, illuminated by the oven's interior light, which is distinct from the cranking sound suggesting a separate mechanical process.\n\nA microwave oven with its interior light on illuminates a colorful object on the turntable, as a person's hand is visible on the glass door, while the sound of a loud, rhythmic cranking is heard, followed by a child saying \"Hi\" and a man speaking.", "time_sec": 239.198, "generation_time_seconds": 147.3795, "selection_time_seconds": 91.4877, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 15.0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "173", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The cordless drill with a battery in it is being used to work on something, creating vibrations and humming as it starts and stops several times.", "pred": "A hand holds a teal and black Makita cordless drill, and the audio captures the high-pitched whirring of its motor as it is activated to drive a screw.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A hand holds a teal and black Makita cordless drill, and the audio captures the high-pitched whirring of its motor as it is activated to drive a screw.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA person's hand holds a teal and black Makita cordless drill. In the audio, the drill's motor is activated, producing a loud, high-pitched whirring sound as it is used to drive a screw into a surface.\nA hand holds a teal and black Makita cordless drill, and the audio captures the high-pitched whirring of its motor as it is activated to drive a screw.\nThe drill features a black chuck, a side-mounted trigger, and a black grip. A silver-colored ratchet mechanism is visible on the body, and a battery pack is attached to the base.\n\nA hand holds a teal and black Makita cordless drill, and the audio captures the high-pitched whirring of its motor as it is activated to drive a screw.", "time_sec": 228.646, "generation_time_seconds": 139.9674, "selection_time_seconds": 87.729, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 13.33, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "174", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a serene farm setting, a man's voice is heard speaking as goats and a cow make their sounds, while a little white lamb  stand near a wooden fence in the grass.", "pred": "A young white goat stands with splayed back legs in a dirt enclosure, turning its head right as a person speaks in Japanese and the goat bleats.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A young white goat stands with splayed back legs in a dirt enclosure, turning its head right as a person speaks in Japanese and the goat bleats.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA young, white goat stands in a dirt enclosure, facing away from the camera with its back legs slightly apart, and then turns its head to the right, as a person speaks in Japanese, followed by the goat bleating.\nThe young goat, with its back legs splayed, stands on dirt beside a wooden fence, then turns its head right, while a person speaks and the goat bleats.\nThe white goat's back legs are splayed apart, indicating a wide stance rather than a jump or stumble, and its head is turned to the right as the bleating begins.\n\nA young white goat stands with splayed back legs in a dirt enclosure, turning its head right as a person speaks in Japanese and the goat bleats.", "time_sec": 222.567, "generation_time_seconds": 132.6219, "selection_time_seconds": 88.7061, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 5.26, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "175", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a city parking lot, several fire trucks are parked next to a building as men speak in the distance while whistling and humming.", "pred": "A fire station courtyard with multiple red fire trucks parked in rows is accompanied by a loud, high-pitched metallic screech, suggesting a large vehicle braking hard nearby.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A fire station courtyard with multiple red fire trucks parked in rows is accompanied by a loud, high-pitched metallic screech, suggesting a large vehicle braking hard nearby.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA wide shot of a fire station courtyard displays several red fire trucks parked in neat rows on paved ground, with a large beige building featuring garage bays visible in the background, while the primary audio consists of a loud, high-pitched mechanical squeal of screeching metal, suggesting rapid acceleration or hard braking from a large vehicle.\nThe scene is a fire station courtyard with multiple red fire trucks parked in rows on asphalt, and a large building with open garage bays. The visual context is static with no ongoing action involving the trucks. The audio is dominated by a loud, high-pitched metallic screech, characteristic of friction from tires on pavement or a rapid deceleration event.\nThe fire trucks' stationary status and the open bays suggest the screeching sound is not from an active engine or pump but from an external source.\nThis sound is an extremely high-pitched, sustained metallic screech, consistent with the friction of metal components under stress.\nIt could be the sound of a train wheel scraping the rail, a tram's brake shoes being applied, or a very large vehicle like a bus or truck with an anti-lock braking system activating on a hard stop.\nThe lack of engine noise or environmental sounds in the background suggests the source is relatively close to the recording device, likely on a nearby street.\nTherefore\n\nA fire station courtyard with multiple red fire trucks parked in rows is accompanied by a loud, high-pitched metallic screech, suggesting a large vehicle braking hard nearby.", "time_sec": 263.893, "generation_time_seconds": 180.4588, "selection_time_seconds": 82.8435, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 17.65, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "176", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The church bells ring amidst audio static as a man stands under a wooden roof in the attic.", "pred": "\\boxed{\\text{A man lies on his back within a dark, wooden structure, looking upwards as the massive, rotating wooden arms of a water wheel move slowly above him, accompanied by the deep, resonant tolling of a large bell.}}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "\\boxed{\\text{A man lies on his back within a dark, wooden structure, looking upwards as the massive, rotating wooden arms of a water wheel move slowly above him, accompanied by the deep, resonant tolling of a large bell.}}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA man lies on his back within a dark, wooden structure, looking upwards as the massive, rotating wooden arms of a water wheel move slowly above him, accompanied by the deep, resonant tolling of a large bell.\nThe visual shows a confined space with heavy wooden beams and a person lying on a low surface.\nA man lies on his back within a dark, wooden structure, looking upwards as the massive, rotating wooden arms of a water wheel move slowly above him, accompanied by the deep, resonant tolling of a large bell.\n\nA man lies on his back within a dark, wooden structure, looking upwards as the massive, rotating wooden arms of a water wheel move slowly above him, accompanied by the deep, resonant tolling of a large bell.\n\n\\boxed{\\text{A man lies on his back within a dark, wooden structure, looking upwards as the massive, rotating wooden arms of a water wheel move slowly above him, accompanied by the deep, resonant tolling of a large bell.}}", "time_sec": 218.288, "generation_time_seconds": 145.1103, "selection_time_seconds": 72.7881, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 10.26, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "177", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a cozy bedroom, a man talks while a person snores, and one man take a video.", "pred": "A man in a grey shirt and blue jeans wakes up in a bed with a red pillow as a deep, guttural growl is heard.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A man in a grey shirt and blue jeans wakes up in a bed with a red pillow as a deep, guttural growl is heard.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA man in a grey shirt and blue jeans wakes up in a bed with a red pillow as a deep, guttural growl is heard.\nA man in a grey shirt and blue jeans wakes up in a bed with a red pillow as a deep, guttural growl is heard.\nThe man is shown waking up in a bed with a red pillow, accompanied by a deep, guttural growling sound.\n\nA man in a grey shirt and blue jeans wakes up in a bed with a red pillow as a deep, guttural growl is heard.", "time_sec": 187.428, "generation_time_seconds": 117.6788, "selection_time_seconds": 69.4975, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 8.33, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "178", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A red truck with its lights on driving down a dark street at dusk, accompanied by the wailing police sirens and the sound of heavy wind blowing into a microphone.", "pred": "A red pickup truck with illuminated tail lights and a bed-mounted light moves across a dirt surface in a wooded area, then turns and drives away with headlights on, accompanied by the sound of a two-tone emergency siren and strong wind noise.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A red pickup truck with illuminated tail lights and a bed-mounted light moves across a dirt surface in a wooded area, then turns and drives away with headlights on, accompanied by the sound of a two-tone emergency siren and strong wind noise.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe vehicle is a red pickup truck with illuminated tail lights and a white light on the truck bed, moving from left to right on a dirt or gravel surface in a wooded area. Then, it turns and drives away from the camera with its headlights on, revealing a residential house in the background. The sound consists of a two-tone emergency vehicle siren, which begins with a high-pitched wail followed by a lower, longer wail, and then a repetitive wail, all accompanied by strong wind noise.\nThe vehicle is a red pickup truck with illuminated tail lights and a white light on the truck bed, moving from left to right on a dirt or gravel surface in a wooded area. Then, it turns and drives away from the camera with its headlights on, revealing a residential house in the background. The sound consists of a two-tone emergency vehicle siren, which begins with a high-pitched wail followed by a lower, longer wail, and then a repetitive wail, all accompanied by strong wind noise.\nA red pickup truck is visible in a wooded area. The vehicle has its brake lights illuminated. A light is mounted on the truck bed. The truck is moving from left to right across the frame. The truck then turns and drives away from the camera. The truck's headlights are now on, and a house is visible in the background. The audio contains the distinct sound of a two-tone emergency vehicle siren, which is accompanied by prominent wind noise.\n\nA red pickup truck with illuminated tail lights and a bed-mounted light moves across a dirt surface in a wooded area, then turns and drives away with headlights on, accompanied by the sound of a two-tone emergency siren and strong wind noise.", "time_sec": 268.025, "generation_time_seconds": 166.1006, "selection_time_seconds": 101.5359, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 26.67, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "179", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the bustling kitchen, a man grills hot dogs and chickens while women chat, accompanied by the distant hum of a motor.", "pred": "A metal spider strainer lifts pieces of fried meat from a steaming wok, accompanied by sizzling sounds and a person speaking.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A metal spider strainer lifts pieces of fried meat from a steaming wok, accompanied by sizzling sounds and a person speaking.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA metal spider strainer holds pieces of what appears to be fried or braised meat above a dark wok, with steam rising from the wok's contents below.\nA metal spider strainer holds pieces of what appears to be fried or braised meat above a dark wok, with steam rising from the wok's contents below.\nA metal spider strainer is being used to lift pieces of what appears to be fried or braised meat from a dark wok, with steam rising from the wok's contents below.\n\nA metal spider strainer lifts pieces of fried meat from a steaming wok, accompanied by sizzling sounds and a person speaking.", "time_sec": 167.35, "generation_time_seconds": 113.1577, "selection_time_seconds": 53.9083, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 7.14, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "180", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A toy helicopter flies over a green field with trees and mountains in the background, as muffled plastic clacking is heard.", "pred": "A person stands in a green field as a high-pitched drone whirs overhead, flying near a distant house on a hill.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A person stands in a green field as a high-pitched drone whirs overhead, flying near a distant house on a hill.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA person in a blue shirt is standing in a large green field looking towards a distant house on a hill under a partly cloudy sky.\nThe camera pans across the expansive green field and distant hills, revealing a white house on the far hillside, with a small, dark object resembling a drone visible in the sky above it.\nThe sound is of a high-pitched, whirring drone, consistent with the small, dark object seen flying in the sky above the distant hill.\n\nA person stands in a green field as a high-pitched drone whirs overhead, flying near a distant house on a hill.", "time_sec": 217.898, "generation_time_seconds": 120.1433, "selection_time_seconds": 97.3264, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 15.38, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "181", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a cacophony of sounds, ducks quack and chirp while a rooster crows, as a crowd talks in the background, while a duck and a bird peer through the bars of their cages at the zoo.", "pred": "A mottled brown duck is seen inside a metal wire cage, while the audio features a loud, high-pitched squawking from the duck layered over the indistinct murmur of a crowd.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A mottled brown duck is seen inside a metal wire cage, while the audio features a loud, high-pitched squawking from the duck layered over the indistinct murmur of a crowd.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA brown mottled duck is seen inside a metal wire cage, while the overlapping audio consists of a loud, aggressive, high-pitched squawking from a duck and the general murmur of a distant crowd.\nThe scene is a close-up of a duck with brown, mottled feathers inside a metal wire cage. The duck is looking towards the camera and appears to be vocalizing. The accompanying audio features a prominent, harsh, high-pitched squawking sound, characteristic of a duck, layered over the indistinct murmur of a crowd, suggesting a public setting like a fair or market.\nA mottled brown duck is visible inside a metal wire cage, positioned behind the bars.\nThe audible soundscape is dominated by a loud, harsh, high-pitched squawking, consistent with the bird's vocalization, which is layered over a low, indistinct murmur of a crowd.\n\nA mottled brown duck is seen inside a metal wire cage, while the audio features a loud, high-pitched squawking from the duck layered over the indistinct murmur of a crowd.", "time_sec": 227.035, "generation_time_seconds": 143.6523, "selection_time_seconds": 82.8926, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 10.81, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "182", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the immersive game world, thunder roars in the distance as rain lightly pours, while a man yells and another hums in a room captured.", "pred": "A first-person view shows a firearm with a red-dot sight aimed at a wooden structure in a foggy, outdoor game environment, while a game interface overlays stats and a scoreboard.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A first-person view shows a firearm with a red-dot sight aimed at a wooden structure in a foggy, outdoor game environment, while a game interface overlays stats and a scoreboard.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA third-person perspective shows a player holding a silver and black gun with a red dot sight in a foggy, outdoor game environment.\nThe player is holding a silver and black gun with a red dot sight in a foggy, outdoor game environment.\nThe player's view is first-person, showing a firearm with a red-dot sight aimed at a wooden structure in a foggy, outdoor environment, while a game interface overlays stats and a scoreboard.\n\nA first-person view shows a firearm with a red-dot sight aimed at a wooden structure in a foggy, outdoor game environment, while a game interface overlays stats and a scoreboard.", "time_sec": 201.558, "generation_time_seconds": 130.4158, "selection_time_seconds": 70.3898, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 6.06, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "183", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the video, a crying baby sitting in a yellow high chair looks at the camera and makes a funny face, while in the background, a young woman talking.", "pred": "A baby with dark hair in an orange and white outfit cries intensely while seated in a yellow high chair, as a woman speaks in Japanese.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A baby with dark hair in an orange and white outfit cries intensely while seated in a yellow high chair, as a woman speaks in Japanese.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA baby with dark hair and an orange and white outfit cries loudly while seated in a high chair, as a woman speaks off-screen.\nA young baby with dark hair, wearing a two-toned orange and white long-sleeved shirt with a collar, sits in a rounded yellow chair against a plain light-colored wall, crying with eyes shut and mouth wide open, as a female voice speaks in Japanese.\nThe baby has dark, slightly messy hair and is wearing a two-toned garment with an orange front and white sleeves and collar, featuring two visible white buttons near the chest. The baby is seated in a rounded, high-backed yellow chair with a light-colored wall in the background. The baby's face is scrunched, eyes are tightly closed, and mouth is wide open, with a visible droplet of saliva or snot on the lower lip, indicating intense crying.\n\nA baby with dark hair in an orange and white outfit cries intensely while seated in a yellow high chair, as a woman speaks in Japanese.", "time_sec": 260.455, "generation_time_seconds": 153.849, "selection_time_seconds": 106.1937, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 32.26, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "184", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The man inside the building rings a bell, while the church's bell tower chimes in unison.", "pred": "A light-colored building with a blue-roofed bell tower is shown, while inside, a hand pulls a rope to swing a large bell, producing a complex peal of many bells.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A light-colored building with a blue-roofed bell tower is shown, while inside, a hand pulls a rope to swing a large bell, producing a complex peal of many bells.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video provides two distinct perspectives of the same event: an external view of a light-colored stone church tower with a blue roof and gold finial, and an internal view of the massive, dark metal bell mechanism. The sound is a loud, complex peal of many bells, characteristic of a clock or carillon, not a single bell being struck.\n\\boxed{\\text{A large cathedral bell tower with a blue roof and gold finial is shown, while inside, a complex peal of many large bells sounds.}}\nThe scene opens on an exterior shot of a light-colored building with a prominent bell tower. This tower features a distinctive blue, hexagonal roof topped with a golden finial. The camera then cuts to a close-up inside the tower, showing a hand operating a rope to swing one of the large, dark metal bells. Throughout the sequence, the sound is not of a single bell but a complex, overlapping peal from multiple large bells, characteristic of a carillon or clock chimes, creating a rich, resonant, and somewhat dissonant harmony.\nThe external shot reveals a light-colored, likely stone or stucco building with a classical architectural style. The bell tower is octagonal, topped with a blue, multi-gabled roof and a gold-colored finial. A white railing surrounds the open belfry, where several large, dark bells are suspended. The internal shot provides a close-up of the operational mechanism, showing a dark, metallic bell with a visible clapper and a thick rope being pulled by a hand, indicating a manual operation style common in carillons or large bells rather than automated strike mechanisms.\n\nA light-colored building with a blue-roofed bell tower is shown, while inside, a hand pulls a rope to swing a large bell, producing a complex peal of many bells.", "time_sec": 286.297, "generation_time_seconds": 210.2568, "selection_time_seconds": 75.2277, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 35.71, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "185", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The train horn echoes as a train speeds by on the tracks near a building, with the railroad crossing signals ringing in the distance.", "pred": "A train with a lit front approaches a large beige building along a gravel track, its loud, multi-chime horn sounding continuously.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A train with a lit front approaches a large beige building along a gravel track, its loud, multi-chime horn sounding continuously.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA train with a lit front moves along a track towards a large beige building, while the loud, multi-chime horn of the approaching train sounds.\nThe train's position moves closer to the building, and the horn sound is continuous and clear. The horn has a multi-tone chime, suggesting a large locomotive. The gravel ballast and parallel tracks are visible, with trees and hills in the background under an overcast sky.\nThe train's horn is a loud, multi-chime air horn that is continuous and sounds very close to the recording device, suggesting the train is approaching rapidly on the adjacent track.\n\nA train with a lit front approaches a large beige building along a gravel track, its loud, multi-chime horn sounding continuously.", "time_sec": 210.985, "generation_time_seconds": 132.0469, "selection_time_seconds": 77.276, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 20.69, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "186", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A large red and white plane takes off from the runway at an airport, accompanied by the sound of wind rushing past.", "pred": "A white Turkish Airlines passenger jet with a red tail accelerates on a runway, its powerful engine roar dominating the soundscape.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A white Turkish Airlines passenger jet with a red tail accelerates on a runway, its powerful engine roar dominating the soundscape.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA white commercial airplane with a red tail, bearing Turkish Airlines livery, accelerates on an airport runway, its sound amplified by the powerful roar of its jet engines.\nThe aircraft, a white-bodied passenger jet with a red tail fin featuring a white circular logo, moves along a paved runway with green grass borders under a partly cloudy sky. The sound is dominated by the deep, high-volume roar of its jet engines, consistent with a large commercial airliner in motion.\nA white-bodied passenger airplane with a red tail fin and a circular logo, identified as Turkish Airlines, is accelerating along an airport runway. The visual motion is accompanied by the powerful, low-frequency roar of its jet engines, indicating the aircraft is preparing for takeoff.\n\nA white Turkish Airlines passenger jet with a red tail accelerates on a runway, its powerful engine roar dominating the soundscape.", "time_sec": 248.884, "generation_time_seconds": 156.2951, "selection_time_seconds": 92.2124, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 20.69, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "187", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man sits on a bench near a silver car with its engine running idle, while a logo is visible on the vehicle's side. and in background a man was speacking.", "pred": "A BMW engine is shown, its cover displaying the brand's blue and white roundel logo and the \"BMW\" name in silver block letters, while its continuous mechanical hum and low-frequency rumble are audible.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A BMW engine is shown, its cover displaying the brand's blue and white roundel logo and the \"BMW\" name in silver block letters, while its continuous mechanical hum and low-frequency rumble are audible.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video displays a close-up of a car engine, specifically a BMW, which is running and producing a steady mechanical hum and low-frequency rumble heard in the audio.\nThe engine cover features a prominent circular logo with a blue and white checkered pattern, and the word \"BMW\" is clearly visible in silver block letters on the side.\nA BMW engine is shown, its cover displaying the brand's blue and white roundel logo and the \"BMW\" name in silver block letters, while its continuous mechanical hum and low-frequency rumble are audible.\n\nA BMW engine is shown, its cover displaying the brand's blue and white roundel logo and the \"BMW\" name in silver block letters, while its continuous mechanical hum and low-frequency rumble are audible.", "time_sec": 227.848, "generation_time_seconds": 133.9138, "selection_time_seconds": 93.6148, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 20.0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
