{"id": "189", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The cart with wheels is pushed through the room, creating a symphony of digital beeping, rapid vibrations, and humming on the hard wood floor.", "pred": "A dark green wooden toy wagon with large black wheels and a detached side panel sits on a wooden floor, accompanied by a series of electronic beeps followed by a loud crashing sound.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A dark green wooden toy wagon with large black wheels and a detached side panel sits on a wooden floor, accompanied by a series of electronic beeps followed by a loud crashing sound.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA wooden toy wagon with large black wheels sits on a wooden floor, its side panel detached and lying beside it, while a series of electronic beeps is followed by a loud crashing sound.\nBased on the visual evidence, the wagon has a dark green painted wooden body and large, solid black wheels with a distinct multi-spoke design. Its side panel is detached and lies flat on the floor, indicating it is not currently attached to the main frame.\nThe vehicle has a dark green painted wooden body and large, solid black wheels with multi-spoke designs; its side panel is detached and rests on the floor.\n\nA dark green wooden toy wagon with large black wheels and a detached side panel sits on a wooden floor, accompanied by a series of electronic beeps followed by a loud crashing sound.", "time_sec": 235.261, "generation_time_seconds": 143.0118, "selection_time_seconds": 91.1286, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 11.11, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "190", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The audio-visual caption would be: A black and white dog growling and barking while playing with a ball on the floor in front of a door.", "pred": "A black and white dog plays with a red ball and a grey object on a tiled floor, while a dog barks and growls nearby.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A black and white dog plays with a red ball and a grey object on a tiled floor, while a dog barks and growls nearby.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA black and white dog plays with a red ball and a grey object on a tiled floor, while a dog barks and growls nearby.\nA black and white dog is standing on a tiled floor, holding a red ball in its mouth.\n The dog appears to be playing with the ball.\n There is a grey object on the floor near the dog.\n The dog is also interacting with the grey object.\n There is a door in the background.\n A light is on the wall.\n A dog is barking loudly nearby.\nA black and white dog plays with a red ball and a grey object on a tiled floor, while a dog barks and growls nearby.\n\nA black and white dog plays with a red ball and a grey object on a tiled floor, while a dog barks and growls nearby.", "time_sec": 220.786, "generation_time_seconds": 136.7097, "selection_time_seconds": 83.6782, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 35.71, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "191", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A large black dog sleeping on a green couch with a black dog laying on a pillow, by loud nearby snoring.", "pred": "A brindle dog with a collar lies curled on a green couch, shifting slightly before settling, accompanied by a low, continuous electronic buzz.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A brindle dog with a collar lies curled on a green couch, shifting slightly before settling, accompanied by a low, continuous electronic buzz.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA brindle-colored dog with a collar lies on a green couch, its back and side visible as it shifts and then settles into a resting position, while a low, continuous, electronic buzzing sound is audible in the background.\nA brindle-coated dog with a dark collar is lying on a green, textured couch, shifting its body slightly before settling into a resting position with its head down and body curled.\nThe dog, with dark brindle fur and a collar, is lying on a green couch with a textured, possibly floral, fabric. It is curled up with its head down, and its body shifts slightly.\n\nA brindle dog with a collar lies curled on a green couch, shifting slightly before settling, accompanied by a low, continuous electronic buzz.", "time_sec": 226.756, "generation_time_seconds": 147.9404, "selection_time_seconds": 78.4567, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 20.69, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "192", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A pigeon perched on a wooden wall with something in its beak coos softly as bird wings flap, while a construction machine operates in the background.", "pred": "A grey pigeon with iridescent neck feathers coos with its beak open on a wooden surface as a metal latch slides open.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A grey pigeon with iridescent neck feathers coos with its beak open on a wooden surface as a metal latch slides open.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA grey pigeon with iridescent green and purple neck feathers stands on a wooden surface, its beak open as it coos, while a metal latch is audibly slid open and a cooing sound is heard.\nThe visual shows a grey pigeon with iridescent neck feathers and a red ring on its leg. It is vocalizing with its beak open.\nThe pigeon's open beak and the accompanying soft, staccato cooing sound are synchronized, confirming the source of the vocalization.\n\nA grey pigeon with iridescent neck feathers coos with its beak open on a wooden surface as a metal latch slides open.", "time_sec": 214.483, "generation_time_seconds": 148.098, "selection_time_seconds": 65.6394, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 32.26, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "193", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man quietly paints a white vase on various surfaces while a sprayer sprays with low machine noise in the background.", "pred": "A man in a white shirt uses a spray gun to coat a white vase inside a booth, producing a continuous hissing sound of atomized paint.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A man in a white shirt uses a spray gun to coat a white vase inside a booth, producing a continuous hissing sound of atomized paint.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA man in a white shirt operates a spray gun inside a white spray booth, directing a fine mist onto a white ceramic vase as the continuous hiss of atomized paint fills the air.\nA man in a white shirt uses a spray gun on a white vase inside a spray booth, producing a continuous hissing sound from the atomized paint.\nThe audio exclusively features the sound of aerosol spray paint being applied, a constant hiss indicating the spray gun is in operation throughout the clip. The visual shows a man in a white t-shirt actively using this spray gun on a decorative vase positioned within a booth.\n\nA man in a white shirt uses a spray gun to coat a white vase inside a booth, producing a continuous hissing sound of atomized paint.", "time_sec": 250.817, "generation_time_seconds": 144.9144, "selection_time_seconds": 105.4644, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 20.0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "194", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A politician addressing a large crowd at an event, speaking into a microphone on stage.", "pred": "A man in a white shirt speaks into a microphone on a stage, with seated dignitaries beside him and a large audience filling the hall behind, all while he delivers a formal speech in Kannada.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A man in a white shirt speaks into a microphone on a stage, with seated dignitaries beside him and a large audience filling the hall behind, all while he delivers a formal speech in Kannada.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA man in a white shirt speaks into a microphone on a stage, with seated dignitaries beside him and a large audience filling the hall behind, all while he delivers a formal speech in Kannada.\nA man in a white shirt speaks into a microphone on a stage, with seated dignitaries beside him and a large audience filling the hall behind, all while he delivers a formal speech in Kannada.\nA man in a white shirt stands on a stage, speaking into a handheld microphone with his right hand while gesturing with his left, as a large audience sits in bleachers behind him and other men in white shirts are seated at a table to his left.\n\nA man in a white shirt speaks into a microphone on a stage, with seated dignitaries beside him and a large audience filling the hall behind, all while he delivers a formal speech in Kannada.", "time_sec": 191.875, "generation_time_seconds": 134.0543, "selection_time_seconds": 56.7058, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 25.81, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "195", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "As a silver train passes by a platform at the train station, the honk echoes through the air accompanied by loud gusts of wind.", "pred": "A stationary camera at a train station captures an empty platform as a loud electronic chime sounds, immediately followed by a powerful train horn and the intense, high-pitched screech of wheels on rails as the train passes at high speed.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A stationary camera at a train station captures an empty platform as a loud electronic chime sounds, immediately followed by a powerful train horn and the intense, high-pitched screech of wheels on rails as the train passes at high speed.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA stationary camera at a train station platform shows an empty track, a pedestrian bridge, and a distant train.\n The audio begins with a loud, high-pitched electronic tone.\n A powerful train horn sounds, followed by the intense, metallic screech of wheels on rails as a train travels at high speed past the camera.\nA stationary camera shows an empty train platform next to a set of tracks.\n An electronic chime sounds, then a loud train horn is heard.\n The train, moving rapidly past the camera, produces a powerful, high-pitched screech from its wheels on the rails.\nThe visual shows a static train station platform, while the audio captures the approach of a train.\n The initial high-pitched electronic chime is a standard warning signal, immediately followed by a powerful train horn.\n As the train passes the camera, the soundscape is dominated by the intense, high-frequency metallic screech of its wheels on the rails, indicating high speed.\n\nA stationary camera at a train station captures an empty platform as a loud electronic chime sounds, immediately followed by a powerful train horn and the intense, high-pitched screech of wheels on rails as the train passes at high speed.", "time_sec": 331.396, "generation_time_seconds": 178.8978, "selection_time_seconds": 152.0586, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 31.58, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "196", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The sound of frogs chirping fills the night as men speak and bang, while a man plays guitar next to a campfire.", "pred": "A person in a boat at night holds a bright light, then a loud, continuous electronic buzz begins.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A person in a boat at night holds a bright light, then a loud, continuous electronic buzz begins.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA person in a boat at night shines a bright light, then a loud, sustained high-pitched electronic tone begins.\nA person holds a bright floodlight in a small boat at night, then a very loud, continuous electronic buzzing tone begins.\nThe individual, wearing a baseball cap and waders, operates a powerful flashlight in a boat, and the audio is dominated by a loud, continuous electronic buzz.\n\nA person in a boat at night holds a bright light, then a loud, continuous electronic buzz begins.", "time_sec": 167.541, "generation_time_seconds": 109.9714, "selection_time_seconds": 56.988, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 8.33, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "197", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "As the mid-size motor vehicle engine accelerates with a slight rattling sound, a driver wearing a helmet shifts gears downward inside the cockpit of the car.", "pred": "Inside a racing vehicle, two occupants in full racing gear are seen from a dashboard camera, with a complex instrument cluster and performance steering wheel, as a very loud, high-pitched engine roars.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "Inside a racing vehicle, two occupants in full racing gear are seen from a dashboard camera, with a complex instrument cluster and performance steering wheel, as a very loud, high-pitched engine roars.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe interior of a racing vehicle is shown from a dashboard-mounted camera, featuring two occupants in full racing gear, a performance steering wheel, and a complex instrument cluster, all while a high-performance engine emits a very loud, sustained, high-pitched roar.\nThe video captures the interior of a racing vehicle, showing two occupants in full racing gear, a complex instrument cluster, and a performance steering wheel, while a loud, high-pitched engine roar dominates the audio.\nThe occupants' helmets, one blue and white, the other white with a sticker, and their racing suits suggest a professional motorsport setting.\n\nInside a racing vehicle, two occupants in full racing gear are seen from a dashboard camera, with a complex instrument cluster and performance steering wheel, as a very loud, high-pitched engine roars.", "time_sec": 254.836, "generation_time_seconds": 179.6006, "selection_time_seconds": 74.2485, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 15.0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "198", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A blue and yellow train passes by on the tracks with loud hissing, a continuous horn, and brief clanking, traveling through the snowy landscape.", "pred": "\\boxed{\\text{A yellow and blue CSX locomotive numbered 6631, equipped with a snowplow, clears a path through deep, white snow under a clear blue sky, accompanied by a loud, sustained, multi-tone train horn.}}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "\\boxed{\\text{A yellow and blue CSX locomotive numbered 6631, equipped with a snowplow, clears a path through deep, white snow under a clear blue sky, accompanied by a loud, sustained, multi-tone train horn.}}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA snow-covered railway scene features a yellow and blue CSX locomotive numbered 6631 actively clearing a path through deep snow with its plow, creating a dynamic spray of white powder under a clear blue sky, while a powerful, multi-tone train horn blasts continuously from the locomotive as it moves.\nI have already performed the necessary analysis of the visual and auditory components of the video. I have identified the specific elements in the scene, including the locomotive's color, markings, number, and operation, as well as the sound of the continuous multi-tone horn. The next logical step is to synthesize this information into a single, concise, and factual sentence that meets the specified constraints.\nA yellow and blue CSX locomotive numbered 6631, equipped with a snowplow, clears a path through deep, white snow under a clear blue sky, accompanied by a loud, sustained, multi-tone train horn.\n\nA yellow and blue CSX locomotive numbered 6631, equipped with a snowplow, clears a path through deep, white snow under a clear blue sky, accompanied by a loud, sustained, multi-tone train horn.\n\n\\boxed{\\text{A yellow and blue CSX locomotive numbered 6631, equipped with a snowplow, clears a path through deep, white snow under a clear blue sky, accompanied by a loud, sustained, multi-tone train horn.}}", "time_sec": 300.484, "generation_time_seconds": 175.6516, "selection_time_seconds": 123.9992, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 26.32, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
