a man in a dark t-shirt and jeans standing before a dark-colored car with its hood propped open in a cluttered garage; the engine's black intake manifold and various hoses are visible under overhead fluorescent lighting, while the audio exclusively features the loud, continuous sound of a toilet flushing and water draining.}", "time_sec": 229.244, "generation_time_seconds": 149.362, "selection_time_seconds": 79.5144, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 18.18, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "200", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The vehicle engine revs loudly as the camera shows the car's engine compartment with the hood up, revealing a cluttered engine bay.", "pred": "A complex network of black hoses, red and black wires, a black pulley system, a silver heat shield, and a black air filter housing fills the engine bay, while the audio features the loud, deep roar and uneven idle of a large internal combustion engine.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A complex network of black hoses, red and black wires, a black pulley system, a silver heat shield, and a black air filter housing fills the engine bay, while the audio features the loud, deep roar and uneven idle of a large internal combustion engine.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA close-up view reveals a complex network of hoses, wires, and mechanical components within an automobile's engine bay, featuring a prominent red tubular bar and silver heat-shielded elements, while a powerful internal combustion engine audibly roars and idles loudly.\nThe scene details a dense, functional mechanical assembly without extraneous parts.\nPhysical components include hoses, wires, a pulley, a red tubular bar, a silver heat shield, and a black air filter housing.\nThe visual suggests a vintage or performance-oriented engine bay due to the bar and heat shielding.\nThe audio consists of a powerful internal combustion engine starting and idling.\nThe engine has a deep, throaty, and uneven idle, indicating a high-displacement configuration like a V8.\nThe sound is dominant and aggressive, contrasting with the stillness of the visual, and suggests a large, potentially modified, vehicle likely being showcased or\nThe engine bay contains a network of black hoses, red and black wires, a black pulley system, a silver heat shield, and a black air filter housing, while the audio features the loud, deep roar and uneven idle of a large, likely V8, internal combustion engine.\n\nA complex network of black hoses, red and black wires, a black pulley system, a silver heat shield, and a black air filter housing fills the engine bay, while the audio features the loud, deep roar and uneven idle of a large internal combustion engine.", "time_sec": 283.459, "generation_time_seconds": 184.563, "selection_time_seconds": 98.0956, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 13.04, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "201", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A woman's voice guides as she and a man work together on a sewing machine, stitching fabric with precision.", "pred": "A person's hands guide purple fabric through a white Janome sewing machine that stitches and cuts simultaneously, accompanied by the machine's operational hum and a voice explaining the overlock function.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A person's hands guide purple fabric through a white Janome sewing machine that stitches and cuts simultaneously, accompanied by the machine's operational hum and a voice explaining the overlock function.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA person's hands guide purple fabric through a white Janome sewing machine, which emits a bright blue light, while a voice explains the machine creates an overlock stitch and cuts excess fabric as it operates.\nThe Janome sewing machine's needle and presser foot are actively engaged with the purple fabric, and the operator's hands are positioned to guide the material, providing a clear visual of the machine performing a simultaneous overlock stitch and cutting action as described in the audio, confirming the described function is being executed in real-time.\nThe machine's needle and presser foot are visibly moving, actively stitching the purple fabric while the operator's hands guide it, matching the description of a simultaneous overlock stitch and cutting process.\n\nA person's hands guide purple fabric through a white Janome sewing machine that stitches and cuts simultaneously, accompanied by the machine's operational hum and a voice explaining the overlock function.", "time_sec": 219.787, "generation_time_seconds": 149.0133, "selection_time_seconds": 70.1122, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 25.0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "202", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man energetically shouting in a lush green rice field as ducks quack and chirp around him, with the wind adding to the lively atmosphere.", "pred": "A man walks along a narrow path through a lush green rice paddy, herding a long line of small yellow ducklings, while the loud, chaotic sounds of many quacking ducks and human speech fill the air.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A man walks along a narrow path through a lush green rice paddy, herding a long line of small yellow ducklings, while the loud, chaotic sounds of many quacking ducks and human speech fill the air.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA man walks along a narrow path through a lush green rice paddy, herding a long line of small yellow ducklings, while the loud, chaotic sounds of many quacking ducks and human speech fill the air.\nThe visual shows a man leading a long line of young ducklings down a path in a rice paddy, with thatched-roof huts and lush green hills in the background, and the audio consists of the prominent, overlapping quacking of many ducks alongside indistinct human speech.\nThe man is walking on a narrow dirt path, and the ducklings are following him in a long, single-file line, indicating he is herding them.\n\nA man walks along a narrow path through a lush green rice paddy, herding a long line of small yellow ducklings, while the loud, chaotic sounds of many quacking ducks and human speech fill the air.", "time_sec": 255.332, "generation_time_seconds": 160.8545, "selection_time_seconds": 93.8216, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 24.39, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "203", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A yellow fire truck accelerates down a highway with emergency sirens blaring, passing by a crowd of people as a man speaks on an intercom.", "pred": "\\boxed{\\text{A yellow fire truck with flashing red lights speeds along a road, its engine roaring and siren wailing, kicking up dust as it passes spectators and barriers under a blue sky.}}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "\\boxed{\\text{A yellow fire truck with flashing red lights speeds along a road, its engine roaring and siren wailing, kicking up dust as it passes spectators and barriers under a blue sky.}}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA yellow fire truck with flashing red lights accelerates down a paved road, its large engine roaring and a high-pitched siren wailing as it passes a concrete barrier and scattered onlookers under a clear blue sky.\nThe scene is outdoors on a sunny day, with a long, straight road bordered by a concrete barrier on one side and a grassy embankment with spectators on the other. A bright yellow fire truck, equipped with a ladder and emergency lights, is the central subject. The sequence shows the truck approaching, then passing the camera's position at high speed, creating a significant amount of dust or smoke behind its rear wheels. The sky is blue with some white clouds, and a distant mountain range is visible. The audio consists of a powerful, deep rumble from the truck's large engine, overlaid with a loud, high-pitched\nA yellow fire truck with flashing red lights speeds along a road, its engine roaring and siren wailing, kicking up dust as it passes spectators and barriers under a blue sky.\n\nA yellow fire truck with flashing red lights speeds along a road, its engine roaring and siren wailing, kicking up dust as it passes spectators and barriers under a blue sky.\n\n\\boxed{\\text{A yellow fire truck with flashing red lights speeds along a road, its engine roaring and siren wailing, kicking up dust as it passes spectators and barriers under a blue sky.}}", "time_sec": 266.606, "generation_time_seconds": 149.0783, "selection_time_seconds": 116.2152, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 15.38, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "204", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man in a green hat holds a glass in his hands while speaking, with small birds chirping in the distance and his backside one car.", "pred": "A man in a green beanie and plaid shirt stands in a driveway next to a black truck, holding two differently colored toy guns as he speaks.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A man in a green beanie and plaid shirt stands in a driveway next to a black truck, holding two differently colored toy guns as he speaks.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA man in a green beanie and plaid shirt stands in a driveway, holding a colorful object before showing two differently colored toy guns to the camera.\nA man in a plaid shirt and green beanie stands in a driveway, holding a multi-colored object before displaying two different toy guns to the camera.\nThe man, wearing a green beanie, a plaid shirt, and blue jeans, stands in a paved driveway next to a black pickup truck, holding two distinct toy guns: one blue with a yellow trigger and one orange with a black trigger, with a wooden fence and green bushes in the background.\n\nA man in a green beanie and plaid shirt stands in a driveway next to a black truck, holding two differently colored toy guns as he speaks.", "time_sec": 199.227, "generation_time_seconds": 119.5144, "selection_time_seconds": 78.6381, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 11.76, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "205", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the video, a helicopter with a flag flies in the sky as a man talks in the background it show on a television nwes.", "pred": "A dark military helicopter with visible rotor blades flies across a grey, overcast sky, while the audio exclusively features the loud, high-pitched roar of a jet engine.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A dark military helicopter with visible rotor blades flies across a grey, overcast sky, while the audio exclusively features the loud, high-pitched roar of a jet engine.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA television screen shows a dark military helicopter flying against a grey sky, while the audio captures the loud, powerful, and roaring sound of a jet engine.\nThe visual shows a helicopter with rotor blades, but the sound is that of a jet engine, which is a contradiction.\nThe on-screen helicopter is dark, likely military, with visible rotor blades, flying in a grey, overcast sky, while the accompanying audio exclusively features the loud, high-pitched roar of a jet engine starting and accelerating.\n\nA dark military helicopter with visible rotor blades flies across a grey, overcast sky, while the audio exclusively features the loud, high-pitched roar of a jet engine.", "time_sec": 192.382, "generation_time_seconds": 126.4143, "selection_time_seconds": 65.3346, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 20.0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "206", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A woman cuts fabric with red scissors and a iron scale on a sewing machine while vibrations from the machine are heard with a woman speaking.", "pred": "A person's hands operate a white Singer sewing machine, cutting patterned fabric with scissors as the machine emits a loud, rapid mechanical whirring, followed by a woman speaking in Spanish.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A person's hands operate a white Singer sewing machine, cutting patterned fabric with scissors as the machine emits a loud, rapid mechanical whirring, followed by a woman speaking in Spanish.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA person's hands are operating a white Singer sewing machine, cutting a piece of patterned fabric with scissors, while the machine produces a loud, rapid mechanical whirring sound before a woman speaks in Spanish.\nA person's hands guide fabric through a white Singer sewing machine, then use scissors to cut it, accompanied by the machine's loud, rhythmic whirring and a woman speaking in Spanish.\nA person's hands are operating a white Singer sewing machine, cutting a piece of patterned fabric with scissors, while the machine produces a loud, rapid mechanical whirring sound before a woman speaks in Spanish.\n\nA person's hands operate a white Singer sewing machine, cutting patterned fabric with scissors as the machine emits a loud, rapid mechanical whirring, followed by a woman speaking in Spanish.", "time_sec": 242.617, "generation_time_seconds": 162.3593, "selection_time_seconds": 79.8611, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 38.89, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "207", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the midst of a woman speaking, a dog growls and barks, as a person holds a piece of paper next to an envelope, with a set of cards featuring a pattern and a card displaying a picture of a dog.", "pred": "A person's hands assemble a green and cream-colored card with ornate patterns while a woman explains using adhesive for panels, and a dog barks immediately after she says the word 'next'.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A person's hands assemble a green and cream-colored card with ornate patterns while a woman explains using adhesive for panels, and a dog barks immediately after she says the word 'next'.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA person's hands assemble a green and cream-colored card with ornate patterns, while a woman's voice explains she is attaching panels with adhesive, and a dog barks immediately after she says the word 'next'.\nA woman's hands assemble a card with ornate green and cream patterns while she explains using adhesive for panels, and her speech is immediately followed by a distinct dog bark.\nThe speaker's hands position a card panel onto a larger base card, the card has a green patterned background with a white ornate frame, and the physical act of attaching the panel is audible as a soft thud.\n\nA person's hands assemble a green and cream-colored card with ornate patterns while a woman explains using adhesive for panels, and a dog barks immediately after she says the word 'next'.", "time_sec": 193.182, "generation_time_seconds": 131.0954, "selection_time_seconds": 61.1765, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 24.39, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "208", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The woman in the foreground speaks as bacon sizzles in a bowl of water on the stove, accompanied by the thumping of chicken leg piece.", "pred": "A person's hands transfer raw chicken drumsticks from a white plate into a metal pot on a gas stove, accompanied by sizzling sounds and a female voice stating, \"adding our drumsticks.\"", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A person's hands transfer raw chicken drumsticks from a white plate into a metal pot on a gas stove, accompanied by sizzling sounds and a female voice stating, \"adding our drumsticks.\"", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe scene is a kitchen with a gas stove. A person's hands are visible; one holds a white plate containing several raw chicken drumsticks. The other hand picks up a drumstick and transfers it into a large metal pot situated on the stove.\nThe person is transferring raw chicken drumsticks from a white plate into a metal pot on a stove.\nThe audio contains a female voice speaking, saying, \"adding our drumsticks.\"\nA person's hands are seen transferring raw chicken drumsticks from a white plate into a metal pot on a gas stove, accompanied by the sound of sizzling and a female voice stating, \"adding our drumsticks.\"\n\nA person's hands transfer raw chicken drumsticks from a white plate into a metal pot on a gas stove, accompanied by sizzling sounds and a female voice stating, \"adding our drumsticks.\"", "time_sec": 221.979, "generation_time_seconds": 127.8037, "selection_time_seconds": 93.5466, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 16.67, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "209", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A child and a man share a laugh while a frog gurgles, as a man speaks, with visuals of a person holding a small frog in their hand next to a dog and in grass one small cycle is there.", "pred": "A large green frog is held in a hand, its mouth wide open, while a dog's head is below and green foliage is in the background.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A large green frog is held in a hand, its mouth wide open, while a dog's head is below and green foliage is in the background.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA large, green frog is held in a person's hand, its mouth wide open, facing the camera, while a dog's head is visible below and green foliage in the background.\nA large, green frog, held in a person's hand, has its mouth wide open, its body facing the camera, while a dog's head is visible below and green foliage is in the background.\nA large, green frog, held in a person's hand, has its mouth wide open, its body facing the camera, while a dog's head is visible below and green foliage is in the background.\n\nA large green frog is held in a hand, its mouth wide open, while a dog's head is below and green foliage is in the background.", "time_sec": 189.388, "generation_time_seconds": 123.3864, "selection_time_seconds": 64.9957, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 11.11, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "210", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the midst of clanking plastic and a car engine revving, holding a white paper and a purple wire.", "pred": "A hand uses a flat tool to pry a black plastic panel from a vehicle's interior, accompanied by the sound of plastic snapping and a male voice instructing on using a flathead screwdriver to remove a clip.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A hand uses a flat tool to pry a black plastic panel from a vehicle's interior, accompanied by the sound of plastic snapping and a male voice instructing on using a flathead screwdriver to remove a clip.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe camera, from a first-person perspective, shows a hand using a flathead screwdriver to pry up a black plastic trim panel, while a male voice instructs that a plastic clip should be pried out with a regular flat screwdriver, followed by a loud, sharp click.\nA hand uses a flat-bladed tool to pry a black plastic panel from a vehicle's interior, accompanied by the sound of plastic snapping and a male voice giving instructions on using a flathead screwdriver to remove a clip.\nThe camera view is shaky and close-up, showing a hand manipulating a black plastic component with a flat metal tool, consistent with the action of prying. The audio reveals a man speaking, stating, \"There's a plastic clip right here. You can use a regular flat screwdriver.\" Immediately after, a sharp, cracking sound occurs, matching the audio of plastic being snapped or popped. The hand then moves to flip the panel, as the speaker continues, \"Flip this. Now...\"\n\nA hand uses a flat tool to pry a black plastic panel from a vehicle's interior, accompanied by the sound of plastic snapping and a male voice instructing on using a flathead screwdriver to remove a clip.", "time_sec": 257.847, "generation_time_seconds": 160.3174, "selection_time_seconds": 96.907, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 5.88, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "211", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The woman on the couch is seen blowing her nose into a napkin while repeatedly sneezing and coughing.", "pred": "A woman wrapped in a blanket and scarf sits on a couch, holding a thermometer and tissue while coughing.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A woman wrapped in a blanket and scarf sits on a couch, holding a thermometer and tissue while coughing.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA woman wrapped in a beige blanket and a grey scarf sits on a couch, holding a white digital thermometer in one hand and using a white tissue to cover her nose while coughing.\nA woman with brown hair sits on a light-colored couch, wearing a grey scarf and a beige blanket over her shoulders.\nShe holds a white digital thermometer in her left hand and uses a white tissue in her right hand to cover her nose and mouth while coughing.\n\nA woman wrapped in a blanket and scarf sits on a couch, holding a thermometer and tissue while coughing.", "time_sec": 168.579, "generation_time_seconds": 115.2784, "selection_time_seconds": 52.9656, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 28.57, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "212", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The sound of whooshing and humming fills the air as a man speaks, accompanied by distant squeaks, while young men play basketball on the court, with a logo-adorned speaker nearby.", "pred": "A young male athlete with a medal and a necklace is shown in a close-up in a gymnasium, immediately following a sports-themed logo, with the sound of a basketball being dribbled in the background.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A young male athlete with a medal and a necklace is shown in a close-up in a gymnasium, immediately following a sports-themed logo, with the sound of a basketball being dribbled in the background.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe introductory logo for \"Rivals Yahoo! Sports\" is followed by a close-up of a young man with a medal and a necklace who identifies himself as Emon Giddens from the Dallas Mustangs, as the sound of a basketball being dribbled is heard.\nA young man with a medal and a necklace, identified by his voice as Emon Giddens from the Dallas Mustangs, is shown in a close-up shot as the sound of a basketball being dribbled is heard in the background.\nA young male athlete with a medal around his neck and a necklace with a pendant is shown in a close-up in what appears to be a gymnasium, immediately following a sports-themed logo, with the sound of a basketball being dribbled in the background.\n\nA young male athlete with a medal and a necklace is shown in a close-up in a gymnasium, immediately following a sports-themed logo, with the sound of a basketball being dribbled in the background.", "time_sec": 270.659, "generation_time_seconds": 142.4398, "selection_time_seconds": 127.4804, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 17.14, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "213", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man in a hat cooks food on a grill outside, accompanied by the sizzle of frying food and music as he speaks.", "pred": "A man in a hat and glasses stirs food in a pan on a portable stove; a male voice asks about breakfast, followed by the sound of sizzling food and a brief \"bleep\" sound.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A man in a hat and glasses stirs food in a pan on a portable stove; a male voice asks about breakfast, followed by the sound of sizzling food and a brief \"bleep\" sound.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA man in a hat and glasses stirs food in a pan on an outdoor stove while a male voice asks about breakfast.\nA man wearing a hat and glasses cooks in a pan on a portable stove; a male voice asks about breakfast, followed by the sound of sizzling food and a brief \"bleep\" sound.\nA man in a hat and glasses stirs food in a pan on a portable stove; a male voice asks about breakfast, followed by the sound of sizzling food and a brief \"bleep\" sound.\n\nA man in a hat and glasses stirs food in a pan on a portable stove; a male voice asks about breakfast, followed by the sound of sizzling food and a brief \"bleep\" sound.", "time_sec": 221.695, "generation_time_seconds": 133.4133, "selection_time_seconds": 87.3666, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 25.0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "214", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the midst of a dark night lighting with rain falling outside .", "pred": "A completely black visual field is accompanied by a loud, continuous, low-frequency mechanical rumble.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A completely black visual field is accompanied by a loud, continuous, low-frequency mechanical rumble.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe visual is completely black with no discernible objects, while the audio is dominated by a loud, low-frequency mechanical rumble, suggesting a large engine or heavy machinery is operating.\nThe audio is characterized by a very loud, continuous, low-frequency rumble, consistent with a large engine or heavy machinery operating at close range.\nThe visual field is entirely black, providing no information about the environment or objects. The audio consists of a single, overwhelming, low-frequency mechanical rumble, which suggests the source is extremely close to the microphone and operating at a steady, powerful level. There are no other discernible sounds such as speech, music, or ambient environmental noises in the recording.\n\nA completely black visual field is accompanied by a loud, continuous, low-frequency mechanical rumble.", "time_sec": 182.621, "generation_time_seconds": 119.1535, "selection_time_seconds": 63.2977, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
